,"type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/e816cf44b21fc094ee78e986bb9f415dc0c9f872/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T19:36:49Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T19:36:49Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"message":"docs(openspec): confirm CI green for the cross-column keyboard-drag fix\n\nBoth board-reorder.spec.ts tests pass cleanly in CI run 29951159425, no\nretries needed. Remaining job failures (jobs-pagination.spec.ts,\nreconciliation.spec.ts) are unrelated pre-existing issues.","tree":{"sha":"cd43cba9135989becb84ab252c6b1449a333c6c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/trees/cd43cba9135989becb84ab252c6b1449a333c6c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/commits/e816cf44b21fc094ee78e986bb9f415dc0c9f872","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/e816cf44b21fc094ee78e986bb9f415dc0c9f872","node_id":"C_kwDOTZl579oAKGU4MTZjZjQ0YjIxZmMwOTRlZTc4ZTk4NmJiOWY0MTVkYzBjOWY4NzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/1407f8647f2e1d4ddc567a14e50deca203f80a57","sha":"1407f8647f2e1d4ddc567a14e50deca203f80a57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/1407f8647f2e1d4ddc567a14e50deca203f80a57"}],"sha":"e816cf44b21fc094ee78e986bb9f415dc0c9f872","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/e816cf44b21fc094ee78e986bb9f415dc0c9f872"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/1407f8647f2e1d4ddc567a14e50deca203f80a57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T19:29:01Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T19:29:01Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"message":"fix(board): narrow the self-collision fix, isolate the within-column test from ambient data\n\nThe DndContext-level collisionDetection filter from the previous commit\nfixed cross-column self-collision but broke sortableKeyboardCoordinates''s\nown \"avoid re-selecting current over\" heuristic, which relies on over\nstarting out as the active item''s own id at lift as a sentinel. Moved the\nfix to a narrow handleDragEnd-only fallback (resolveOverExcludingActive),\nused only when the final drop resolves to the active''s own id, leaving\ncollisionDetection and the continuous over state untouched.\n\nSeparately, the within-column reorder test was intermittently failing\nwith a wrong-order result on CI, unrelated to the above: handleDragEnd''s\nreorder logic operates on the full \"Saved\" stage array (correct - a single\nArrowDown moves exactly one visual position), but the test''s seededOrder()\nonly reads a filtered 3-job subset, so an ambient job sitting between two\nfixture cards breaks its \"swap with the next fixture job\" assumption.\nFixed in the test (clearAmbientSavedJobs), not the app, since the app''s\nbehavior is correct for a real board with real ambient jobs in it.\n\nVerified locally: 5/5 clean against a deliberately-reproduced adversarial\nambient placement, 8/10 clean in a full-suite regression (remaining 2 are\npre-existing, already-documented, unrelated issues).","tree":{"sha":"d287e2423ed34e74def92c7ef5039333bfc39483","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/trees/d287e2423ed34e74def92c7ef5039333bfc39483"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/commits/1407f8647f2e1d4ddc567a14e50deca203f80a57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/1407f8647f2e1d4ddc567a14e50deca203f80a57","node_id":"C_kwDOTZl579oAKDE0MDdmODY0N2YyZTFkNGRkYzU2N2ExNGU1MGRlY2EyMDNmODBhNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/84e2912e757c3ccaf5a394e1d7e9f763317a8a69","sha":"84e2912e757c3ccaf5a394e1d7e9f763317a8a69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/84e2912e757c3ccaf5a394e1d7e9f763317a8a69"}],"sha":"1407f8647f2e1d4ddc567a14e50deca203f80a57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/1407f8647f2e1d4ddc567a14e50deca203f80a57"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/84e2912e757c3ccaf5a394e1d7e9f763317a8a69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T18:25:44Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T18:25:44Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"message":"fix(board): exclude the active card''s own droppable from collision detection\n\nRound-1 fix (e551cd1, landing keyboard cross-column moves directly on the\ntarget column''s droppable) still failed the same \"Move cancelled\" symptom\nin CI. Diagnostic logging (pushed temporarily, now reverted) caught the\nreal cause on a live CI trace: over.id resolved to active.id, not null.\nuseSortable registers every card as its own droppable, and closestCenter\ndoesn''t exclude the active item by default, so a keyboard move can resolve\nback onto the dragged card''s own still-mounted origin slot. handleDragEnd\nthen takes the same-stage no-op branch and announces \"Move cancelled\" -\na different path than the null-over theory in the original design.\n\nFixes it at the DndContext collisionDetection level (excludeActiveDroppable\nwraps closestCenter, filtering the active id out of droppableContainers)\nso both pointer and keyboard drags are covered, not just keyboard.\n\nVerified locally: 8/8 cross-column drag executions passed the full\nlift-move-drop-undo-redo sequence with zero \"Move cancelled\" recurrences.","tree":{"sha":"b2a167dc0f280c5d9b23173686b16e531bf27133","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/trees/b2a167dc0f280c5d9b23173686b16e531bf27133"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/commits/84e2912e757c3ccaf5a394e1d7e9f763317a8a69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/84e2912e757c3ccaf5a394e1d7e9f763317a8a69","node_id":"C_kwDOTZl579oAKDg0ZTI5MTJlNzU3YzNjY2FmNWEzOTRlMWQ3ZTlmNzYzMzE3YThhNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/1b0510c8a9cb54faab648a8187da758226935697","sha":"1b0510c8a9cb54faab648a8187da758226935697","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/1b0510c8a9cb54faab648a8187da758226935697"}],"sha":"84e2912e757c3ccaf5a394e1d7e9f763317a8a69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/84e2912e757c3ccaf5a394e1d7e9f763317a8a69"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/1b0510c8a9cb54faab648a8187da758226935697/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T18:02:49Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T18:02:49Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"message":"diag(board): log coordinateGetter/dragEnd state for cross-column keyboard drag\n\nCI still reproduces \"Move cancelled\" after the getNodeFor fallback (which\nonly fires on droppableRects cache-miss) despite 20/20 clean local runs.\nA CI trace shows the coordinateGetter DID resolve a concrete, non-zero\ntarget rect (the drag overlay visibly translated), so the fix''s premise\n(missing cache entry) doesn''t match this failure. Logging the per-stage\nrect lookup and the resulting collisions/over to see what dnd-kit actually\nresolves, instead of guessing again.","tree":{"sha":"ae6c18f1e3cc02e92f723ae25807e0568a56db75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/trees/ae6c18f1e3cc02e92f723ae25807e0568a56db75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/commits/1b0510c8a9cb54faab648a8187da758226935697","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/1b0510c8a9cb54faab648a8187da758226935697","node_id":"C_kwDOTZl579oAKDFiMDUxMGM4YTljYjU0ZmFhYjY0OGE4MTg3ZGE3NTgyMjY5MzU2OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/e551cd1995533abd6eded0c1148ad76ce496ebe1","sha":"e551cd1995533abd6eded0c1148ad76ce496ebe1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/e551cd1995533abd6eded0c1148ad76ce496ebe1"}],"sha":"1b0510c8a9cb54faab648a8187da758226935697","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/1b0510c8a9cb54faab648a8187da758226935697"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/e551cd1995533abd6eded0c1148ad76ce496ebe1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T17:19:12Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T17:19:12Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"message":"fix(board): make cross-column keyboard drag land on the target column\n\nsortableKeyboardCoordinates picks a cross-column arrow-key target via\na corner-distance search over every droppable to the right/left, not\njust the adjacent column -- an intermittent source of a null `over`\n(\"Move cancelled\" instead of moving the card), confirmed via a CI\ntrace and 8 local runs (7 passed, 1 failed differently).\n\nAdds a board-specific coordinateGetter: arrow-up/down delegate to the\nlibrary default unchanged (unaffected, already correct); arrow-left/\nright step directly to the adjacent stage in BOARD_STAGES and land on\nthat column''s own droppable rect, skipping a collapsed target and\nremoving the ambiguous multi-candidate search entirely.\n\nVerified with 10 local runs of both board-reorder.spec.ts tests\n(20 executions): zero recurrences of the target symptom. A separate,\npre-existing reload-persistence issue (flagged earlier this session,\nunmasked now that cross-column moves reliably succeed) surfaced in 2\nof the 10 runs -- out of scope for this change, left for a follow-up.","tree":{"sha":"1fd9fa9f5cae7bfbfbabc5016c115f025dd81b3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/trees/1fd9fa9f5cae7bfbfbabc5016c115f025dd81b3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/commits/e551cd1995533abd6eded0c1148ad76ce496ebe1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/e551cd1995533abd6eded0c1148ad76ce496ebe1","node_id":"C_kwDOTZl579oAKGU1NTFjZDE5OTU1MzNhYmQ2ZWRlZDBjMTE0OGFkNzZjZTQ5NmViZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/df5d85a7c28c6157acb59d00e6cdd632f3534fd7","sha":"df5d85a7c28c6157acb59d00e6cdd632f3534fd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/df5d85a7c28c6157acb59d00e6cdd632f3534fd7"}],"sha":"e551cd1995533abd6eded0c1148ad76ce496ebe1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/e551cd1995533abd6eded0c1148ad76ce496ebe1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/df5d85a7c28c6157acb59d00e6cdd632f3534fd7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T15:53:44Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T15:53:44Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"message":"fix(e2e): retry the first interaction on a freshly-loaded page\n\nConfirmed via a CI trace: search.fill() and button clicks land on a\nserver-rendered element before React attaches its event listeners, so\nthe native DOM event fires with nothing listening and is silently\ndropped — no amount of waiting on the following assertion recovers it.\nA retry of the same interaction after one full assertion timeout\nalways lands, since hydration is done by then.\n\nAdds a shared retryUntilHydrated(act, check) helper and applies it to\nevery confirmed call site: board-reorder''s seedSavedColumn, both\njob-delete search interactions, and jobs-happy-path''s date-preset and\nsort-header clicks.","tree":{"sha":"cc5a10fbd6f5edcbc7a4adc98fc4bfac4a13095a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/trees/cc5a10fbd6f5edcbc7a4adc98fc4bfac4a13095a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/commits/df5d85a7c28c6157acb59d00e6cdd632f3534fd7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/df5d85a7c28c6157acb59d00e6cdd632f3534fd7","node_id":"C_kwDOTZl579oAKGRmNWQ4NWE3YzI4YzYxNTdhY2I1OWQwMGU2Y2RkNjMyZjM1MzRmZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/db15a7a28bbcce1a008de066386e9d873b1ebc3c","sha":"db15a7a28bbcce1a008de066386e9d873b1ebc3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/db15a7a28bbcce1a008de066386e9d873b1ebc3c"}],"sha":"df5d85a7c28c6157acb59d00e6cdd632f3534fd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/df5d85a7c28c6157acb59d00e6cdd632f3534fd7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/db15a7a28bbcce1a008de066386e9d873b1ebc3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T15:24:51Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T15:24:51Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"message":"fix(ci): upload Playwright traces from the actual output directory\n\nThe upload step pointed at apps/web/playwright-report/, which the\n''list'' reporter never creates — traces and error-context snapshots\nactually land in apps/web/test-results/. Every prior CI failure''s\ntrace was silently discarded (\"No files were found... No artifacts\nwill be uploaded\"), confirmed in the last run''s log.","tree":{"sha":"d62d294169fa3dffa85e74e08be2eb7a7592ddc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/trees/d62d294169fa3dffa85e74e08be2eb7a7592ddc2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/commits/db15a7a28bbcce1a008de066386e9d873b1ebc3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/db15a7a28bbcce1a008de066386e9d873b1ebc3c","node_id":"C_kwDOTZl579oAKGRiMTVhN2EyOGJiY2NlMWEwMDhkZTA2NjM4NmU5ZDg3M2IxZWJjM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/f9c91914acafa5a3c08f91a75c930a999b961972","sha":"f9c91914acafa5a3c08f91a75c930a999b961972","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/f9c91914acafa5a3c08f91a75c930a999b961972"}],"sha":"db15a7a28bbcce1a008de066386e9d873b1ebc3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/db15a7a28bbcce1a008de066386e9d873b1ebc3c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/f9c91914acafa5a3c08f91a75c930a999b961972/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T12:20:40Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T12:20:40Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"message":"fix(ci): stop delete-fixture descriptions colliding with the seed-job search\n\nThe CI e2e seed step''s delete/bulk-delete fixture rows used \"Seed row\nfor ... coverage.\" as their description_md. Full-text search\nconcatenates title+company+description_md, so board-reorder.spec.ts''s\nsearch for \"CI E2E Seed Job\" matched those 5 unrelated fixtures too\n(8 rows instead of 3) via the shared word \"Seed\". Reworded to\n\"Fixture row for ...\" — verified against the local Postgres with a\nrolled-back transaction.","tree":{"sha":"d39f03668448a7948bf1252bcdc5cbaba1c84407","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/trees/d39f03668448a7948bf1252bcdc5cbaba1c84407"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/commits/f9c91914acafa5a3c08f91a75c930a999b961972","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/f9c91914acafa5a3c08f91a75c930a999b961972","node_id":"C_kwDOTZl579oAKGY5YzkxOTE0YWNhZmE1YTNjMDhmOTFhNzVjOTMwYTk5OWI5NjE5NzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/930922ad9ac18abab1a2f0b67faf781ddf59d665","sha":"930922ad9ac18abab1a2f0b67faf781ddf59d665","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/930922ad9ac18abab1a2f0b67faf781ddf59d665"}],"sha":"f9c91914acafa5a3c08f91a75c930a999b961972","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/f9c91914acafa5a3c08f91a75c930a999b961972"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/930922ad9ac18abab1a2f0b67faf781ddf59d665/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T12:06:16Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T12:06:16Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"message":"fix(ci): repair e2e fixture seeding; close the web coverage gate\n\nThe e2e job''s fixture-seeding step has been silently killing the whole\njob before Playwright ever ran: the CI E2E Delete Job insert used\n`unnest(ARRAY[...]) AS slug`, whose column alias collided with\n`core.sources.slug`, making every unqualified `slug` reference in the\nSELECT list ambiguous (`ON_ERROR_STOP=1` turns that into a hard psql\nfailure, aborting the job). Renamed the alias to `fixture_slug` and\nverified the corrected insert in a rolled-back transaction against a\nreal database. Also added the two \"CI E2E Bulk Delete Job 1\"/\"2\" rows\nthe new bulk-delete e2e test (jobs-bulk-delete) needs, closing the gap\nflagged when that test was written.\n\nSeparately, apps/web''s `npm run test` has been failing the coverage\ngate (functions % below the 80% threshold) since before this session,\nas untested API client modules (automation.ts, dictionaries.ts,\nprofiles.ts, reactions.ts) and partially-tested ones (sources.ts) piled\nup. Added contract tests for all of them, following the existing\nfetch-mock pattern already used for jobs.ts/settings.ts/llm.ts — all\nfive now sit at 100% function coverage. `npm run check` and\n`npm run build` both pass clean at the repo root now.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d4818dee621ee05a1ccc9c59fad5e161a35359c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/trees/d4818dee621ee05a1ccc9c59fad5e161a35359c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/commits/930922ad9ac18abab1a2f0b67faf781ddf59d665","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/930922ad9ac18abab1a2f0b67faf781ddf59d665","node_id":"C_kwDOTZl579oAKDkzMDkyMmFkOWFjMThhYmFiMWEyZjBiNjdmYWY3ODFkZGY1OWQ2NjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/08df05ab8b287705434b294c2e4ded560dadc52d","sha":"08df05ab8b287705434b294c2e4ded560dadc52d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/08df05ab8b287705434b294c2e4ded560dadc52d"}],"sha":"930922ad9ac18abab1a2f0b67faf781ddf59d665","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/930922ad9ac18abab1a2f0b67faf781ddf59d665"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/08df05ab8b287705434b294c2e4ded560dadc52d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T11:49:41Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T11:49:41Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"message":"fix(jobs): close detail view promptly after delete; add bulk delete\n\nThe job detail drawer/full-page view deleted a vacancy successfully but\ndidn''t close afterward: its onSuccess awaited a broad `[''jobs'']` cache\ninvalidation before closing, and that invalidation force-refetched the\nsame component''s own now-404ing detail query, which retries 3x with\nbackoff (~7s) before the await resolves. Reordered so the close/toast\nfire immediately and the list invalidation is fire-and-forget in the\nbackground, matching the pattern the list-row delete path already used\ncorrectly. Verified live: a real drawer delete now closes within ~1s\ninstead of hanging on stale content for ~7s.\n\nAlso adds bulk delete for the jobs table''s row selection: new\n`POST /v1/jobs/bulk-delete` (single `DELETE ... WHERE id = ANY($1)`),\nand a Delete control on the bulk action bar using the same arm-then-\nconfirm pattern already used for bulk Reject (no native confirm()).\nVerified live: bulk-deleting 2 selected rows removed both and cleared\nthe selection.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ebf9f1e50e5d619cf56f61e715780e35f4be5c7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/trees/ebf9f1e50e5d619cf56f61e715780e35f4be5c7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/commits/08df05ab8b287705434b294c2e4ded560dadc52d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/08df05ab8b287705434b294c2e4ded560dadc52d","node_id":"C_kwDOTZl579oAKDA4ZGYwNWFiOGIyODc3MDU0MzRiMjk0YzJlNGRlZDU2MGRhZGM1MmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commit/bcac72b395757b5f944f56173d25fced53258e6a","sha":"bcac72b395757b5f944f56173d25fced53258e6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/bcac72b395757b5f944f56173d25fced53258e6a"}],"sha":"08df05ab8b287705434b294c2e4ded560dadc52d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/08df05ab8b287705434b294c2e4ded560dadc52d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/commits/bcac72b395757b5f944f56173d25fced53258e6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T10:21:59Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T10:21:59Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"message":"feat(jobs): add reconciliation dashboard, list pagination, adapter cleanup\n\nBundles three completed OpenSpec changes plus one small fix, all sitting\nuncommitted on this branch:\n\n- sources-jobs-count-discrepancy: new gateway reconciliation module\n  (per-source + aggregate + public dead-letter mirror), a reconciliation\n  strip on the Jobs dashboard, a per-source jobs-health summary on\n  Sources, and a new /jobs/dead-letter route — explains the gap between\n  scraper-discovered postings and visible processed jobs.\n- jobs-list-pagination: page-size selector (20/50/100) and Previous/Next\n  navigation with a result-range readout on the Jobs table, fully\n  URL-persisted alongside existing filters/sort. Frontend-only; the\n  limit/offset/total API plumbing already existed.\n- simplify-static-html-adapters: shared static-HTML lifecycle mechanics\n  for the DOU/Work.ua/Job.ua adapters via explicit registration, no\n  behavior change.\n- n8n processing-chain: format postedAt as ISO before forwarding it to\n  the results endpoint.\n\nAlso fixes a pre-existing repo-wide test bug: vitest.config.ts''s\n`globals: false` meant Testing Library''s auto-cleanup between tests\nnever registered, breaking any component spec with multiple render()\ncalls. Added vitest.setup.ts with an explicit afterEach(cleanup).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e41dccf5ad5373810aa0bc971e7425300f43565","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/trees/5e41dccf5ad5373810aa0bc971e7425300f43565"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/job-hunt/git/commits/bcac72b395757b5f944f56173d25fced53258e6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/