":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/53cb8793ae56c555382befd81505a513ea579dbf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:15:17Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:15:17Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"fix(disclosure): warn about a lost trigger only on a close, and focus a confirmation once\n\n- useDisclosure reported a lost trigger for a panel that mounted closed\n  while focus sat on the body, where nothing had been handed back. It now\n  reports only an open to closed transition.\n- InlineConfirm pulled focus back to its first stop on every commit when the\n  caller passed a new `initialFocusRef` object each render. The open effect\n  now depends on the open state alone.\n- The destructive labeling specs run the silent case while the warn-once key\n  is unspent, so it can fail.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7163641c917782d2254a493a4c0bac790378eee0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/trees/7163641c917782d2254a493a4c0bac790378eee0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/commits/53cb8793ae56c555382befd81505a513ea579dbf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/53cb8793ae56c555382befd81505a513ea579dbf","node_id":"C_kwDOTZnxtNoAKDUzY2I4NzkzYWU1NmM1NTUzODJiZWZkODE1MDVhNTEzZWE1NzlkYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/40e79a07969f9357b2d06d04b74227d5b66d66e3","sha":"40e79a07969f9357b2d06d04b74227d5b66d66e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/40e79a07969f9357b2d06d04b74227d5b66d66e3"}],"sha":"53cb8793ae56c555382befd81505a513ea579dbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/53cb8793ae56c555382befd81505a513ea579dbf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/40e79a07969f9357b2d06d04b74227d5b66d66e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:15:17Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:15:17Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"fix(panel): keep the seeded theme and report a caught failure once\n\n- ThemeProvider lost its `defaultTheme` seed whenever React unsubscribed and\n  subscribed again without rendering, as StrictMode and a retained\n  CollapsibleSection both do. Each subscription now restores the seed the\n  panel mounted with.\n- The PanelErrorBoundary fallback announced the failure and took focus again\n  on every replayed mount effect. A latch reports it once per fallback.\n- SaveActionBar closed the saved message at once for a\n  `savedMessageDurationMs` of Infinity, NaN, or more than 2,147,483,647. Such\n  a duration now reads as zero, so the message stays up until\n  `saveRequestedAt` changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0185751a0c4e9bf40d08830bd6216c7ed577bb5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/trees/0185751a0c4e9bf40d08830bd6216c7ed577bb5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/commits/40e79a07969f9357b2d06d04b74227d5b66d66e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/40e79a07969f9357b2d06d04b74227d5b66d66e3","node_id":"C_kwDOTZnxtNoAKDQwZTc5YTA3OTY5ZjkzNTdiMmQwNmQwNGI3NDIyN2Q1YjY2ZDY2ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/e9ee13f2ea3abdd6a8d2554417ca21a2c0f9fc03","sha":"e9ee13f2ea3abdd6a8d2554417ca21a2c0f9fc03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/e9ee13f2ea3abdd6a8d2554417ca21a2c0f9fc03"}],"sha":"40e79a07969f9357b2d06d04b74227d5b66d66e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/40e79a07969f9357b2d06d04b74227d5b66d66e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/e9ee13f2ea3abdd6a8d2554417ca21a2c0f9fc03/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:15:17Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:15:17Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"fix(utils): stop the shared clock for a cadence no timer can hold\n\n- A `tickMs` above 2,147,483,647 ms overflowed the timer and fired as fast\n  as the engine allows, re-rendering every age on the panel. The shared\n  clock and the stale wake in useClockReading now arm no timer for it, the\n  same as a cadence of zero. `isTimerDelay` and `MAX_TIMER_DELAY_MS` in\n  shared-clock.ts are the one statement of that rule.\n- The formatter cache joined a locale list on a comma, so the rejected tag\n  \"en-US,en\" shared a slot with the list [\"en-US\", \"en\"] and handed it the\n  runtime default formatter. A list now joins on a character no tag holds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff91779ef08d85f87d2b94c9fa8362b2268b98a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/trees/ff91779ef08d85f87d2b94c9fa8362b2268b98a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/commits/e9ee13f2ea3abdd6a8d2554417ca21a2c0f9fc03","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/e9ee13f2ea3abdd6a8d2554417ca21a2c0f9fc03","node_id":"C_kwDOTZnxtNoAKGU5ZWUxM2YyZWEzYWJkZDZhOGQyNTU0NDE3Y2EyMWEyYzBmOWZjMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/ff0e8621a5ad89f5b3a97f4588778d6df7c50070","sha":"ff0e8621a5ad89f5b3a97f4588778d6df7c50070","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/ff0e8621a5ad89f5b3a97f4588778d6df7c50070"}],"sha":"e9ee13f2ea3abdd6a8d2554417ca21a2c0f9fc03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/e9ee13f2ea3abdd6a8d2554417ca21a2c0f9fc03"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/ff0e8621a5ad89f5b3a97f4588778d6df7c50070/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:15:17Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:15:17Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"refactor(styles): let unused fragment and token text drop out of each entry\n\nA bundler cannot prove a top-level `[...].join(\"\\n\")` or an unannotated call\nfree of side effects, so every entry kept style fragments, the token sheet\nbuilder, and all three palettes whether or not anything it exports reads\nthem. The fragments that interpolate nothing are now single template\nliterals, and the initializers that remain calls carry a pure annotation.\n\n- The focused entries (composites, data-grid, forms, and overlays) each lose\n  about 2.7 to 3 KB gzip bundled alone, and the root entry about 0.2 KB.\n- The source strings are unchanged. The compacted text loses the doubled\n  space each array joint left, and the style text check still matches it to\n  the source.\n- The published declarations are unchanged: the literals are widened to\n  `string`, so no fragment text prints into a declaration file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d48213569b4591ce71f3b50fa7e1625b1ac08ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/trees/5d48213569b4591ce71f3b50fa7e1625b1ac08ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/commits/ff0e8621a5ad89f5b3a97f4588778d6df7c50070","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/ff0e8621a5ad89f5b3a97f4588778d6df7c50070","node_id":"C_kwDOTZnxtNoAKGZmMGU4NjIxYTVhZDg5ZjViM2E5N2Y0NTg4Nzc4ZDZkZjdjNTAwNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/33a685897f43e35f7626697b23f3e8d2f569eec3","sha":"33a685897f43e35f7626697b23f3e8d2f569eec3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/33a685897f43e35f7626697b23f3e8d2f569eec3"}],"sha":"ff0e8621a5ad89f5b3a97f4588778d6df7c50070","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/ff0e8621a5ad89f5b3a97f4588778d6df7c50070"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/33a685897f43e35f7626697b23f3e8d2f569eec3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T18:18:11Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T18:18:11Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"build(deps): replace markdownlint-cli2 with the markdownlint library\n\nmarkdownlint-cli2 exists to find files by glob, and its glob stack (globby,\nfast-glob, micromatch, and braces) carried a braces advisory with no patched\nrelease. The repository already walks its own Markdown for the link check, so\n`npm run lint:docs` now runs scripts/check-markdown.mjs, which hands that same\nlist of files to the markdownlint library.\n\n- collectMarkdownFiles in scripts/lib/paths.mjs is the one corpus both\n  Markdown gates read, replacing the ignore list each kept.\n- The rules move from .markdownlint-cli2.jsonc to .markdownlint.json, which\n  editor extensions read as well.\n- Both dependency audits report zero advisories.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c722722d9f536c8ab81b444238ae459390706fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/trees/4c722722d9f536c8ab81b444238ae459390706fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/commits/33a685897f43e35f7626697b23f3e8d2f569eec3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/33a685897f43e35f7626697b23f3e8d2f569eec3","node_id":"C_kwDOTZnxtNoAKDMzYTY4NTg5N2Y0M2UzNWY3NjI2Njk3YjIzZjNlOGQyZjU2OWVlYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/sig