.2, markdownlint-cli2 0.23.3, Prettier\n3.9.9, publint 0.3.25, globals 17.13.0, @types/node 26.6.4, Vite 8.3.2, and\nwebpack 5.111.1. Every transitive package is refreshed inside its range,\nwhich clears the undici, js-yaml, markdown-it, brace-expansion, and fast-uri\nadvisories.\n\nThe smol-toml override is removed: markdownlint-cli2 now pins the patched\nrelease itself. The runtime audit reports zero advisories. The full-tree\naudit still reports braces, reached only through markdownlint-cli2, which has\nno patched release.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2dc05cb2097024dab07d0e73ca4ae31bc8f25e74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/trees/2dc05cb2097024dab07d0e73ca4ae31bc8f25e74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/commits/f410a1526d1b154a8f3485d7b8467efc9316ecb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.co