cs): compile and render the documentation examples\n\nEvery example in the README and the docs directory compiles against the\npacked declarations during validation, and the documented recipes render and\ndo what their prose says: the Save recipe reveals a closed section and\nfocuses the refused field, and Discard drops an invalid draft. npm run\ndocs:examples runs the compile on its own.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7dd567d6fa4adc162ef17147eb4e85c843c0d391","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/trees/7dd567d6fa4adc162ef17147eb4e85c843c0d391"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/commits/d19e6f38933ace03107325b8c24f20e8a656d16d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/d19e6f38933ace03107325b8c24f20e8a656d16d","node_id":"C_kwDOTZnxtNoAKGQxOWU2ZjM4OTMzYWNlMDMxMDczMjVi