ernal.\n- Entry point budgets carry forward between releases, and the size table\n  measures a tree-shaken consumer-shaped panel.\n- The localization defaults table is checked against the source, and the\n  Admin loader functions this package builds on are hashed against a\n  baseline.\n- The tooling specs run in their own Node vitest project.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"40783397fcba5b1126641648682d6a2824e65a8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/trees/40783397fcba5b1126641648682d6a2824e65a8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/commits/9f0801e3704df78de0496b6c5a566fa0686b28f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/9f0801e3704df78de0496b6c5a566fa0686b28f4","node_id":"C_kwDOTZnxtNoAKDlmMDgwMWUzNzA0ZGY3OGRlMDQ5NmI2YzVhNTY2ZmEwNjg2YjI4ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/d9c4d88370d1bdca682851a9fa67877e2235ff79","sha":"d9c4d88370d1bdca682851a9fa67877e2235ff79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/d9c4d88370d1bdca682851a9fa67877e2235ff79"}],"sha":"9f0801e3704df78de0496b6c5a566fa0686b28f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/9f0801e3704df78de0496b6c5a566fa0686b28f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/d9c4d88370d1bdca682851a9fa67877e2235ff79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:57:49Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:57:49Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"feat(cli)!: check the host loading contract, webpack stats, and style overrides\n\nsnui-check-consumer checks the Signal K host loading contract in its\ndefault run. It takes --stats to assert a clean webpack build with one copy of\nthis package and the production JSX runtime, --styles to fail a single-class\nCSS module rule that lands on a package component, and --runtime-dependency.\n--container works without --runtime, and module remotes render in a worker\nthread.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: the default run rejects this package in dependencies,\noptionalDependencies, or a peer dependency not marked optional unless\n--runtime-dependency is passed. It also rejects a package without the\nsignalk-plugin-configurator keyword, a remote entry the Admin could not load,\nthe host harness in any script, and an unknown --snui-* name in any CSS\nasset.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"22e107ec189adabbf5d0f45a52a746adee381559","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/trees/22e107ec189adabbf5d0f45a52a746adee381559"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/commits/d9c4d88370d1bdca682851a9fa67877e2235ff79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/d9c4d88370d1bdca682851a9fa67877e2235ff79","node_id":"C_kwDOTZnxtNoAKGQ5YzRkODgzNzBkMWJkY2E2ODI4NTFhOWZhNjc4NzdlMjIzNWZmNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/64c3985108851bb03ec2338f9ec5b33eec1e4ac5","sha":"64c3985108851bb03ec2338f9ec5b33eec1e4ac5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/64c3985108851bb03ec2338f9ec5b33eec1e4ac5"}],"sha":"d9c4d88370d1bdca682851a9fa67877e2235ff79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/d9c4d88370d1bdca682851a9fa67877e2235ff79"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/64c3985108851bb03ec2338f9ec5b33eec1e4ac5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:57:49Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:57:49Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"test(browser): grade themes, live regions, text spacing, and layout geometry\n\nNew browser specs grade the showcase with axe in every theme, check that a\nraised contrast request applies and that Night keeps the browser''s own chrome\nred, keep the panel announcer and toasts audible while an overlay is open,\napply the WCAG text spacing overrides at the narrowest width, and release the\ndocked ActionBar above the theme selector at the end of the page. Dedicated\nfixture pages pin the data grid selection bar, control rendering under forced\ncolors, and layout geometry at wide and narrow widths. The showcase spec\ntakes new screenshots, and the mobile panel screenshot is captured in one tall\nviewport under the coarse pointer layout. The hosted baselines are refreshed\nfor every change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ccf35a73dc285a0e271c91d7aac00de9f6c64c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/trees/2ccf35a73dc285a0e271c91d7aac00de9f6c64c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/commits/64c3985108851bb03ec2338f9ec5b33eec1e4ac5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/N