ars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/a4912933988c7055ef0ef12439b3cabda454fc89/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T08:59:17Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T08:59:17Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"refactor: name repeated selectors in grid, tab, and collapsible styles\n\nThe data grid module names its sortable header, body row, selectable,\nselected, and focused row, and virtualized cell selectors once. The tab\nand collapsible modules name the hover and enabled toggle selectors\ntheir hover and forced-colors rules share, and the collapsible module\nnames its narrow-panel indent.\n\nTable and DataGrid captions share TABLE_CAPTION_DECLARATIONS, the\nselected-row bar takes TONE_BAR_WIDTH, and CollapsibleSection paints its\ntone bar through toneAccentBar. The output is byte-identical except the\nembedded collapsible padding rules, which merge into one selector list\nwith the same computed result.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55435b4805318c74f53bfdaee5444ebf3bc6fa34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/trees/55435b4805318c74f53bfdaee5444ebf3bc6fa34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/commits/a4912933988c7055ef0ef12439b3cabda454fc89","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/a4912933988c7055ef0ef12439b3cabda454fc89","node_id":"C_kwDOTZnxtNoAKGE0OTEyOTMzOTg4YzcwNTVlZjBlZjEyNDM5YjNjYWJkYTQ1NGZjODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/31985c46be3bb56fc18d59e162871002eba7e4d9","sha":"31985c46be3bb56fc18d59e162871002eba7e4d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/31985c46be3bb56fc18d59e162871002eba7e4d9"}],"sha":"a4912933988c7055ef0ef12439b3cabda454fc89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/a4912933988c7055ef0ef12439b3cabda454fc89"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/31985c46be3bb56fc18d59e162871002eba7e4d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T08:59:17Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T08:59:17Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"refactor: simplify data grid, table, disclosure, and collapsible code\n\nDataGrid builds its Column stamps with definedProps, reads an item key\nonce, inlines the single-use row key helper, and checks cells through\none isCellElement guard, so the static path no longer validates each\ncell twice. Column flattening fills one array instead of spreading a new\none per fragment, and the rebuilt pinned-width Column no longer passes\nits children twice.\n\nTable shares one class helper between its header and body cells. The\ndisclosure context comes from createValueContext like every other\ncontext in the package. CollapsibleSection builds its summary once and\nplaces it by summaryPlacement, and drops a disabled guard the native\ndisabled button already enforces.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"96373b83ee45d59267d0aa49e9ddc076496c05e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/trees/96373b83ee45d59267d0aa49e9ddc076496c05e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/commits/31985c46be3bb56fc18d59e162871002eba7e4d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/31985c46be3bb56fc18d59e162871002eba7e4d9","node_id":"C_kwDOTZnxtNoAKDMxOTg1YzQ2YmUzYmI1NmZjMThkNTllMTYyODcxMDAyZWJhN2U0ZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/9545fd5d8d1b5fd877d89