41701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/2579294fe8ffc65f53334fe63dbc4c59d8e3bc40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T08:59:17Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T08:59:17Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"refactor: simplify shared utilities and hooks\n\nblockedActivationProps handles the blocked and live cases separately\ninstead of passing optional handlers through single-use guards.\nformatRelativeAge picks its unit in one ascending pass, which drops two\nunreachable guards, and hasReactContent checks each flattened child with\nits own single-node rules. joinIdReferences fills its set without an\nintermediate array.\n\nuseFocusWithin drops a redundant owner document check, the theme store\nreads its one storage key without a parameter, the viewport helpers get\ntheir doc comments back in place, and the emitter and shared clock\ncomments describe the present design. Behavior is unchanged.\n\nCo-A