01?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commits/9ed83467fad7a9ba2bbcf93a46016e5e62ead2f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T15:15:02Z","email":"23341701+NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T15:15:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"release: prepare 0.12.0 (#29)\n\nVersion 0.12.0 carries a documentation correction, two announcement fixes,\nand the internal helpers the components now share. It ships as a minor\nrather than a patch because the public declarations gained entries this\ncycle: `idReferenceList`, `focusIsOnBody`, `mediaMatches`, `asSentence`,\nand `joinSentences`, and three providers widened `children` to optional.\nNo entry point gained or lost an export.\n\nSet the version in package.json, the lockfile root, src/version.ts, the\nREADME pins, the API reference line, and both design-contract examples,\ndate the changelog entry, add the 0.12.x compatibility row, and regenerate\nthe entry-point size table and the declaration baseline.\n\nBring cspell to 10.3.1 and webpack to 5.111.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"92c0df46d9f6c3aec13562762b552b7f5deeb784","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/trees/92c0df46d9f6c3aec13562762b552b7f5deeb784"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/commits/9ed83467fad7a9ba2bbcf93a46016e5e62ead2f6","verification":{"payload":"tree 92c0df46d9f6c3aec13562762b552b7f5deeb784\nparent 8e330102ba0b8dc2f9bbb9c6e236fc7fc4c0d287\nauthor Nearl Crews <23341701+NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com> 1789398902 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789398902 -0400\n\nrelease: prepare 0.12.0 (#29)\n\nVersion 0.12.0 carries a documentation correction, two announcement fixes,\nand the internal helpers the components now share. It ships as a minor\nrather than a patch because the public declarations gained entries this\ncycle: `idReferenceList`, `focusIsOnBody`, `mediaMatches`, `asSentence`,\nand `joinSentences`, and three providers widened `children` to optional.\nNo entry point gained or lost an export.\n\nSet the version in package.json, the lockfile root, src/version.ts, the\nREADME pins, the API reference line, and both design-contract examples,\ndate the changelog entry, add the 0.12.x compatibility row, and regenerate\nthe entry-point size table and the declaration baseline.\n\nBring cspell to 10.3.1 and webpack to 5.111.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqA92CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtHwQADje2O6ucAB85CkCbGGjR2VE\n2Dtrih6zH4RHi/TnJQr2Gw9ipceGWlgswapG0S3mNIgn1JljuISzGGMZMMAs4Zkg\n0GVEm2I6e8DTo6dRuvYynbAedWO8SzPHOGkcfPEz9gDgftTcDfcGeMWBCJDjHWiA\n+8O0TKl33wgDSPHTX2zxBoPDwl6Lw8Wsd6BE68K9Q2TcNv1zFU23B4Q8kmQ9E+J4\n6K7om+aQ7