"name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"build: run the consumer type check through the compiler''s Node entry\n\nThe check spawned node_modules/.bin/tsc, which is a shell script on POSIX\nand a .cmd shim on Windows. Node cannot spawn either portably without a\nshell, so the Windows package job failed before the compiler ever ran.\nResolving the compiler''s own Node entry point and running it through\nprocess.execPath matches how the package check already runs its tools.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5578b15260a1e7331e96f26a5b8346a85b16155e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/trees/5578b15260a1e7331e96f26a5b8346a85b16155e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/git/commits/7014e3fc9742f28e754bdf784bc9e931e2989e75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nearlcrews-ui/commit/7014e3fc9742