ub.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/f4c74ba1aa18d7afa0fa5f15daf1025e28588615/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T00:07:04Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"Point Pu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T00:07:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[#3012] deploy(a8f60d): пины профиля перезакреплены на main ba01514b (#3015)\n\nПины профиля стенда `deploy/helm/umbrella/values.a8f60d.yaml`\nперезакреплены на ba01514b штатной целью `make -C deploy\nmanaged-image-pins`.\n\n- Затронуто 16 пинов: 7 служб — `main-ba01514b`, 9 модулей консоли.\n- Образ kaname остаётся на `main-0dd03218`: он связан с пином модуля в\ngo.mod.\n- Дифф: 18 строк в 1 файле.\n\n**Проверки исполнителя:** зелёных 11, из них сетевая досягаемость пинов\n63/63. pre-push: исполнено 28 проверок, отказов 0, не выполнено 0.\n\nЗадача #3012 закрывается после выкатки стенда и сверки провенанса, а не\nвливанием.\n\nRefs #3012","tree":{"sha":"a7ddd0909a7e3d17f66142d0883ea71817db32b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/a7ddd0909a7e3d17f66142d0883ea71817db32b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/f4c74ba1aa18d7afa0fa5f15daf1025e28588615","verification":{"payload":"tree a7ddd0909a7e3d17f66142d0883ea71817db32b2\nparent 14a09acd6f6abf910dbb7db03b4c0273a976e2c5\nparent 7fb53c0172d98fbb22599d5a2ef4940cb2f89d6f\nauthor Point Pu <pointpu@in-cloud.io> 17