пина kaname называл число и прежнюю ревизию остальных пинов —\nкоордината снята, ссылка дана на запись «порождено-от».\n\nДосягаемость: KACHO_IMAGE_REGISTRY_CHECK=1 TestPublishedProductImagePinIsReachable —\nсверено 63 из 63, манифеста нет у 0.","tree":{"sha":"e6ab4203600100320612202fe13e3274b8379448","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/e6ab4203600100320612202fe13e3274b8379448"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/44fef3c1e8715e3a3004f2668e28fdcb33c3f79d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/44fef3c1e8715e3a3004f2668e28fdcb33c3f79d","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKDQ0ZmVmM2MxZTg3MTVlM2EzMDA0ZjI2NjhlMjhmZGNiMzNjM2Y3OWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/ba01514b98bb870841adbce431a5b1c9ceec86f0","sha":"ba01514b98bb870841adbce431a5b1c9ceec86f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/ba01514b98bb870841adbce431a5b1c9ceec86f0"}],"sha":"44fef3c1e8715e3a3004f2668e28fdcb33c3f79d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/44fef3c1e8715e3a3004f2668e28fdcb33c3f79d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/c0f42eee76b1842f16ff41b4df38335ae073b71c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T21:19:33Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T21:19:33Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#3011 carrydrift: снять запись перечня, пережившую посадку эпика 2564\n\nЗапись-приспособление на assert-workflow-run-publish-guard.py несла свой\nпредикат снятия: «посадкой эпика 2564 в ствол ... запись снимается тем же\nизменением, что вливает эпик (код 3 иначе)». Эпик влит слиянием e702195f599\n(#2824), запись осталась, и обязательная проверка «перенос ветки не откатил\nствол» упала кодом 3 на ba01514b98b (прогоны 37121518163, 37123577648).\n\nФайл в стволе жив, и снимается не он: запись объявляла приспособление, а не\nснятие, и называла живой файл по определению. Ствол несёт версию эпика сам\n(blob 6a49402c4f на e702195f599 и на ba01514b98b), исключать нечего.\n\nПара: judge.sh на ba01514b98b — код 3, на этом коммите — код 0.","tree":{"sha":"4e2d338a21338cbf506d7d0999a31d586cffa342","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/4e2d338a21338cbf506d7d0999a31d586cffa342"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/c0f42eee76b1842f16ff41b4df38335ae073b71c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/c0f42eee76b1842f16ff41b4df38335ae073b71c","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKGMwZjQyZWVlNzZiMTg0MmYxNmZmNDFiNGRmMzgzMzVhZTA3M2I3MWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/ba01514b98bb870841adbce431a5b1c9ceec86f0","sha":"ba01514b98bb870841adbce431a5b1c9ceec86f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/ba01514b98bb870841adbce431a5b1c9ceec86f0"}],"sha":"c0f42eee76b1842f16ff41b4df38335ae073b71c","url":"https://api.github.com/