"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/cdb780104679dae80393a13994cac1663f57fb43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:42:27Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:42:27Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2992 пин службы доступа на голову 357 934b72355\n\nГолова kaname 357 после #553 - 934b7235548b. Дельта 1b9067128e7d..934b7235548b\nнесёт приёмки, записи ревью, перепись долга и пробы конвейера службы; кода\nслужбы, контракта и модели прав она не меняет (git diff --stat, 9 файлов).\n\n- go.mod: kaname v0.4.1-0.20261002054342-934b7235548b (go get + go mod tidy);\n- образ службы во всех пяти профилях зонта - 357-934b7235, тег опубликован\n  (Docker Hub tags API, код 200, amd64 и arm64);\n- комментарии у потолка в чарте kaname и у пробы зонта называют новый пин.\n\nПробы: go test ./deploy/... ./gateway/... - 26 пакетов ok, упавших 0, через\nслот. Рендер values.fe3455-prod.yaml даёт оба пода kaname с 357-934b7235.","tree":{"sha":"889b3033270fbde7c99b4b0a716c5a0081357cec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/889b3033270fbde7c99b4b0a716c5a0081357cec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/cdb780104679dae80393a13994cac1663f57fb43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"u