2987-sync-main влита без схлопывания, голова c8b491bbd8a; все 65 несводных проверок на ней зелёные.\n\nCloses #2987","tree":{"sha":"d3d2c92ec9cb3022305784e07e0d7b927051413d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/d3d2c92ec9cb3022305784e07e0d7b927051413d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/fca17e1b8f03412c60f343f00b04c7306ec16b33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/fca17e1b8f03412c60f343f00b04c7306ec16b33","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKGZjYTE3ZTFiOGYwMzQxMmM2MGYzNDNmMDBiMDRjNzMwNmVjMTZiMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/ae4bde452f6d3b5ad41bff8d84d00e576275e1ce","sha":"ae4bde452f6d3b5ad41bff8d84d00e576275e1ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/ae4bde452f6d3b5ad41bff8d84d00e576275e1ce"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/c8b491bbd8adf406a5cb41c189563eb4f9c4bef1","sha":"c8b491bbd8adf406a5cb41c189563eb4f9c4bef1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/c8b491bbd8adf406a5cb41c189563eb4f9c4bef1"}],"sha":"fca17e1b8f03412c60f343f00b04c7306ec16b33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/fca17e1b8f03412c60f343f00b04c7306ec16b33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/c8b491bbd8adf406a5cb41c189563eb4f9c4bef1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T00:33:58Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T00:33:58Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2987 carrydrift: гейт права на публикацию объявлен приспособлением к снятию KAC-*\n\nГейт переноса назвал assert-workflow-run-publish-guard.py необъявленным\nприспособлением: результат 0b441ca1 не равен ни стволу 7ac916bd, ни базе\n(файла в ней нет). Разбор: ветка 2564 файл не трогала, правка сделана\nразрешением слияния 0c10a7e05dd и описана в его сообщении.\n\nЭто смысловой конфликт без текстового. Ствол (#2942) завёл гейт, у которого\nсобственный push в KAC-* законен, а инъекция законного близнеца пишется в\nстроку KAC-* фильтра docker-build. Ветка 2564 эту форму из фильтра и из\nрешения сняла (#2807). Замер на 0c10a7e05dd с подложенной версией ствола:\nсамопроверка 98 подпроб, провалов 18; живой прогон 1 находка. Версия\nрезультата: 98 подпроб, провалов 0. Приспособление сужает право вслед за\nфильтром и сохраняет охват (инъекция возврата KAC-* роняет слой 2).\n\nПоэтому взята не версия ствола, а объявление в перечне с причиной и\nусловием истечения: запись снимается тем изменением, что вливает эпик 2564\nв ствол. Переносить в ствол отдельной задачей нечего: снятие KAC-* и есть\nсодержимое эпика.","tree":{"sha":"d3d2c92ec9cb3022305784e07e0d7b927051413d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/d3d2c92ec9cb3022305784e07e0d7b927051413d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/c8b491bbd8adf406a5cb41c189563eb4f9c4bef1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/c8b491bbd8adf406a5cb41c189563eb4f9c4bef1","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKGM4YjQ5MWJiZDhhZGY0MDZhNWNiNDFjMTg5NTYzZWI0ZjljNGJlZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/0c10a7e05dd304ddd52fbeed5a0428435ba02990","sha":"0c10a7e05dd304ddd52fbeed5a0428435ba02990","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/0c10a7e05dd304ddd52fbeed5a0428435ba02990"}],"sha":"c8b491bbd8adf406a5cb41c189563eb4f9c4bef1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/c8b491bbd8adf406a5cb41c189563eb4f9c4bef1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/0c10a7e05dd304ddd52fbeed5a0428435ba02990/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T00:07:25Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T00:07:25Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2987 merge main в 2564: граница доверия публикации и поднятые зависимости сайтов документации\n\nВливается origin/main (bea4495e934, 10 коммитов) в ветку эпика 2564.\n\nci.yaml, единственный текстовый конфликт: обе стороны добавили по шагу\nв одно место задания самопроверок. Сохранены оба шага: из 2564 — суждение\nо триггерах запроса в ветку линии (assert-review-trigger-scope, kacho#2807),\nиз main — суждение о праве публикации процесса по workflow_run\n(assert-workflow-run-publish-guard, kacho#2942). Шаги независимы, оба\nопираются на pyyaml шага выше.\n\nСмысловой конфликт без текстового: 2564 сняла форму KAC-* из фильтра push\nпроцесса docker-build, а main завела шаг решения, пускающий собственный\npush в KAC-*, и самопроверку, вносящую инъекцию в строку KAC-* фильтра.\nПосле слияния самопроверка красная (подпроб 98, провалов 1: образец не\nнайден), а решение шире триггера. Решение сужено вместе с фильтром до\nствола и метки версии; сцена push в KAC-1 стала чужой; инъекция\nзаконного близнеца переставлена на фильтр ствола; инъекция «правило\nснова пускает KAC-*» роняет слой 2.\n\nЗависимости сайтов документации (#2972) в 2564 уже есть: семь пар\npackage.json и package-lock.json совпадают с main побайтно.","tree":{"sha":"1c65d2e5d233bbc5d542495bb8531c3e182f52a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/1c65d2e5d233bbc5d542495bb8531c3e182f52a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/0c10a7e05dd304ddd52fbeed5a0428435ba02990","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","re