:211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/2fc54dcae98d0b0847442f2be1580f1952fe45f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T12:52:54Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T12:52:54Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2942 ci: проба права на публикацию судит собственные события и группу параллелизма\n\nСобственные события процесса сборки разрешаются перечнем, а не по\nумолчанию. Решение судит их само, фильтр триггера держателем не считается.\nГруппа параллелизма — часть той же границы доверия (#2942); разбор не\nпубликуется, адрес — дифф этого коммита.\n\nПроба получила сцены собственных событий обоих знаков, триггеры процесса\nсудит перечнем, группу параллелизма — исходом. Решение обязано стоять\nпервым шагом.\n\nНа каждое решение есть подпроба однофактной порчи рядом с законным\nблизнецом. Самопроверка: 98 подпроб, 0 провалов. Гейт по дереву:\n13 процессов, 1 задание под судом, 37 сцен, 0 находок.","tree":{"sha":"5fc2d6a8262bb49e90d94faeb4efdda37db48f0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/5fc2d6a8262bb49e90d94faeb4efdda37db48f0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/2fc54dcae98d0b0847442f2be1580f1952fe45f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/2fc54dcae98d0b0847442f2be1580f1952fe45f0","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKDJmYzU0ZGNhZTk4ZDBiMDg0NzQ0MmYyYmUxNTgwZjE5NTJmZTQ1ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/d981a229fbf828e9d5af0ffcd3ae81eef1a79637","sha":"d981a229fbf828e9d5af0ffcd3ae81eef1a79637","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/d981a229fbf828e9d5af0ffcd3ae81eef1a79637"}],"sha":"2fc54dcae98d0b0847442f2be1580f1952fe45f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/2fc54dcae98d0b0847442f2be1580f1952fe45f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/d981a229fbf828e9d5af0ffcd3ae81eef1a79637/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T12:52:54Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T12:52:54Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2942 ci: проба права на публикацию судит условие шага и оболочку решения как площадка\n\nВторой слой гейта — остановка исполнения отказом решения — теперь судится\nс сохранением смысла функций состояния в условиях шагов, читающих секреты,\nи той оболочкой шага решения, которой его исполнит площадка (шаг, задание,\nпроцесс, умолчание). Оболочка, которую гейт не исполняет, — находка и худший\nслучай. Вызов функции состояния распознаётся разбором, без учёта регистра.\n\nНа каждую новую форму порчи — подпроба самопроверки рядом с законным\nблизнецом той же формы. Самопроверка: подпроб 69, провалов 0. Гейт по\nдереву: процессов 13, заданий под судом 1, сцен 20, находок 0.","tree":{"sha":"99b57a3b81119fcbe4fd5df8df18a05e0880c90b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/99b57a3b81119fcbe4fd5df8df18a05e0880c90b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/d981a229fbf828e9d5af0ffcd3ae81eef1a79637","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","fol