15c074297c8ace3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T09:10:49Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T09:10:49Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2941 test: порча одной метки пода края роняет пробу и называет политику\n\nИнъекция в настоящий рендер стенда own: метка app шаблона пода края\nпереписана, политики не тронуты. Находок 5, каждая называет политику,\nпереставшую впускать край: kacho-nlb 3, vpc-internal-allowlist 2.\nНазвана в шаге конвейера рядом с остальными пробами тега helmcharts.","tree":{"sha":"d8c3baa53f3d707f59d8f3b002c60456a1608b54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/d8c3baa53f3d707f59d8f3b002c60456a1608b54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/283753874e064276b9f7283b15c074297c8ace3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/283753874e064276b9f7283b15c074297c8ace3d","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKDI4Mzc1Mzg3NGUwNjQyNzZiOWY3MjgzYjE1YzA3NDI5N2M4YWNlM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/fddf497f61d9343b660a1c9b7886067843f3754f","sha":"fddf497f61d9343b660a1c9b7886067843f3754f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/fddf497f61d9343b660a1c9b7886067843f3754f"}],"sha":"283753874e064276b9f7283b15c074297c8ace3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/283753874e064276b9f7283b15c074297c8ace3d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/fddf497f61d9343b660a1c9b7886067843f3754f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T09:04:37Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T09:04:37Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2941 fix: край и соседи достают до служб — политики называют поды метками из их чартов\n\nКорень: политика сети называла отправителя меткой, выписанной по памяти,\nа метку ставит чужой чарт. Политика kacho-nlb ждала app: kacho-api-gateway,\nпод края несёт app: api-gateway, — край не доставал до службы\nбалансировщиков ни на :9090, ни на :9091. Политика внутреннего слушателя\nvpc впускала только край, а туда звонят ещё compute и kacho-nlb.\n\n- Метки пода края — одно определение, api-gateway.selectorLabels в чарте\n  края: его зовут селектор рабочего объекта, шаблон пода, Service и\n  политики умбреллы (umbrella.edgeSelectorLabels, _network-identity.tpl).\n  Метки служб — из значения name их подчартов (umbrella.appSelectorLabels).\n- Политика kacho-nlb переехала в умбреллу (templates/networkpolicy-nlb.yaml):\n  чарт службы меток края не видит. Впускает только край, на :9090 и :9091.\n  Правило kacho.io/peer снято — метки не несёт ни один под и к службе не\n  звонит ни один сосед; правило сборщика величин на :9101 снято — селектор\n  без селектора пространства не выбирал никого. Ручка прежняя,\n  kacho-nlb.networkPolicy.enable, умолчание включено.\n- Политика vpc на :9091: край, compute и kacho-nlb точными метками;\n  сосед с выключенным чартом не называется.\n- Хранилища: вход Job переноса географии к pg-compute и pg-geo\n  рендерится только при включённом Job, метка — из определения чарта Job.\n\nРендер до и после на цепочках stacks.txt: меняются только четыре политики\nна own и prod; рабочие объекты края и служб не меняются. Ссылки на\nполитику в чарте kacho-nlb в прозе и пробах переведены на новое место.\nПроба предыдущего коммита зелёная: находок 0 на 7 цепочках.","tree":{"sha":"a9da9336086511bdf93ad0f9152955099317fa20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/a9da9336086511bdf93ad0f9152955099317fa20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/fddf497f61d9343b660a1c9b7886067843f3754f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/fddf497f61d9343b660a1c9b7886067843f3754f","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKGZkZGY0OTdmNjFkOTM0M2I2NjBhMWM5Yjc4ODYwNjc4NDNmMzc1NGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/9cfef6f6fab816474ca7b767ff21203a9309337c","sha":"9cfef6f6fab816474ca7b767ff21203a9309337c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/9cfef6f6fab816474ca7b767ff21203a9309337c"}],"sha":"fddf497f61d9343b660a1c9b7886067843f3754f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/fddf497f61d9343b660a1c9b7886067843f3754f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/9cfef6f6fab816474ca7b767ff21203a9309337c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T08:43:39Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T08:43:39Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2941 test: политика сети обязана пропускать того, кто к службе звонит\n\nПроба рендера каждой цепочки stacks.txt, две половины:\n\n- (А) селектор цели политики и каждый селектор отправителя выбирает хотя\n  бы один под рендера — иначе правило не пропускает никого;\n- (Б) для каждого адреса службы в настройках рабочего объекта под-адресат\n  впускает этого отправителя на этот порт (и отправитель выпускает, если\n  ограничен по исходу).\n\n(А) без (Б) зелёная на селекторе, выбирающем не тот под; (Б) без (А)\nмолчит о правиле, к которому никто не звонит. Судья — без тега, на\nсинтетике по каждой оси; гейт и инъекции в настоящий рендер стенда own —\nпод тегом helmcharts, названы в шаге конвейера.\n\nКрасный на этом коммите, рендер origin/2798 670d036e: находок 9 на\nцепочке own и 9 на prod, 0 на остальных пяти. Край не достаёт до службы\nбалансировщиков (политика ждёт метку края, которой под края не несёт),\nсоседи compute и kacho-nlb не достают до внутреннего слушателя сетей,\nтри правила и два правила хранилищ называют поды, которых в рендере нет.\nПочинка — следующим коммитом.","tree":{"sha":"037d027b2ca0a417c509926baca0456b367b50ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/037d027b2ca0a417c509926baca0456b367b50ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/9cfef6f6fab816474ca7b767ff21203a9309337c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/9cfef6f6fab816474ca7b767ff21203a9309337c","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKDljZmVmNmY2ZmFiODE2NDc0Y2E3Yjc2N2ZmMjEyMDNhOTMwOTMzN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/670d036e8e7e50fd45ce5bdb6876f35ce79172c3","sha":"670d036e8e7e50fd45ce5bdb6876f35ce79172c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/670d036e8e7e50fd45ce5bdb6876f35ce79172c3"}],"sha":"9cfef6f6fab816474ca7b767ff21203a9309337c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/9cfef6f6fab816474ca7b767ff21203a9309337c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/d21c516e5b39b2d5754ea698635c1fb4f9cb10df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T07:57:55Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T07:57:55Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2939 e2e: iam-account-id-edge-format службы доступа переезжает в набор края\n\nКоллекция из набора PRO-Robotech/kaname, которую не гонял ни один шаг\nконвейера службы (держатель там — PRO-Robotech/kaname#415), заведена\nкейсом набора края gateway/tests/newman. Её гоняет существующий шаг\n«гейт — newman зелёный (api-gateway)»; дом по предмету — платформа\n(e2e-flow.md §7а воркспейса): пару 400/3 на негодной форме\nидентификатора аккаунта в пути производит край до проверки прав.\n\nКейсы IAM-AB-SIA-12-EDGE-LIST-BY-ACCOUNT и IAM-ID2-NEG-FORM-EDGE-ACCOUNT-ID\nперенесены без изменения строгости. Отличия — по одному доводу:\n\n- к отказу ListByAccount добавлен законный близнец: годная форма\n  несуществующего аккаунта на том же маршруте доходит до проверки прав\n  (403/7). Без него отказ по форме неотличим от края, отвергающего\n  любой идентификатор; исход выведен из устройства края, не замерен;\n- вызывающий без прав — jwtPureNoBindings, выделенный\n  никогда-не-выданный субъект наборов платформы, вместо jwtNoBindings,\n  которого в окружении края нет;\n- побайтовое равенство тел сперва требует захваченного тела.\n\nШард edge и таблица E2E-SHARDS перемерены: строка api-gateway\n5/74 -> 6/79, итог 65/7554 -> 66/7559.\n\nПрогон против стенда не выполнялся: стенд занят, вердикт даст\nконвейер. Локально коллекция исполнена против заглушки ответов края:\n12 утверждений, упавших 0; инъекция в одно утверждение — ровно одно\nпадение; край без шага формы роняет отрицания, край, отвергающий любой\nидентификатор, роняет оба близнеца.","tree":{"sha":"5f3ea51f03c4307869fdf5d2bd4ef40f71465113","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/5f3ea51f03c4307869fdf5d2bd4ef40f71465113"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/d21c516e5b39b2d5754ea698635c1fb4f9cb10df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/d21c516e5b39b2d5754ea698635c1fb4f9cb10df","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKGQyMWM1MTZlNWIzOWIyZDU3NTRlYTY5ODYzNWMxZmI0ZjljYjEwZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/670d036e8e7e50fd45ce5bdb6876f35ce79172c3","sha":"670d036e8e7e50fd45ce5bdb6876f35ce79172c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/670d036e8e7e50fd45ce5bdb6876f35ce79172c3"}],"sha":"d21c516e5b39b2d5754ea698635c1fb4f9cb10df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/d21c516e5b39b2d5754ea698635c1fb4f9cb10df"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/670d036e8e7e50fd45ce5bdb6876f35ce79172c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T06:50:55Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T06:50:55Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2937 merge: сборка 2 волны 2798 вносится в ветку волны\n\nВетка 2937 @ 52a0c72d1b0 (запрос #2938) вносится в ветку волны 2798\nкоммитом слияния. 2798 @ 96e2fa72b3a — предок головы сборки, поэтому\nдерево слияния равно дереву головы 52a0c72d1b0, своих правок у\nслияния нет.\n\nСостав: полосы #2818, #2930, #2912 (с #2913), #2929, #1276, #2931 и\nкоммиты сборки по возвратам конвейера и рецензентов; голова каждой\nполосы — предок головы сборки.\n\nCloses #2937","tree":{"sha":"b62733a369db96207df59dbff3a596a2b030b960","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/b62733a369db96207df59dbff3a596a2b030b960"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/670d036e8e7e50fd45ce5bdb6876f35ce79172c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/670d036e8e7e50fd45ce5bdb6876f35ce79172c3","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKDY3MGQwMzZlOGU3ZTUwZmQ0NWNlNWJkYjY4NzZmMzVjZTc5MTcyYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/96e2fa72b3ad95074936eaa8203cef4dcb63b332","sha":"96e2fa72b3ad95074936eaa8203cef4dcb63b332","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/96e2fa72b3ad95074936eaa8203cef4dcb63b332"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/52a0c72d1b05feb97997fea7f0e2a2113b1b3e67","sha":"52a0c72d1b05feb97997fea7f0e2a2113b1b3e67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/52a0c72d1b05feb97997fea7f0e2a2113b1b3e67"}],"sha":"670d036e8e7e50fd45ce5bdb6876f35ce79172c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/670d036e8e7e50fd45ce5bdb6876f35ce79172c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/52a0c72d1b05feb97997fea7f0e2a2113b1b3e67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T05:52:09Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T05:52:09Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2937 test: сняты 11 меток #nosec в пробах, которых сканер не читает\n\nВозврат посадки сборки 2 волны 4, B1. Волна внесла 11 директив gosec в\nфайлы *_test.go (G304 девять, G204 две): deploy — 9 в 8 файлах,\ninternal/repohygiene/identityprobefate_test.go — 2,\nui-future/deploy/console_serving_template_test.go — 1. Подавлять там\nнечего: scripts/gosec-scan-modules.sh гоняет gosec без -tests (решение,\nразбор в scripts/gosec-verdict.sh), и сканер этих файлов не читает;\n.golangci.yml gosec не включает. Метка без срабатывания, которое она\nгасит, — маска, а не решение о ложной находке.\n\nПравка снимает только хвостовой комментарий в 11 строках; поведение\nпроб не меняется.\n\nЗамер формой конвейера (gosec v2.28.0 через gosec-scan-modules.sh,\ngosec-verdict.sh и гейт tools/gosecsubject; golangci-lint v2.12.2 run\n--timeout=10m из корня), до правки на 385407e2032 и после:\n- gosec прочитал 1109 файлов, 264305 строк; *_test.go среди них 0, ни\n  одного из 9 тронутых файлов; перечень прочитанного совпал побайтно;\n- результатов 5, level=error 0; находок с подавленными 118, подавлено\n  113, директив по счёту сканера 112 — до и после одинаково, отчёт и\n  перепись подавлений совпали побайтно;\n- гейт предмета: судимых 112, инертных 0; вне осмотра 252 -> 241;\n- golangci-lint: 0 issues до и после.","tree":{"sha":"b62733a369db96207df59dbff3a596a2b030b960","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/b62733a369db96207df59dbff3a596a2b030b960"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/52a0c72d1b05feb97997fea7f0e2a2113b1b3e67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/52a0c72d1b05feb97997fea7f0e2a2113b1b3e67","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKDUyYTBjNzJkMWIwNWZlYjk3OTk3ZmVhN2YwZTJhMjExM2IxYjNlNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/385407e2032c6b4ac33fce34609be1b79849bdd8","sha":"385407e2032c6b4ac33fce34609be1b79849bdd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/385407e2032c6b4ac33fce34609be1b79849bdd8"}],"sha":"52a0c72d1b05feb97997fea7f0e2a2113b1b3e67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/52a0c72d1b05feb97997fea7f0e2a2113b1b3e67"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/385407e2032c6b4ac33fce34609be1b79849bdd8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T04:12:31Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T04:12:31Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2937 deploy: слой площадки стенда own назначает базам запрос процессора узла стенда\n\nКорень красной ноги «stack own boots» (4 из 4 на d4fed1ee, семь подов\nPending, «Progress deadline exceeded»): боевой слой просит у семи баз\n500m и 250m процессора — размер боевого кластера; цепочка own на узле\nkind ранера просила 3520m при 950m плоскости управления и 4000m узла.\n\nСлой площадки values.own-stand.yaml теперь задаёт запрос процессора\nкаждой из семи баз 100m — тем же ключом верхнего уровня, что их образ.\nВеличина взята у измеренного: тот же запрос несут базы цепочки dev-prod,\nкоторую конвейер поднимает на том же ранере зелёной, и слой боевой\nплощадки на 4 vCPU. Предел процессора, запрос и предел памяти и\nнастройки СУБД остаются боевыми; посадку раздел не трогает.\n\nЗЕЛЁНОЕ: TestEveryConveyorRaisedChainFitsItsRunnerByCPURequests —\nown 1970m + 0m + 950m = 2920m из 4000m; dev и dev-prod 2920m из 4000m;\nвесь отбор тега helmcharts из ci.yaml — 20 из 20.","tree":{"sha":"ff77f5485e2b89c6803a19d516489c39f4b09fb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/ff77f5485e2b89c6803a19d516489c39f4b09fb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/385407e2032c6b4ac33fce34609be1b79849bdd8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/385407e2032c6b4ac33fce34609be1b79849bdd8","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKDM4NTQwN2UyMDMyYzZiNGFjMzNmY2UzNDYwOWJlMWI3OTg0OWJkZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/b17b0095b671bc16cf8a219f13e6c1dd4dea7854","sha":"b17b0095b671bc16cf8a219f13e6c1dd4dea7854","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/b17b0095b671bc16cf8a219f13e6c1dd4dea7854"}],"sha":"385407e2032c6b4ac33fce34609be1b79849bdd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/385407e2032c6b4ac33fce34609be1b79849bdd8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/b17b0095b671bc16cf8a219f13e6c1dd4dea7854/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T04:10:03Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T04:10:03Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2937 test(deploy): цепочка, поднимаемая конвейером на kind, помещается в узел ранера по запросам процессора\n\nНога «stack own boots» краснела 4 прогона из 4 на голове d4fed1ee текстом\n«Error: resource Deployment/kacho/api-gateway not ready. status: Failed,\nmessage: Progress deadline exceeded»; семь подов стояли Pending без узла.\nПричина — арифметика узла: цепочка own просит 3520m процессора, плоскость\nуправления kind несёт 950m, узел ранера ubuntu-latest — 4000m. Этого не\nвидел ни один страж: шаблон рендерится, а узла под не находит.\n\nГейт (тег helmcharts, deploy/stand_chain_fits_its_runner_render_test.go)\nберёт ноги подъёма тем же распознавателем, что гейт подъёма цепочек, и\nдля каждой цепочки каждой ноги складывает запросы рендера умбреллы\n(ручки UMBRELLA_OPTS), отдельного релиза cert-manager (ручки рецепта\ncert-manager-up) и измеренную базовую линию плоскости kind против\nёмкости узла по метке runs-on. Предпосылки: пин kind в процессе ноги\nравен версии замера линии, кластер — один узел без подмены образа.\nРешение — чистые функции с инъекциями в обе стороны\n(stand_chain_fits_its_runner_injection_test.go) и инъекция настоящим\nрендером dev-prod с одним поднятым запросом базы.\n\nКРАСНОЕ на этом коммите, честное: dev-prod и dev — 2920m из 4000m,\nмолчат; own — 4470m из 4000m, «не помещается на 470m».","tree":{"sha":"aaa797d5c72eb7e7c58180a4dee97938aab3bcba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/aaa797d5c72eb7e7c58180a4dee97938aab3bcba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/b17b0095b671bc16cf8a219f13e6c1dd4dea7854","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/b17b0095b671bc16cf8a219f13e6c1dd4dea7854","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKGIxN2IwMDk1YjY3MWJjMTZjZjhhMjE5ZjEzZTZjMWRkNGRlYTc4NTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/d4fed1ee3358660f8e42f7b28315867869b38b53","sha":"d4fed1ee3358660f8e42f7b28315867869b38b53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/d4fed1ee3358660f8e42f7b28315867869b38b53"}],"sha":"b17b0095b671bc16cf8a219f13e6c1dd4dea7854","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/b17b0095b671bc16cf8a219f13e6c1dd4dea7854"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/d4fed1ee3358660f8e42f7b28315867869b38b53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T03:20:02Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T03:20:02Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2912 test(newman): оборот never succeed вернулся в словарь вместе с кейсом\n\nПеренос коллекций (#2912) вернул в дерево кейс\nIAM-INT-NEG-EXT-UNBOUND-NEVER-SUCCEEDS (gateway/tests/newman/cases/\niam-internal-only-check.py), а запись словаря отказа, читающая его заголовок,\nи её утверждение (46) самопроверки были сняты вынесением службы доступа\n(#2598) как послабление без предмета. Мерка смешанных исходов назвала это\nсама: «НЕ ЧИТАЕТСЯ И НЕ РАЗРЕШЁН: IAM-INT-NEG-EXT-UNBOUND-NEVER-SUCCEEDS»,\nrc 1 в задании permission-catalog сборки 2 волны 4 (#2937 @3005515fc7e).\n\nВозвращены тем же изменением: запись r\"\\bnever succeed\" в REJECT_WORDS\n(комментарий над ней называет, где кейс живёт теперь) и утверждение (46)\nвместо надгробия; формулировка (47) восстановлена как законный близнец той\nже формы.\n\nRED: --self-test с утверждением (46) без записи — ПРОВАЛ «never succeed»\nчитается как обещание отказа: REJECT 0, SUCCESS 0, NONE 1; близнец (47) ОК.\nGREEN: --self-test 79 ОК из 79; прогон по дереву rc 0, нечитаемых 0 из 265,\nкорзины REJECT/SUCCESS/BOTH/NONE/TEARDOWN/UNOWNED без изменений 0/0/10/3/43/13,\nзаписей словаря без предмета 0.\n\nRefs #2912, #2937","tree":{"sha":"6901dc99ac9c94a16dc7a615df6c2834a23d2e09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/6901dc99ac9c94a16dc7a615df6c2834a23d2e09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/d4fed1ee3358660f8e42f7b28315867869b38b53","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/d4fed1ee3358660f8e42f7b28315867869b38b53","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKGQ0ZmVkMWVlMzM1ODY2MGY4ZTQyZjdiMjgzMTU4Njc4NjliMzhiNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/96cf4719937ae30c83fe11058c74f445a4c19219","sha":"96cf4719937ae30c83fe11058c74f445a4c19219","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/96cf4719937ae30c83fe11058c74f445a4c19219"}],"sha":"d4fed1ee3358660f8e42f7b28315867869b38b53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/d4fed1ee3358660f8e42f7b28315867869b38b53"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/96cf4719937ae30c83fe11058c74f445a4c19219/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T03:20:02Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T03:20:02Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#1276 test(console): исключение прокси сервера разработки снято вместе с прокси\n\nКоммит 3af063bd6f3 снял прокси сервера разработки к внешнему экрану входа\nиз host/vite.config.ts и dashboard/vite.config.ts, а запись CONSOLE_EXCUSES,\nотносившая эту ручку по референту, осталась без предмета. Перепись F8-37\nназвала это сама: «исключений без предмета 1», утверждение «каждое\nисключение по референту чему-то служит» красное в семи шардах unit консоли\nсборки 2 волны 4 (#2937 @3005515fc7e).\n\nСнято тем же изменением: запись, абзац шапки о ней и строка шапки оси ручек\nв provider-address-census.ts, называвшая исключение. Пустой перечень — цель,\nа не отказ; ось ручек остаётся и судит возврат ручки в любой прод-файл,\nвключая конфигурации сборщика; её способность упасть держит инъекция F8-38.\n\nRED: jest console-provider-not-addressed — 1 failed из 18, перепись\n«исключений без предмета 1». GREEN: 18 из 18, «исключений без предмета 0»,\nпрод-файлов прочитано 870.\n\nRefs #1276, #2937","tree":{"sha":"946ec6950de19e56480167d07e71820a46bb1a7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/946ec6950de19e56480167d07e71820a46bb1a7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/96cf4719937ae30c83fe11058c74f445a4c19219","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/96cf4719937ae30c83fe11058c74f445a4c19219","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKDk2Y2Y0NzE5OTM3YWUzMGM4M2ZlMTEwNThjNzRmNDQ1YTRjMTkyMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/3005515fc7e3e14c8b2559b85fb44a8466ad0f9b","sha":"3005515fc7e3e14c8b2559b85fb44a8466ad0f9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/3005515fc7e3e14c8b2559b85fb44a8466ad0f9b"}],"sha":"96cf4719937ae30c83fe11058c74f445a4c19219","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/96cf4719937ae30c83fe11058c74f445a4c19219"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/d55d8963b8d3860f626f7acde254793ea38246d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T03:18:03Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T03:18:03Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2936 проба отказа без второй переписи провязки; координаты переписи судьбы проб\n\nХук отправки на fb75b8d1baf: исполнено 39, отказов 1 (go test -short),\nдве красные пробы internal/repohygiene.\n\n1. Убывающий потолок привязок к снимаемому издателю: kacho 775 при базе\n   770. Изменение сняло 8 строк, а внесло 13: три строки стража и десять\n   строк пробы. Семь из десяти были второй переписью того, что уже судит\n   TestKanameSubchartRendersNoVendorWiring (kacho#2818): переменную\n   процесса и ключ карты настроек с именем поставщика на каждом стеке и\n   на умолчаниях. Вторая перепись снята, проба оставлена об одном\n   предмете, которого прежде не судил никто: отказ рендера на снятой\n   ручке. Разность после: прирост 6, убыль 8, итог 768 при базе 770.\n\n2. Перепись судьбы проб личности: восемь снятых строк configmap.yaml\n   сдвинули пять координат в docs/architecture/identity-probe-fate-census.md.\n   Координаты переведены на строки предметов (354, 366, 307, 604, 615),\n   якорь каждой проверен.","tree":{"sha":"b5aeb13f191b5e243f5cf758e7650d0442494136","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/b5aeb13f191b5e243f5cf758e7650d0442494136"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/d55d8963b8d3860f626f7acde254793ea38246d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/d55d8963b8d3860f626f7acde254793ea38246d8","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKGQ1NWQ4OTYzYjhkMzg2MGY2MjZmN2FjZGUyNTQ3OTNlYTM4MjQ2ZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/fb75b8d1bafd3dff2fda0df7065cbaccda14ddc5","sha":"fb75b8d1bafd3dff2fda0df7065cbaccda14ddc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/fb75b8d1bafd3dff2fda0df7065cbaccda14ddc5"}],"sha":"d55d8963b8d3860f626f7acde254793ea38246d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/d55d8963b8d3860f626f7acde254793ea38246d8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/fb75b8d1bafd3dff2fda0df7065cbaccda14ddc5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T03:09:24Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T03:09:24Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2936 подчарт службы доступа без дороги обмена, пин на 357 после волны-5\n\nСлужба доступа с kaname#494 (ветка эпика 357, слияние волны-5 40a88fba4)\nне строит дороги обмена подписанного утверждения у прежнего издателя.\nПодчарт перестаёт её выпускать:\n\n- deployment.yaml: две переменные процесса (адрес token-эндпоинта и якорь\n  доверия хопа) сняты вместе с блоком;\n- configmap.yaml: ключ издателя в карте настроек снят;\n- values.yaml: две ручки platform.iam сняты.\n\nСнятая ручка в профиле не молчит: три строки в kaname.refuseRetiredKnobs,\nпрофиль, объявивший любую из них, получает отказ рендера с её именем.\nПин, который сменён, эти ручки читал, поэтому они в перечне по его же\nправилу; ни один профиль дерева их не объявляет.\n\nПин службы поднят до 40a88fba4fb6 одним изменением: модуль в go.mod\n(v0.4.1-0.20261001022903-40a88fba4fb6) и тег образа 357-40a88fba в пяти\nпрофилях. Образ опубликован, клеймо ревизии в нём полное и равно коммиту.\nКомментарии, называвшие прежний пин текущим, переведены на новый.\n\nПроба: deploy/kaname_subchart_retired_exchange_road_test.go. До правки\nотказ на ручке краснел 6 из 6 (ручка принималась, переменная выпускалась),\nпосле — 6 из 6 отказов с именем ручки; рендер каждого стека и умолчаний\nсемейства дороги не несёт, контроль переписи находит его в поде.","tree":{"sha":"572849013c3c3eb0c5f993ce6a18c7107887d571","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/572849013c3c3eb0c5f993ce6a18c7107887d571"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/fb75b8d1bafd3dff2fda0df7065cbaccda14ddc5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/fb75b8d1bafd3dff2fda0df7065cbaccda14ddc5","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKGZiNzViOGQxYmFmZDNkZmYyZmRhMGRmNzA2NWNiYWNjZGExNGRkYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/a30944b33676be2f61e4b97db1d94fc2047684c4","sha":"a30944b33676be2f61e4b97db1d94fc2047684c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/a30944b33676be2f61e4b97db1d94fc2047684c4"}],"sha":"fb75b8d1bafd3dff2fda0df7065cbaccda14ddc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/fb75b8d1bafd3dff2fda0df7065cbaccda14ddc5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/a30944b33676be2f61e4b97db1d94fc2047684c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T02:55:29Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T02:55:29Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2936 merge #2818: подъём пина требует подчарта без ключа посадки\n\nСлужба доступа на 357 после волны-5 (kaname#363) отвергает ключ\nauthn.identity-provider в файле настройки при любом значении. На 2798\nподчарт его выпускает, поэтому пин на 357 без #2818 дал бы отказ старта\nна каждом стенде. #2818 снимает выпуск ключа и уже сведена в сборку 2\nволны 2798 (#2937); здесь она сводится как предпосылка.","tree":{"sha":"b9fb5421ab73a5c51736072d3cee1d01ac9d3287","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/b9fb5421ab73a5c51736072d3cee1d01ac9d3287"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/a30944b33676be2f61e4b97db1d94fc2047684c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/a30944b33676be2f61e4b97db1d94fc2047684c4","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKGEzMDk0NGIzMzY3NmJlMmY2MWU0Yjk3ZGIxZDk0ZmMyMDQ3Njg0YzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/96e2fa72b3ad95074936eaa8203cef4dcb63b332","sha":"96e2fa72b3ad95074936eaa8203cef4dcb63b332","url":"https://ap