тся вместе с ногой own-up и пробой порядка\ncert-manager.","tree":{"sha":"66d961d0a4626ddbc44d80ee5de3fd06a9061996","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/66d961d0a4626ddbc44d80ee5de3fd06a9061996"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/3005515fc7e3e14c8b2559b85fb44a8466ad0f9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/3005515fc7e3e14c8b2559b85fb44a8466ad0f9b","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKDMwMDU1MTVmYzdlM2UxNGM4YjI1NTliODVmYjQ0YTg0NjZhZDBmOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/666548ab578adbd3113078d6aa088e74ae86fbe8","sha":"666548ab578adbd3113078d6aa088e74ae86fbe8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/666548ab578adbd3113078d6aa088e74ae86fbe8"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/c2696c749ab1320d3267cc1379efaa7279d5607e","sha":"c2696c749ab1320d3267cc1379efaa7279d5607e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/c2696c749ab1320d3267cc1379efaa7279d5607e"}],"sha":"3005515fc7e3e14c8b2559b85fb44a8466ad0f9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/3005515fc7e3e14c8b2559b85fb44a8466ad0f9b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/c2696c749ab1320d3267cc1379efaa7279d5607e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T02:19:03Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T02:19:03Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2931 deploy: проба порядка cert-manager судит третий путь подъёма own-up\n\nЦель own-up (1395c187db0) применяет продукт своим helm-прогоном и зовёт\ncert-manager-up тем же текстом, что dev-up. Отсюда два дефекта:\n\n- доказательство инъекцией cert-manager-release-before-product-inject.sh\n  отвечало условием не создано (код 2): якорь вызова dev-up находился в\n  Makefile дважды, и опыты А1 не вносились, а injection-proofs в работе\n  helm конвейера выходил кодом 2;\n- проба cert-manager-release-before-product-test.sh судила порядок только\n  у dev-up и stack-up: own-up с вызовом cert-manager-up, снятым в echo, либо\n  с продуктом раньше вызова проходил её кодом 0 (оба опыта RED записаны).\n\nПравка: утверждение А4 о порядке в own-up (16 утверждений вместо 15),\nякорь dev-up и якорь own-up берут соседнюю строку своего рецепта, два новых\nмутанта под меткой А4. Мутантов 11, каждый пойман своим утверждением,\nдерево зелено. Проза шапки cert-manager-up в Makefile называет каждый путь\nподъёма вместо двух.","tree":{"sha":"66d961d0a4626ddbc44d80ee5de3fd06a9061996","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/66d961d0a4626ddbc44d80ee5de3fd06a9061996"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/c2696c749ab1320d3267cc1379efaa7279d5607e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/c2696c749ab1320d3267cc1379efaa7279d5607e","node_id":"C_kwDOTZqgWNoAKGMyNjk2Yzc0OWFiMTMyMGQzMjY3Y2MxMzc5ZWZhYTcyNzlkNTYwN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commit/d60ab2658ec90b96a1f49a6408e2a158872bf70e","sha":"d60ab2658ec90b96a1f49a6408e2a158872bf70e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/d60ab2658ec90b96a1f49a6408e2a158872bf70e"}],"sha":"c2696c749ab1320d3267cc1379efaa7279d5607e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/c2696c749ab1320d3267cc1379efaa7279d5607e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/commits/d60ab2658ec90b96a1f49a6408e2a158872bf70e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:46:05Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:46:05Z","email":"pointpu@in-cloud.io","name":"pointpu"},"message":"#2931 merge #2937: нога own конвейера поверх сборки 2 волны 4\n\nВлита голова origin/2937 @666548ab578 (сборка 2 волны 2798: 2818, 2930,\n2912, 2929, 1276 @edfe5b16f0e) в ветку 2931 @0051dce819a. База слияния\n69ab1d3e17d (голова 1276, уже влитая в 2931).\n\nКонфликтов по содержимому git не дал: пути сторон не пересекаются\n(15 путей 2931, 45 путей 2937). Сверка по путям: каждый из 60 путей\nвзят побайтно у той стороны, которая его меняла, путей вне двух\nперечней 0. Прежний конфликт сборки в repohygiene foreignidpname_test.go\nразрешила полоса 1276 в edfe5b16f0e; 2931 этот файл не трогает, поэтому\nздесь он приходит как у 2937.\n\nНамерения сторон:\n- 2931: литеральная матрица stack dev-prod и own в production-posture,\n  цель own-up на сборке дерева, накладка образов правее цепочки, гейт\n  подъёма каждой цепочки таблицы конвейером, перепись make по ногам.\n- 2937: перечень тега helmcharts в ci.yaml расширен пробами 2929,\n  комментарий в зонтичных values о снятом стеке личности поставщика,\n  снятие записи terraform в ведомости имён, переезд коллекций newman.","tree":{"sha":"54763d7a7252146bf487a755d0909cf06f36e8f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/trees/54763d7a7252146bf487a755d0909cf06f36e8f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/kacho/git/commits/d60ab2658ec90b96a1f49a6408e2a158872bf70e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211894461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pointpu","id":211894461,"login":"pointpu","node_id":"U_kgDODKFAvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pointpu/subscriptions","type":"U