-07-22T10:10:43Z","email":"zsolt.kiss@accenture.com","name":"Zsolt Kiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T10:10:43Z","email":"zsolt.kiss@accenture.com","name":"Zsolt Kiss"},"message":"feat: file ingestion dropzone with CloudInsight Monitor bot integration\n\n- Add FileDropzone component: dark-themed dashed-border zone with cloud icon,\n  drag-and-drop + click-to-browse, client-side type (CSV/XLSX/JSON) and 50 MB\n  size validation, onFiles/onError callbacks\n- Add ToastStack component: fixed bottom-right notification stack with 5-second\n  auto-dismiss, success (green) and error (red) variants, manual close button\n- Update App: wires FileDropzone and ToastStack, adds uploading state, adds\n  processing rows to table on drop, resolves to ready/error after API response\n- Add POST /upload endpoint to plugin backend: accepts multipart/form-data,\n  applies IngestionJobConfig schema (error_threshold_pct, stale_hours,\n  min_row_count, notify_on_quality, scan_interval_minutes), parses CSV/JSON\n  with stdlib and XLSX via openpyxl, returns structured IngestionResult with\n  message, record_count, and file_size_bytes\n- Add openpyxl==3.1.5 to backend requirements for XLSX row counting\n- Remove CloudInsight Q&A bot from manifest (already staged separately)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e4050d8fb3e6b7020b7435f8aa141cd4aff3296","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KissSpinobleZsolt/spi-module-cloud-insight-ai/git/trees/0e4050d8fb3e6b7020b7435f8aa141cd4aff3296"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KissSpinobleZsolt/spi-module-cloud-insight-ai/git/commits/0b6c83726188d72e38e99cbf0c5b72efdbe03e9c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99021303?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KissSpinobleZsolt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KissSpino