for a portfolio showcase.\n- Included admin functionality with access control and content management.\n- Added testing framework with Vitest and Playwright for unit and e2e tests.\n- Documented setup instructions and project architecture in README.md.\n- Configured TypeScript settings for improved type safety.\n- Added JSON schema for component configuration.\n- Implemented error handling and not found pages for better user experience.\n- Set up sitemap and robots.txt for SEO optimization.\n- Included various utility functions and hooks for application logic.\n- Established a clear project structure following best practices.\n- Initial deployment setup for Vercel.\n- Added example project and admin pages for demonstration.\n- Integrated Cloudflare R2 for asset storage and management.","tree":{"sha":"8e494514af34f8bacaf1dfe39a3a00042c122436","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weTwenties/portflow-showcase/git/trees/8e494514af34f8bacaf1dfe39a3a00042c122436"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weTwenties/portflow-showcase/git/commits/31967276aed2fdc8baf34052adecead586a794cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31218010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khanhvinhnguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khanhvinhnguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khanhvinhnguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khanhvinhnguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khanhvinhnguyen","id":31218010,"login":"khanhvinhnguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjE4MDEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khanhvinhnguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khanhvinhnguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khanhvinhnguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github