ibirse a stay_created, que se estaba descartando\n\nstay-service emite el evento con nombre (SseEmitterRegistry), pero\nEVENT_QUERY_MAP solo listaba stay_updated. Un evento SSE con nombre y\nsin addEventListener no cae en onmessage: cada check-in se perdia sin\ntoast ni invalidacion de la cache de estancias.\n\nNo se habia visto porque hasta ahora el stream nunca llegaba a\nconectarse.","tree":{"sha":"00aedad56a67d6481fc97cab4aa59ad579e19a8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/git/trees/00aedad56a67d6481fc97cab4aa59ad579e19a8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/git/commits/f69d8bf29049d8908a75a4edab6e932e05d87fdc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209759084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/1dd0Rv","id":209759084,"login":"1dd0Rv","node_id":"U_kgDODICrbA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/commit/f69d8bf29049d8908a75a4edab6e932e05d87fdc","node_id":"C_kwDOTaOLdNoAKGY2OWQ4YmYyOTA0OWQ4OTA4YTc1YTRlZGFiNmU5MzJlMDVkODdmZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/commit/4e02098dd913e02665f4c9fe67a8a0a201bc1b8c","sha":"4e02098dd913e02665f4c9fe67a8a0a201bc1b8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/commits/4e02098dd913e02665f4c9fe67a8a0a201bc1b8c"}],"sha":"f69d8bf29049d8908a75a4edab6e932e05d87fdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/commits/f69d8bf29049d8908a75a4edab6e932e05d87fdc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209759084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/1dd0Rv","id":209759084,"login":"1dd0Rv","node_id":"U_kgDODICrbA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/commits/4e02098dd913e02665f4c9fe67a8a0a201bc1b8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T10:12:20Z","email":"vidalsanchezroddy7@gmail.com","name":"1dd0Rv"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T10:12:20Z","email":"vidalsanchezroddy7@gmail.com","name":"1dd0Rv"},"message":"fix(FSH-16): tomar el token del SSE de Keycloak en vez de localStorage\n\nuse-sse.ts leia localStorage.getItem(''access_token''), clave que nadie\nescribe: keycloak-js mantiene el token en memoria. El EventSource salia\nsin token, Kong respondia 401 y el stream entraba en bucle de reconexion\ncada 3s con un toast de error que el operario lee como fallo de cobro.\n\nconnect() pasa a async y pide el token en cada reconexion, porque caduca\ndurante la vida del stream. Sin token no se abre el EventSource.\n\nEl test anterior plantaba la clave en localStorage y comprobaba que el\ncodigo la leia: verde con la funcionalidad rota.","tree":{"sha":"1ceeabb12b0008db6d3c2cb4b64021b12bbf352c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/git/trees/1ceeabb12b0008db6d3c2cb4b64021b12bbf352c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/git/commits/4e02098dd913e02665f4c9fe67a8a0a201bc1b8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209759084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/1dd0Rv","id":209759084,"login":"1dd0Rv","node_id":"U_kgDODICrbA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/commit/4e02098dd913e02665f4c9fe67a8a0a201bc1b8c","node_id":"C_kwDOTaOLdNoAKDRlMDIwOThkZDkxM2UwMjY2NWY0YzlmZTY3YThhMGEyMDFiYzFiOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/commit/ab447ead90e489b519857c0925b6c85c6d890781","sha":"ab447ead90e489b519857c0925b6c85c6d890781","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/commits/ab447ead90e489b519857c0925b6c85c6d890781"}],"sha":"4e02098dd913e02665f4c9fe67a8a0a201bc1b8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/commits/4e02098dd913e02665f4c9fe67a8a0a201bc1b8c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209759084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/1dd0Rv","id":209759084,"login":"1dd0Rv","node_id":"U_kgDODICrbA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/commits/18fd4c0f4ee5f3d11a7953975f5eedaa37fb09e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T10:12:08Z","email":"vidalsanchezroddy7@gmail.com","name":"1dd0Rv"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T10:12:08Z","email":"vidalsanchezroddy7@gmail.com","name":"1dd0Rv"},"message":"fix(FSH-15): no cachear remoteEntry.js ni index.html\n\nAmbos tienen URL fija y referencian chunks con hash. Sin Cache-Control\nel navegador aplica cache heuristica y tras un deploy sigue pidiendo\nhashes que ya no existen: 404 y ''Modulo no disponible''. Verificado en el\nstack de demo, y ni un ctrl+shift+r lo corregia.\n\nLos assets con hash pasan a immutable, que es lo que si se puede cachear.\nEsa cabecera va sin ''always'' a proposito: con el, nginx se la pondria\ntambien a un 404 y quedaria cacheado un ano.\n\nMatch exacto y no regex para remoteEntry: una regex ~ /remoteEntry\\.js$\ntendria prioridad sobre el prefijo /mfe/ y se tragaria los remoteEntry de\nlos MFE, sirviendolos del disco local en vez de pasarlos a Kong.\n\nmfe-admin y mfe-entryexit llevan el mismo ajuste en sus nginx.","tree":{"sha":"f05f6b177628f0417d4b7d230fdb80dfab13730c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/git/trees/f05f6b177628f0417d4b7d230fdb80dfab13730c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/git/commits/18fd4c0f4ee5f3d11a7953975f5eedaa37fb09e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209759084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/1dd0Rv","id":209759084,"login":"1dd0Rv","node_id":"U_kgDODICrbA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-front