on-ai-parking-frontend/commits/560a21396772f5a481ff27cf7136042bea1d4b36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T17:20:30Z","email":"vidalsanchezroddy7@gmail.com","name":"1dd0Rv"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T17:20:30Z","email":"vidalsanchezroddy7@gmail.com","name":"1dd0Rv"},"message":"fix(shell): unificar el prefijo de API en /api/v1/* y quitar el rewrite\n\nEl nginx de la shell traducia /v1/* -> /api/v1/*, asi que la shell hablaba un\nprefijo distinto al de los remotos (mfe-entryexit/mfe-admin ya usaban\n/api/v1/*) y al de kong.yml. Entrando por Kong la peticion daba dos vueltas al\ngateway: Kong -> catch-all shell-route -> nginx -> rewrite -> Kong.\n\nLos location pasan a pass-through sin reescribir; se mantienen porque entrando\npor el puerto directo del contenedor nginx es el unico camino hasta Kong. El\nbloque SSE recupera las cabeceras Host/X-Real-IP que si tenia su hermano.\n\nMismo cambio en el proxy de vite (dev) y en VITE_REALTIME_URL, que apuntaba a\nuna quinta grafia (/v1/events/stream) y no la leia nadie.","tree":{"sha":"4f47c7bd1cbd6adda4ee20b170a708fe0a4ffff6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/git/trees/4f47c7bd1cbd6adda4ee20b170a708fe0a4ffff6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/git/commits/560a21396772f5a481ff27cf7136042bea1d4b36","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209759084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/1dd0Rv","id":209759084,"login":"1dd0Rv","node_id":"U_kgDODICrbA","organizations_url":"https: