ng-frontend/commits/aad9a6467f3423e62faf595d2723103cb4e0bcf6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T02:13:01Z","email":"vidalsanchezroddy7@gmail.com","name":"1dd0Rv"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T02:13:01Z","email":"vidalsanchezroddy7@gmail.com","name":"1dd0Rv"},"message":"fix(GW-06): alinear el nombre del query param del token SSE a access_token\n\nPedido del arquitecto (GW-06): front, Kong y Spring usaban tres nombres\ndistintos para el mismo parámetro (?token=, ?jwt=, ?access_token=). Se adopta\naccess_token (RFC 6750) porque es el único con el que DefaultBearerTokenResolver\nde Spring funciona de fábrica, con detección de token smuggling incluida.\nEl path /v1/events no cambia — el backend se alineó a lo que ya teníamos.","tree":{"sha":"b438273b4af8d8cc9385ec578ce229c688e493e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/git/trees/b438273b4af8d8cc9385ec578ce229c688e493e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/git/commits/aad9a6467f3423e62faf595d2723103cb4e0bcf6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209759084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/1dd0Rv","id":209759084,"login":"1dd0Rv","node_id":"U_kgDODICrbA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.git