rvicios\n\nGW-07 ya cerró los puertos 8080-8084 al host (docker-compose.demo.yml sin\n''ports:'' en los microservicios) — el proxy de vite.config.ts seguía apuntando\na esos puertos y daba 502 en toda llamada real. Ahora todo /v1/* se reenvía a\nKong (localhost:8000) reescribiendo a /api/v1/*, igual que en producción.\n\nVerificado con la app real corriendo: apiClient con token real de Keycloak-js\nda 200 en /v1/vehicles, /v1/spots, /v1/tariffs, /v1/tickets y /v1/stays vía\nKong. /v1/events pasa de 502 (proxy roto) a 404 (proxy OK, endpoint SSE\npendiente en stay-service, ya conocido).","tree":{"sha":"a5f30ddea57c8092c1887ac1864f2afc515f2562","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/git/trees/a5f30ddea57c8092c1887ac1864f2afc515f2562"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tartis-academy/tartis-recon-ai-parking-frontend/git/commits/063cce09136cca85bb2873487b8a68862105eec6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209759084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/1dd0Rv","id":209759084,"login":"1dd0Rv","node_id":"U_kgDODICrbA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/1dd0Rv","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tartis-academy/tartis