s 8 core files,\n  unrelated to this branch''s edits; mechanical cargo fmt, no semantic change.\n- adapters/opencode/notchtap.ts: biome-ignore and oxlint-disable-next-line\n  can''t both occupy ''the line directly before'' the same target — fixing one\n  broke the other. Moved oxlint''s suppression to a same-line\n  oxlint-disable-line trailing comment so both tools see their directive\n  adjacent to what it suppresses.\n- src/lib/guards.ts: isFunction''s (...args: never[]) => unknown return type\n  itself tripped anti-slop''s no-unknown-returns rule. void is the correct,\n  narrower top-type for a predicate whose return value is never used.\n\nGates green: cargo fmt --check, cargo clippy -D warnings (0), cargo test\n(953), oxlint (0), biome ci (0), tsc --noEmit, vitest (748), vite build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: fix two comment artifacts found by security review\n\n- history.rs: dangling comma left by a plan-citation strip in two doc comments\n- build.rs + settings_commands.rs: stale ''eighteen''/''seventeen'' command\n  counts, left over from before the secrets-store removal dropped it to 15\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: clean up review-flagged leftovers from the weather/media removal\n\n- prototype/weather-art.html deleted (whole page for a removed feature,\n  violated CLAUDE.md''s ''mirrors shipped surfaces only'' rule); nav renumbered\n  in prototype/index.html, its stale hover-peek/status-dot descriptions\n  corrected against the real components.\n- prototype/status-rail.html: purged every weather/media CSS rule, JS demo\n  function, and demo frame (156 removed / 20 added); verified by extracting\n  and syntax-checking the <script> block and balancing style-block brackets.\n- prototype/control-panel.html: dropped the ''Now playing'' toggle doc block —\n  GeneralSection has no such toggle since media removal.\n- src/assets/weather/: 9 orphaned SVG glyphs + NOTICE deleted, zero r