html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/bc370f41b73f383ed16cc251bffdd5c70d840494/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T19:42:27Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T19:42:27Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"message":"fix(tabs): fall back to the ambient peek for empty tabs\n\n`StatusRailCard` closed the ambient peek based only on WHICH tab was\npulled, never on whether that tab would render anything. News (no story\nwire exists yet, the block is hard-wired empty) and music with nothing\nplaying therefore collapsed the hover into a blank shell.\n\nA content predicate now gates both the peek and the pulled-tab mount, so\nan empty tab mounts nothing and keeps the peek instead. Its three arms\nare literally the empty-guards the three components already apply\n(`sessions.length === 0`, `media === null`, the hard-wired\n`NO_NEWS_STORIES`) and say so, so a future story wire flips both places\ntogether. Football and weather are unaffected — they have no below-block\nand are served by `IdleHoverPeek`''s own `prefer` rendering.\n\nExactly one `.below-block` still sits under the shell at a time, which\nis what `card-chrome.css`''s rounding law depends on.\n\nAlso recounts `docs/TESTING_STRATEGY.md` section 0 from live output.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e9b79c6bdfd78bde516ef250ad4e6bb5bd3ece4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/trees/2e9b79c6bdfd78bde516ef250ad4e6bb5bd3ece4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/commits/bc370f41b73f383ed16cc251bffdd5c70d840494","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81/notchtap/commit/bc370f41b73f383ed16cc251bffdd5c70d840494","node_id":"C_kwDOTabiVNoAKGJjMzcwZjQxYjczZjM4M2VkMTZjYzI1MWJmZmRkNWM3MGQ4NDA0OTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81/notchtap/commit/a0a408322c92e46573e8c28e4e232e5608c86973","sha":"a0a408322c92e46573e8c28e4e232e5608c86973","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/a0a408322c92e46573e8c28e4e232e5608c86973"}],"sha":"bc370f41b73f383ed16cc251bffdd5c70d840494","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/bc370f41b73f383ed16cc251bffdd5c70d840494"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/a0a408322c92e46573e8c28e4e232e5608c86973/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T19:42:20Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T19:42:20Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"message":"fix(agents): publish ungated sessions for the pull surface\n\nUnder the shipped default (`[agents] board_show_working = false`) the\nagent icon lit from the UNGATED registry view while the block it opened\nread the summons-GATED one, so the most common state (a session that is\nworking but needs nothing) lit the icon and then rendered an empty\nbelow-block.\n\nThe snapshot now carries both views: `sessions` stays the Board''s\ngated list, and a new `tab_sessions` carries the ungated one for the\nuser-initiated pull surface. The presence gate is untouched — it governs\nthe Board summoning itself, not an explicit pull.\n\nPublish suppression moves to the ungated slice so gate-hidden changes\nstill reach that surface. This is a strict superset trigger, not a Board\nbehaviour change: `gate_presence` is a pure function of the ungated\nslice and `AgentState::dedup_eq` compares `state` (the only field the\ngate reads), so ungated slices that compare equal always produce gated\nslices that do too. `PublishState.last` keeps holding the gated slice,\nbecause `lib.rs`''s hover primitive reads `last_session_count` from it\nand must keep seeing exactly what the overlay''s Board was last told.\n\nThe one pre-existing test that pinned the removed behaviour is rewritten\nto the new contract (authorized by the plan''s 2026-08-03 amendment): the\ncall now emits, `sessions` stays empty, `tab_sessions` carries the\nworking sessions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a05c23ae257fa0f8a0f7041c832f834a8983bc5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/trees/a05c23ae257fa0f8a0f7041c832f834a8983bc5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/commits/a0a408322c92e46573e8c28e4e232e5608c86973","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_