avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/ca63b5c0e4d18bc2e373617dcee7c80a8828bb64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T18:22:32Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T18:22:32Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"message":"fix(agent): use engine.read() for the auto-advance pause check, not .apply()\n\nEngine::apply is the propagating mutation primitive — it unconditionally\ncalls self.wake.notify_waiters() on every invocation, which would have\nspuriously woken spawn_rotation''s loop every SESSION_AUTO_ADVANCE_INTERVAL\n(6s) for the entire app runtime, regardless of whether the Agent tab is\neven selected. is_paused() is a pure read that never mutates the queue,\nso it belongs on Engine::read instead (doc''d \"no wake, no emit, & not\n&mut\", covered by the existing read_never_wakes test) — its async form,\nsince this task still runs on the tokio runtime (same reasoning that\nalready ruled out apply_blocking here).\n\nread''s closure takes &SingleSlotQueue only (no now: Instant), so the\nclosure signature also changes from |q, _now| to |q|.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b03bad30e2b05973f9987088a52ee9a9eb572eda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/trees/b03bad30e2b05973f9987088a52ee9a9eb572eda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/commits/ca63b5c0e4d18bc2e373617dcee7c80a8828bb64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81/notchtap/commit/ca63b5c0e4d18bc2e373617dcee7c80a8828bb64","node_id":"C_kwDOTabiVNoAKGNhNjNiNWMwZTRkMThiYzJlMzczNjE3ZGNlZTdjODBhODgyOGJiNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81/notchtap/commit/47f30ed78cf529621ce6a710a7e7453b9ea955db","sha":"47f30ed78cf529621ce6a710a7e7453b9ea955db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/47f30ed78cf529621ce6a710a7e7453b9ea955db"}],"sha":"ca63b5c0e4d18bc2e373617dcee7c80a8828bb64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/ca63b5c0e4d18bc2e373617dcee7c80a8828bb64"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/47f30ed78cf529621ce6a710a7e7453b9ea955db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T18:07:33Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T18:07:33Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"message":"docs(plans): mark plan 184 done, resolve the dead-prefix-pull-actions backlog note\n\nPlan 184 landed both parts. Its Part 1 also resolves the eighth audit\nsession''s \"Dead prefix pull actions\" backlog item (the [/] viewed-session\nhalf only — the enter/o expand-flag no-op is a separate, still-open gap\nplan 184 didn''t touch), so it isn''t re-planned separately.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7167757545bd1fdc99736256f354eefd86e33992","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/trees/7167757545bd1fdc99736256f354eefd86e33992"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/commits/47f30ed78cf529621ce6a710a7e7453b9ea955db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81/notchtap/commit/47f30ed78cf529621ce6a710a7e7453b9ea955db","node_id":"C_kwDOTabiVNoAKDQ3ZjMwZWQ3OGNmNTI5NjIxY2U2YTcxMGE3ZTc0NTNiOWVhOTU1ZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81/notchtap/commit/cda85d9d5fe8ce23676e7377ca83f184c369bced","sha":"cda85d9d5fe8ce23676e7377ca83f184c369bced","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/cda85d9d5fe8ce23676e7377ca83f184c369bced"}],"sha":"47f30ed78cf529621ce6a710a7e7453b9ea955db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/47f30ed78cf529621ce6a710a7e7453b9ea955db"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/cda85d9d5fe8ce23676e7377ca83f184c369bced/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T18:06:45Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T18:06:45Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"message":"feat(agent): auto-advance viewed session on a timer\n\nAdds a rust-side auto-advance timer for the Agent tab''s viewed-session\ncursor, driving the same agent-viewed-session-changed wire event the\nmanual prefix-key cycling (PrefixAction::PreviousSession/NextSession)\nalready uses. Gated on Agent-tab-selected + 2+ sessions + not-hovered +\nnot-paused (should_auto_advance_session, a pure/unit-tested function),\nticking every 6s. A manual advance calls tab_wire.session_advanced\n.notify_one() (a new tokio::sync::Notify field on TabWire) to reset the\nauto-advance wait, so a manual keypress is never immediately followed\nby a redundant auto-advance jump.\n\nThe spawn itself is #[cfg(target_os = \"macos\")]-gated (it reads\nwas_hovered, itself macOS-only), but should_auto_advance_session is\ndeliberately left ungated so it stays unit-tested on every platform.\nIts 6 table tests live in a plain #[cfg(test)] module rather than\nnested in lib.rs''s existing #[cfg(all(test, target_os = \"macos\"))] mod\ntests, so they actually compile and run on non-macOS dev boxes too\n(that module is macOS-only; CI''s rust job runs on macos-latest\nexclusively, so this was previously invisible).\n\nAlso fixes a debug_assert violation in the plan''s own draft: the async\nauto-advance task must read pause state via Engine::apply(...).await,\nnot apply_blocking (which asserts it is NEVER called from the tokio\nruntime — see apply_silence_verdict''s identical async-twin comment).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1531ce99abdff998c13376b0dbe22aa8752c69d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/trees/1531ce99abdff998c13376b0dbe22aa8752c69d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/commits/cda85d9d5fe8ce23676e7377ca83f184c369bced","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ja