.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/e2a4af996a411fc2ed37ebd59a6e74e310d27414/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T13:53:53Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T13:53:53Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"message":"fix(design-tokens): define --media-mint (flagged during slice H/I/J review)\n\nGenuinely new token, not a retrofit -- the shipped .media-bar-fill\n(idle-peek.css) intentionally reuses --overlay-teal and is untouched.\nValue matches the design mock''s own literal spelling exactly\n(prototypes/tab-notch-panel.html: --media-mint: #b6f5e5), converted to\noklch via this file''s own documented srgb->linear->oklab->oklch\npipeline, defined in both :root and .dark (they mirror by design here).\n\nCloses the gap self-flagged during slice H''s build, independently\ncorroborated by PR-Agent''s review on PR #13.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"47bf9217355d2dd9d96dee8cc505838811c2b9b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/trees/47bf9217355d2dd9d96dee8cc505838811c2b9b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/commits/e2a4af996a411fc2ed37ebd59a6e74e310d27414","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan8