://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/e33f721f21bf93d8ff25dd511508956351b0452f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T13:09:16Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T13:09:16Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"message":"feat(settings): prefix keybinding config field + UI (plan 171, slice J)\n\nA genuinely new, persisted, round-tripping field needs both sides, not\njust frontend -- corrected from the plan''s own file-scope text after\nconfirming no keybinding-config precedent existed anywhere (the seven\nshipped shortcuts are hardcoded typed tuples in lib.rs, never\nconfig-derived).\n\nRust: Config.prefix_shortcut: String, #[serde(default =\n\"default_prefix_shortcut\")] -> \"⌃⇧Space\" (spec section 9''s default).\nsettings::is_valid_prefix_shortcut(): literal \"⌃⇧\" prefix + 1-24\nnon-whitespace chars, wired into validate(). 5 new tests (default\nvalue, round-trip through parse, backward-compat fallback for a config\nwritten before this key existed, accept/reject boundary, whole-config\nvalidation).\n\nTypeScript: matching Config.prefix_shortcut field, isValidPrefixShortcut\nmirroring the rust validator exactly, PrefixShortcutControl built on\nGeneralSection.tsx''s SilenceWindowControl idiom verbatim (local raw\nmirror, effect-resync only on external change, patchConfig only fires\nonce valid). Lives in ShortcutsSection.tsx (the existing keyboard-\nshortcuts home) rather than a new section. 2 new SettingsApp tests\nmirroring the silence-window pair.\n\nNo new #[tauri::command] -- rides along in the existing\nsave_config_and_relaunch payload. capabilities/*.json, build.rs,\nprefix.rs, and lib.rs''s shortcut registration block all confirmed\nuntouched (empty diff). Data only in this slice -- not yet wired to a\nlive tauri_plugin_global_shortcut registration (Slice K/real-device\nwork).\n\ncargo test: 998/998. cargo clippy --locked --all-targets -D warnings:\nbyte-identical to the known pre-existing baseline (confirmed via\ngit-stash comparison), zero new errors. npx tsc --noEmit / vitest /\nbiome all clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"70f9a79ad3e2bcee81a11274b334ae4327c50d63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/trees/70f9a79ad3e2bcee81a11274b334ae4327c50d63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/commits/e33f721f21bf93d8ff25dd511508956351b0452f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81/notchtap/commit/e3