:"b37fa74ce9758913672fcfa24f127007b2b1aeec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/b37fa74ce9758913672fcfa24f127007b2b1aeec"}],"sha":"caea4efdeb7971fac557598b6bb44adf5ba0e2d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/caea4efdeb7971fac557598b6bb44adf5ba0e2d7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/b37fa74ce9758913672fcfa24f127007b2b1aeec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T12:57:47Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T12:57:47Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"message":"feat(media-below-block): transport controls + progress bar (plan 171, slice H)\n\nMediaBelowBlock (new): media kicker, title/artist-album subtitle, album\nart glyph, three presentational transport buttons (onCommand fires a\nstring, never dispatches -- no invoke(), no new tauri command; real\nclick detection is slice A''s still-open hand-off, dispatch is slice C''s\nsend_command, neither wired to a caller yet), and the shipped\n.media-bar/.media-bar-fill progress indicator with its discontinuity\nguard ported faithfully from IdleHoverPeek.tsx''s own MediaPeekRow.\nexpanded gates a scrubber (real elapsedMs/durationMs data) and an\noptional queue preview (queue?: {title, artist}[] -- no wire source\nexists for a real queue, so an omitted/empty prop renders nothing,\nmirroring FootballHeroCard''s secondaryMatches precedent from slice G).\n\nNo Stamp badge (NowPlayingSummary carries no Priority/EventSignal/\nEventType -- media is a pull surface, never a push event) and no\nalbum-art image (NowPlayingSummary carries no artwork field, matching\nidle-peek.css''s own already-documented decision) -- both flagged in\ncomments as pre-existing absences, not gaps this slice introduces.\n\nNew stylesheet media-below-block.css for the genuinely new markup\n(.mr-btn/.mr-glyph transport buttons, .media-art.big, .media-scrub,\n.queue-list) -- .media-bar/.media-bar-fill/.media-transport/base\n.media-art are reused verbatim from idle-peek.css, not redeclared.\nEvery transition uses real animationTiming.ts tokens, no bare literals.\n\nDiscovered, not fixed: --media-mint has no :root definition anywhere\nin the repo despite icon-strip.css/eq-bars.css (slice E) already\nreferencing it unguarded -- flagged for slice K''s integration/visual\npass, which likely needs to add the real token.\n\n28 new tests. npx tsc --noEmit / vitest / biome / the CSS timing-parity\nscanner (animationTiming.test.ts) all clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e62f0cc8c1c5ec125c69f6b8e57f61f960a2b268","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/trees/e62f0cc8c1c5ec125c69f6b8e57f61f960a2b268"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/commits/b37fa74ce9758913672fcfa24f127007b2b1aeec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verifie