":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/7afdecfbe5369473d660a5856693759bc7266fe1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T12:54:48Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T12:54:48Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"message":"feat(news-below-block): batch header + shared position bar (plan 171, slice I)\n\nNewsBatchHeader (new): \"N fresh - cycle ended Xm ago\" + prev/next nav,\npresentational only (no invoke, click routing deferred to slice A/K).\nDeliberately omits the mock''s own .batch-dots markup -- spec section 8\nexplicitly overrides the mock here: the position indicator is the\nshared PositionBar (slice F), not a second bespoke dot-strip.\n\nNewsBelowBlock (new): composes NewsBatchHeader + the shipped news card\ncontent (rebuilt, not imported -- NotificationBody.tsx''s news branch is\ninline JSX inside a shared ternary, not its own exported function the\nway AgentHeroCard/ScoreBlockContent are, so extracting it would mean\nreshaping a file this slice doesn''t own; verified line-for-line\nequivalent instead, flagged for a future extraction) + the existing\n<Manifest> + PositionBar. Exports NewsStoryView (primitive-only story\nshape). Zero stories renders null, matching AgentBelowBlock/PositionBar\nprecedent.\n\nDeliberately no .compact-hint node (unlike the mock) -- prefix+enter/o\nis the only expansion gesture for a pulled card (spec section 9); a\n\"^!N more\" hint would name the wrong key, and the right hint depends on\nslice J''s operator-configurable prefix string, which this component has\nno access to.\n\nFlagged, not improvised: nothing on the wire supplies story data yet\n(StatusState.news is still just {enabled: bool}, NewsCharge isn''t wired\nto it) -- same posture as slice C/G''s own flagged wire gaps. \"Visited\nclears the charge\" is documented as the intended flow, not built (no\nfake local state standing in for the real IPC path).\n\n19 new tests. npx tsc --noEmit / vitest / biome all clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2036d3e01871b4b71a00c2ef54d1849c7ca6f39f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/trees/2036d3e01871b4b71a00c2ef54d1849c7ca6f39f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/commits/7afdecfbe5369473d660a5856693759bc7266fe1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81/notchtap/commit/7afdecfbe5369473d660a5856693759bc7266fe1","node_id":"C_kwDOTabiVNoAKDdhZmRlY2ZiZTUzNjk0NzNkNjYwYTU4NTY2OTM3NTliYzcyNjZmZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81/notchtap/commit/6d413f6c97d99f96e54e7619edb482cdd65a8b8b","sha":"6d413f6c97d99f96e54e7619edb482cdd65a8b8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainC