events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/01748dd2ab7ae8caa9d4608cb6d60317c28d1463/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T12:19:28Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T12:19:28Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"message":"chore: trim dead football/idle-peek CSS (plan 171) + re-vendor shared-ui\n\nplan 170''s deferred Step 7: live-scorecard.css''s .notif-block/.event-line\nhad zero live consumers left (LiveMatchScorecard.tsx is deleted;\nFootballHeroCard never carries an icon slot). Removed. Verifying that\nturned up a second, related dead block in idle-peek.css (.ev-ico* and\n.event-line.tint-*, same deprecated icon+tint system) — removed too.\n\nAlso: contributed the three overlay-green/amber/fg tokens notchtap had\nlocally minted (never sent upstream) to the canonical shared-ui repo\n(github.com/jainChetan81/shared-ui, PR #1, merged as 0.3.0), then\nre-vendored the now-byte-identical file back in, so vendor/shared-ui\nstops silently diverging from upstream. verify-snapshot.mjs''s pins\nupdated to match, with a note flagging that its prior comment\nreferenced an upstream commit (4722b88, a \"motion trio\" ease-notchtap\nretune) that doesn''t actually exist in shared-ui''s real history as\nverified via a fresh fetch — corrected rather than silently carried\nforward.\n\n625 vitest tests passing (2 failures seen mid-session were the\nrecurring async-mount-timeout flake under heavy machine load — load\naverage 15.65, four concurrent claude processes — confirmed\nunrelated: token content is byte-identical, tsc clean).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf79bbe93e1094fad1051172feb98d16fca79242","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/trees/bf79bbe93e1094fad1051172feb98d16fca79242"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/commits/01748dd2ab7ae8caa9d4608cb6d60317c28d1463","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://g