mmits/e435f94b440fe349acb1723f7b78549d104b0ca5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/b191fe0b4971c7d4e60af03ec7d38f23c6ecc8c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T12:15:00Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T12:15:00Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"message":"feat(agent-below-block): agent tab hero + session position bar (plan 171, slice F)\n\nPositionBar (new, shared with slice I per spec section 8''s own\n\"implement news''s floor strip identically to agent''s\" default): the\npulled-view floor strip with no drain — reuses card-chrome.css''s\n.ttl-bar/.ttl-seg/.ttl-seg.done/.ttl-fill verbatim (no new CSS), with\nthe viewed segment carrying ttl-fill directly instead of an overlaid\ndraining div. Segment-count capping ports TtlBar.tsx''s own\nMAX_SEGMENTS/proportional-mapping math. 13 tests.\n\nAgentBelowBlock (new): composes AgentHeroCard + PositionBar for the\ntab-notch below-block, at shipped card height (no roster rows — the\nr2 wash-coverage bug this spec explicitly flags not to regress).\nDeliberately not AgentBoard.tsx reused wholesale: this tab''s \"viewed\"\nsession is an operator-driven cursor (prefix-[ / prefix-] cycling, via\nslice D''s PrefixAction::PreviousSession/NextSession), independent of\nAgentBoard''s own priority-ranked \"primary\". 12 tests, plus\ncycleSessionIndex, a pure wraparound prev/next helper.\n\nExtracted agentHeroPropsFor from AgentBoard.tsx''s own inline hero-prop\nderivation (title/subtitle/body/facts/priority) so both components\ncall the same logic instead of drifting copies — AgentBoard''s own\nrender is otherwise unchanged (75 existing tests still pass byte-for-\nbyte).\n\nNot wired to a real mount point: the outer hover/selection shell is\nslice K''s integration job, same posture as every prior slice''s own\n\"pure/presentational piece now, live wiring later\" split.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f89f2b93ce0844624b8cf74c25bc3b7752ce03ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/trees/f89f2b93ce0844624b8cf74c25bc3b7752ce03ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/commits/b191fe0b4971c7d4e60af03ec7d38f23c6ecc8c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan