1ace08f65ec710f5ee2450f9c2adb44","node_id":"C_kwDOTabiVNoAKDRhNjRlYWFkYzFhY2UwOGY2NWVjNzEwZjVlZTI0NTBmOWMyYWRiNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81/notchtap/commit/29b0707247f27405ef75273d7c1edda1c40d2dc0","sha":"29b0707247f27405ef75273d7c1edda1c40d2dc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/29b0707247f27405ef75273d7c1edda1c40d2dc0"}],"sha":"4a64eaadc1ace08f65ec710f5ee2450f9c2adb44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/4a64eaadc1ace08f65ec710f5ee2450f9c2adb44"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/29b0707247f27405ef75273d7c1edda1c40d2dc0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T11:54:26Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T11:54:26Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"message":"feat(media): MediaRemote command dispatch (plan 171, slice C)\n\nConfirmed first: the vendored adapter''s `send <MRCommand ID>` subcommand\nalready exists (bin/mediaremote-adapter.pl --help lists it; the numeric\nIDs are include/MediaRemoteAdapter.h''s MRCommand enum) — plan 104 only\never wired the read side (`stream`). This slice is genuinely \"route a\nclick to an existing capability,\" not \"add one to the vendored tree\" —\nVENDORED.md''s frozen tree is untouched.\n\nMediaCommand (Previous/PlayPause/Next) -> MRCommand id is a pure,\ntested mapping (2 tests). send_command() is the one-shot dispatch,\nmirroring run_stream_once''s permission-check-first + SYSTEM_PERL\ndiscipline exactly, bounded by a 3s timeout the same way\npresentation.rs''s own subprocess probe is bounded. The subprocess call\nitself is manual-only per this codebase''s stated posture for every\nother MediaRemote surface.\n\nNot wired to a real caller: that''s Slice A''s click-routing mechanism,\nstill gated on the Mac Mini hand-off.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44134aa581c137add2d8def8fbfceec722346ec2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/trees/44134aa581c137add2d8def8fbfceec722346ec2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/commits/29b0707247f27405ef75273d7c1edda1c40d2dc0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users