 by a\npoll-cycle boundary — mirrors weather_poller.rs''s WeatherAlertState\nedge-trigger discipline (charged sets once at cycle_end, persists until\nvisit() clears it, never re-evaluated live on read).\n\nDesign decision recorded in the module doc: \"charged\" requires a FULL\nbatch at cycle-end, not just any items waiting — follows the mission\nbrief''s literal \"when the batch is ready\" wording; flip is a one-line\nchange in cycle_end if that reading proves wrong on real hardware.\n\nNot yet wired into rss_poller.rs or StatusState (status.rs) — the wire\nshape is Slice A''s call per the plan''s own §0 cross-slice contract, and\nSlice A''s remaining scope is gated on the Mac Mini click-detection\nhand-off. This module knows about neither and is ready to be driven by\nwhichever lands the wiring.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6eae4dd37505c0f8f4511089519205b35c56237f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/trees/6eae4dd37505c0f8f4511089519205b35c56237f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/commits/41fd525f3143b8a897ef94f6f983555771a84a8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"