change, so the stripe/\n  stamp/accent pills actually recolor instead of staying frozen at\n  whatever priority the shell mounted with.\n- prototypes/full-app-current-state.html: removed a stray empty <img>,\n  removed inline style/empty onclick from the o-agent-c label, fixed\n  the CSS-only radio switcher (the ~ combinator wasn''t reaching\n  .switcher-panels/.state-switch, which sit one level deeper than it\n  can select — real bug, confirmed against the actual DOM nesting),\n  renamed the overlay-card kicker from .masthead to .card-masthead\n  (was colliding with the page''s own header class), reconciled the\n  rotation-order/capabilities/availability reference snapshots against\n  the real source (config.rs, health.rs), and added type=\"button\" to\n  28 previously-untyped buttons.\n- prototypes/full-app-future-vision.html: added a noscript fallback\n  for .reveal, removed a preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" that was distorting\n  the pipe-track SVG, wrapped two wide tables in a scrollable container,\n  and corrected a prose claim about Agent Board re-rendering (verified\n  against board.rs''s publish_if_changed/dedup_eq).\n\nTwo additional issues CodeRabbit''s \"Additional comments\" section\nflagged in agent-board.html (missing pointer-events:none on hidden\n.swap-branch elements, dead display:none markup on #gateBelow/\n#gateShell) were out of the reviewed scope and are left for a\nfollow-up, not silently dropped.\n\n625 vitest tests passing (one confirmed flaky timeout under load,\nclean in isolation — unrelated, no source file touched here).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"52414c27bf547ecc75c2c63e9026fa9770a014d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/trees/52414c27bf547ecc75c2c63e9026fa9770a014d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/commits/78d0eb1b2fb59fcc34481d68012a5efd6677a78a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"v