_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/3c37ba94cf9683d17d19ed004b4be141629f90ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T11:11:21Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T11:11:21Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"message":"docs(spec+plan): correct the idle-face description against the real component\n\nFound while grounding slice E before implementation: the mock''s own face\nillustration (double-blink/6.4s cadence, 40ms eye lag, straight hairline\nmouth, \"shrunk status-dot\" eyes) does not match the shipped IdleFace.tsx\nat all -- verified by reading it in full. Real component: no continuous\nbreathe animation exists; a single blink on a randomized 6-12s interval\n(plan 125''s cost optimization); both eyes share one parent transform, no\nper-eye lag; a curved SVG mouth path; dedicated 3x4px pill-shaped eyes,\nnot a reused .status-dot.\n\nResolution: this feature imports and renders <IdleFace /> unmodified --\nstrictly simpler than the first draft implied (zero new face code), and\nmore consistent with the spec''s own \"reuse what''s shipped\" discipline\nthan building a second, competing face implementation with invented\ntiming would have been.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha"