_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/commits/83b07ca5dc1f21882c2caca6bcac13846f7e999c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T11:11:14Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T11:11:14Z","email":"jain.cj.chetan@gmail.com","name":"jainChetan81"},"message":"fix: address CodeRabbit review findings on PR #11\n\n- Tailwind v4 emits scale-*/translate-* utilities as standalone CSS\n  scale/translate properties, not transform (confirmed against built\n  CSS output) — button.tsx/switch.tsx/Segmented.tsx''s transition lists\n  named transform, so the whole \"deepen press feedback\" change was\n  snapping instantly instead of animating. Fixed all three, plus one\n  more instance CodeRabbit didn''t catch (AgentsSection''s disclosure\n  trigger button).\n- Segmented.tsx: hover was unconditional, so hovering a selected\n  colored priority pill overrode its tone with the plain neutral hover\n  treatment. Scoped hover to the unselected case only.\n- PRIORITY_TONES.low''s foreground was byte-identical to Segmented''s\n  own unselected text color, so a selected Low segment barely read as\n  selected. Bumped to text-foreground; background tint (the actual\n  \"quiet/neutral\" signal) is unchanged.\n- AgentsSection: aria-controls pointed at an id with no element while\n  collapsed (the detail panel is conditionally mounted, not just\n  hidden) — now omitted until expanded.\n- Deduplicated the inset press-shadow literal, hand-copied identically\n  across all three files, into a shared --shadow-pressed token in\n  settings/base.css (mirrors the existing --shadow-selected pattern).\n- Fixed a stale test comment that said \"collapse\" where the test\n  actually expands the card.\n\n625 vitest tests passing (2 fixed pins updated to match: button.tsx''s\ntransition-property pin, and re-verified the Agents disclosure tests),\ntsc clean, biome clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"62c6de2a609ebeed50aa5e09950d5676dbe30534","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/trees/62c6de2a609ebeed50aa5e09950d5676dbe30534"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jainChetan81/notchtap/git/commits/83b07ca5dc1f21882c2caca6bcac13846f7e999c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38555207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jainChetan81","id":38555207,"login":"jainChetan81","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU1MjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jainChetan81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.g