ner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/88f57c4dff8cf846d4c113182876bf01002b5ece/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T15:53:57Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T15:53:57Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"refactor(portal): route sidebar logout through useLogout (DIP/SRP)\n\nPortalSidebar hand-rolled its own logout (direct logoutService call +\nwindow.location.reload()), bypassing useLogout entirely. Since\nAppShell never passes the onLogout override, this was the actual\nproduction path — meaning a failed logout request never cleared the\nauth store or query cache, unlike UserMenu''s path.\n\nExtract the reload side effect into a single reloadAfterLogout()\nhelper shared by both UserMenu and PortalSidebar, instead of each\ncomponent inlining its own window.location.reload() call.","tree":{"sha":"4658d2a78aebdd49ab9f731feb05d21b31d6b64e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/4658d2a78aebdd49ab9f731feb05d21b31d6b64e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/commits/88f57c4dff8cf846d4c113182876bf01002b5ece","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevings