om","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T15:31:18Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"feat(errors): improve error handling on the frontend across all MFEs\n\nSystem errors: add global-error.tsx (root layout crashes) and\nnot-found.tsx (404s) to all three apps; sanitize error.tsx so it no\nlonger renders raw exception messages to the user, logging via\nconsole.error instead.\n\nAPI errors: mount <Toaster/> in auth-frontend and properties-frontend\n(previously only portal had it); add a FormError component to the\ndesign system and wire it into login/register/property forms instead\nof raw <p role=\"alert\">; give DeletePropertyButton an onError handler\nwith a retry-friendly toast (previously failures were silently\nswallowed); route portal''s logout through a useLogout hook mirroring\nauth-frontend''s onSettled pattern, so local session state is always\ncleared even if the API call fails.","tree":{"sha":"5389a717e11033c0cf268cd94fa4c11f65800c21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/5389a717e11033c0cf268cd94fa4c11f65800c21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/commits/6b6b1d756efc71b8bdc8e0db333161914ad793be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url"