tps://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/8cbcf1d6407c3c683369879227c3f5eb10ead9cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T15:30:39Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T15:30:39Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"feat(ui): premium SaaS visual redesign across design system and apps\n\nDesign system: new brand/success/warning tokens, shadow scale,\nBadge and Tooltip primitives, Sidebar active-state polish, form/card/\nheader/input/modal refinements.\n\nApps: dashboard metrics and property list get loading skeletons,\nproperty status now renders via a shared badge variant map, property\nform/detail views get spacing and typography polish, portal module\ncards get brand-colored icon badges.\n\nAlso fixes a pre-existing RSC bug found while verifying the redesign:\nseveral packages/ui context files (Theme, FormField) and portal''s\nSessionContext were missing ''use client'', which broke Next.js\nServer Component builds whenever any export from the ui barrel was\nimported.","tree":{"sha":"2496648d6f578d9b56dd683f7c65495affef0be9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/2496648d6f578d9b56dd683f7c65495affef0be9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/commits/8cbcf1d6407c3c683369879227c3f5eb10ead9cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"logi