l":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"Merge branch ''feature/openapi-swagger-orval'' into develop","tree":{"sha":"8da2bbe27009a451b0e439eb2435c2faa8b31605","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/8da2bbe27009a451b0e439eb2435c2faa8b31605"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/commits/0b009c8c19ab8c3499e9e6300459eb9ece21a7c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/0b009c8c19ab8c3499e9e6300459eb9ece21a7c2","node_id":"C_kwDOTaeEX9oAKDBiMDA5YzhjMTlhYjhjMzQ5OWU5ZTYzMDA0NTllYjllY2UyMWE3YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/300d3a3aab3261c99baa0de4896800e52074653c","sha":"300d3a3aab3261c99baa0de4896800e52074653c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/300d3a3aab3261c99baa0de4896800e52074653c"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/fe67ab45581959d4e3dea4e53d015c045fc9535b","sha":"fe67ab45581959d4e3dea4e53d015c045fc9535b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/fe67ab45581959d4e3dea4e53d015c045fc9535b"}],"sha":"0b009c8c19ab8c3499e9e6300459eb9ece21a7c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/0b009c8c19ab8c3499e9e6300459eb9ece21a7c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/fe67ab45581959d4e3dea4e53d015c045fc9535b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T19:47:34Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T19:47:34Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"feat(api): real OpenAPI spec via fastify-type-provider-zod + Orval-generated typed clients\n\nauth-service and properties-service validated request/response by hand\n(.parse() inside controllers) with no schema registered on the route\nitself — Fastify had no idea what shape a body was, so there was no way\nto generate a real OpenAPI spec from it (the actual blocker for using\nOrval \"pra consumir os dados direito\").\n\n- fastify-type-provider-zod wires the SAME Zod schemas already used for\n  validation into each route''s `schema` option — Fastify now validates\n  request (body/params/querystring) and serializes the response directly\n  from them, and @fastify/swagger derives a real spec from that (exposed\n  at /docs in non-production only — never expose spec/UI in prod without\n  auth). Pinned to v4.0.2, not the newer v5.x: v5 depends on zod''s\n  internal `zod/v4` preview module (shipped inside zod 3.25+ as a preview\n  of the next major), and that path threw at runtime\n  (`Cannot read properties of undefined (reading ''run'')`) against the\n  exact zod version this monorepo has — v4.0.2 uses zod-to-json-schema\n  instead, a separate stable library, no such landmine.\n- Controllers no longer call .parse() manually — body/params/querystring\n  arrive already validated and typed (FastifyRequest<{Body: X}> declared\n  explicitly per controller, since they''re factory functions decoupled\n  from route registration, not closures over a typed route builder).\n- error-handler.ts in both services gained a branch for\n  hasZodFastifySchemaValidationErrors (the library''s own type guard) —\n  Fastify wraps the original ZodError in its own shape before the error\n  handler sees it, so the existing `instanceof ZodError` check alone\n  stopped catching validation failures (they were falling through to 500).\n- propertyResponseSchema/userResponseSchema (@microfrontends/validation-schemas)\n  use z.string().min(1) for id/brokerId, not z.uuid() — the contract\n  shouldn''t hardcode a Prisma implementation detail, and this project''s own\n  tests use opaque fixture ids like ''broker-1''.\n- Orval (react-query client) generates typed hooks from each service''s\n  live spec into apps/*/src/generated/api/ (gitignored — regenerated via\n  `npm run generate:api`, spec-fetch target defaults to localhost but is\n  overridable via env for CI). Generated code calls a small mutator\n  (orval-mutator.ts) that delegates to the existing apiClient (token in\n  memory, automatic 401 refresh) instead of duplicating that logic —\n  prefixes every path with /api since the spec is fetched straight from\n  the service (dev-time only) but all real traffic still goes through the\n  api-gateway (docs section 04a), same as everywhere else in this project.\n\nAlso: 2 more Dockerfile bugs found the same way as Fase 9''s — new\nworkspace packages (module-federation-utils, validation-schemas) weren''t\ncopied into any of the 4 affected Dockerfiles, and module-federation-utils\nspecifically needed its dist/ built explicitly in the build stage (the\ndeps stage''s --ignore-scripts skips its postinstall on purpose, for an\nunrelated reason already documented in Fase 9).\n\nVerified with the full docker compose stack rebuilt and running: real\nPOST/GET through the api-gateway with the new validation+serialization\npath (201 create, 400 on bad payload with the same Portuguese error\nmessages as before, /me response schema), not just unit tests. 680 tests\npass across all 9 workspaces.","tree":{"sha":"8da2bbe27009a451b0e439eb2435c2faa8b31605","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/8da2bbe27009a451b0e439eb2435c2faa8b31605"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/commits/fe67ab45581959d4e3dea4e53d015c045fc9535b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/fe67ab45581959d4e3dea4e53d015c045fc9535b","node_id":"C_kwDOTaeEX9oAKGZlNjdhYjQ1NTgxOTU5ZDRlM2RlYTRlNTNkMDE1YzA0NWZjOTUzNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/300d3a3aab3261c99baa0de4896800e52074653c","sha":"300d3a3aab3261c99baa0de4896800e52074653c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/300d3a3aab3261c99baa0de4896800e52074653c"}],"sha":"fe67ab45581959d4e3dea4e53d015c045fc9535b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/fe67ab45581959d4e3dea4e53d015c045fc9535b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/300d3a3aab3261c99baa0de4896800e52074653c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T18:26:02Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T18:26:02Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"Merge branch ''feature/shared-validation-schemas'' into develop","tree":{"sha":"5d100699ac6f391b9bb3ec081e2619ddcf19f6f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/5d100699ac6f391b9bb3ec081e2619ddcf19f6f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/commits/300d3a3aab3261c99baa0de4896800e52074653c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/300d3a3aab3261c99baa0de4896800e52074653c","node_id":"C_kwDOTaeEX9oAKDMwMGQzYTNhYWIzMjYxYzk5YmFhMGRlNDg5NjgwMGU1MjA3NDY1M2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/dc084e01165798f28b2b497669bc9287ed88818c","sha":"dc084e01165798f28b2b497669bc9287ed88818c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/dc084e01165798f28b2b497669bc9287ed88818c"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/544b21c3cb755863ea2d8a1d57c9c7fa5c21dd08","sha":"544b21c3cb755863ea2d8a1d57c9c7fa5c21dd08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/544b21c3cb755863ea2d8a1d57c9c7fa5c21dd08"}],"sha":"300d3a3aab3261c99baa0de4896800e52074653c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/300d3a3aab3261c99baa0de4896800e52074653c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/544b21c3cb755863ea2d8a1d57c9c7fa5c21dd08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T18:25:44Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T18:25:44Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"feat(validation): share property zod schema between frontend and backend\n\nproperties-service''s DTO (create-property.dto.ts) and properties-frontend''s\nform schema (property-form.schema.ts) declared the exact same enums,\ncharacter limits, and Portuguese error messages by hand in two places —\ncomment on the frontend side already admitted it: \"Mesmas regras do\ncreatePropertySchema do backend\". Real risk: change a rule on one side,\nforget the other, client/server silently disagree.\n\nNew packages/validation-schemas holds the business-rule-only shape\n(createPropertySchema, propertyTypeSchema, propertyStatusSchema,\nPROPERTY_TYPES/STATUSES) — plain numbers, no HTML-form concerns. No build\nstep needed (unlike module-federation-utils): tsx runs the backend directly\nand Next.js''s own bundler processes TS for the frontend, both understand\nTypeScript source natively, so plain `main: ./src/index.ts` works.\n\nBackend''s create-property.dto.ts now just re-exports from the shared\npackage (zero behavior change, verified: all 87 tests still pass).\nFrontend''s property-form.schema.ts imports propertyTypeSchema/\npropertyStatusSchema directly instead of rebuilding z.enum() from a local\narray — actually simpler than before, and sidesteps a real type error the\nmigration surfaced (z.enum(PROPERTY_TYPES as [...]) doesn''t type-check\nagainst a `readonly` `as const` tuple, by design). Form-specific mechanics\n(coerce/preprocess for HTML input strings) stay local to the frontend —\nthat''s not a business rule, doesn''t belong in the shared package.\n\nVerified: properties-service typecheck+tests clean, properties-frontend\ntypecheck+lint+tests clean (80/80), and a real production build.","tree":{"sha":"5d100699ac6f391b9bb3ec081e2619ddcf19f6f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/5d100699ac6f391b9bb3ec081e2619ddcf19f6f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/commits/544b21c3cb755863ea2d8a1d57c9c7fa5c21dd08","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/544b21c3cb755863ea2d8a1d57c9c7fa5c21dd08","node_id":"C_kwDOTaeEX9oAKDU0NGIyMWMzY2I3NTU4NjNlYTJkOGExZDU3YzljN2ZhNWMyMWRkMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/dc084e01165798f28b2b497669bc9287ed88818c","sha":"dc084e01165798f28b2b497669bc9287ed88818c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/dc084e01165798f28b2b497669bc9287ed88818c"}],"sha":"544b21c3cb755863ea2d8a1d57c9c7fa5c21dd08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/544b21c3cb755863ea2d8a1d57c9c7fa5c21dd08"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/dc084e01165798f28b2b497669bc9287ed88818c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T18:15:50Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T18:15:50Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"Merge branch ''docs/feature-roadmap'' into develop","tree":{"sha":"d02eb281b4f4b37b58e3412bfffc156f33689e6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/d02eb281b4f4b37b58e3412bfffc156f33689e