owers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/accd504ddef0b9566287da94073cd1801503bf27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:25:30Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:25:30Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"feat(portal): design a real home screen — greeting + polished module grid\n\nPortal''s home page was a bare grid of module cards with no context. Ran it\nthrough the ui-ux-pro-max design skill (internal admin/app-launcher pattern,\ndata-dense enterprise style) and built:\n\n- PortalGreeting: personalized \"Bem-vindo(a), {firstName}\" via the existing\n  useSessionContext (DIP-correct — no new session-fetching logic), with a\n  loading state via the shared Loading component and a graceful no-user\n  fallback. firstName() is a small pure/tested util.\n- ModuleCard: icon now sits in a colored badge (bg-primary/10) for visual\n  hierarchy, hover elevation (shadow-md) + a reveal-on-hover arrow affordance,\n  explicit cursor-pointer and a focus-visible ring on the link wrapper (the\n  Card itself had no keyboard-focus indicator before — a11y gap).\n- Grid gains an xl:grid-cols-4 breakpoint for the 8 modules on wide screens.\n\nNo new packages/ui primitives — everything composes existing exports (Card,\nLoading) per the project''s \"never duplicate a visual component\" rule, and no\nshared design tokens (colors/globals.css) were touched, since that file is\nshared by 2 other live apps and a rebrand wasn''t asked for.\n\nVerified with a real request through a live dev server (not just tests):\nlogged in via the actual api-gateway, fetched the real page, confirmed the\nSSR loading state, all 8 module cards, and the new visual classes all render\ncorrectly. portal: 101 tests (+8 new), coverage 99.3%/100%/98.14%/100%.\n\nBuilt in packages/ui/tsconfig.json and next-env.d.ts''s original branch\n(feature/ui-reusable-components) diverging live from a teammate''s concurrent\nwork in the same working directory — this branch was created via a separate\ngit worktree, branched cleanly from develop, specifically to avoid touching\nthat in-progress, uncommitted work.","tree":{"sha":"4ea0a473be763ec1704a09c2a78b0da4d57bb486","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/4ea0a473be763ec1704a09c2a78b0da4d57bb486"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/commits/accd504ddef0b9566287da94073cd1801503bf27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizatio