.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/bd9854097847b5a951c18b9cb5874f9b94c5031b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:24:17Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:24:17Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"feat(ui): add SubmitButton and a loadingText override on Button\n\nSubmitButton is a thin wrapper that forces type=\"submit\" (via Omit in\nits prop type, not a runtime check) and reuses Button''s isLoading\ndisable/spinner logic without duplicating it — no implicit context\nreads, isLoading always comes from an explicit prop (form.formState\n.isSubmitting, mutation.isPending, etc).\n\nButton gains an optional loadingText prop (defaults to the existing\n\"Carregando...\" string) so SubmitButton can override the loading label\nper action without Button hardcoding a single string.\n\nCloses #3","tree":{"sha":"a20da219763a00a61b414ac33c1c2ccb1d8a5558","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/a20da219763a00a61b414ac33c1c2ccb1d8a5558"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/commits/bd9854097847b5a951c18b9cb5874f9b94c5031b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"Luca