rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/a9bd0caf495f8b33703b54c96f865b4f96a8eeec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:21:06Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:21:06Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"feat(ui): add FormField compound component for react-hook-form integration\n\nWraps Controller + label/control/error-message association (compound\ncomponents: Form, FormField, FormItem, FormLabel, FormControl,\nFormMessage) so every form in auth-frontend/properties-frontend stops\nrepeating label wiring, aria-invalid/aria-describedby, and error text\nextraction from formState by hand.\n\nreact-hook-form becomes a peerDependency of packages/ui (same treatment\nas react/react-dom) since both frontends already depend on it.\n\nCloses #1","tree":{"sha":"1278d9eac75d336a95a76416db3abb2d0da816d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/1278d9eac75d336a95a76416db3abb2d0da816d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/commits/a9bd0caf495f8b33703b54c96f865b4f96a8eeec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/a9bd0caf495f8b33703b54c96f865b4f96a8eeec","node_id":"C_kwDOTaeEX9oAKGE5YmQwY2FmNDk1ZjhiMzM3MDNiNTRjOTZmODY1YjRmOTZhOGVlZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/96c7b25803f4ea83255246edc426ef92e95ffc0f","sha":"96c7b25803f4ea83255246edc426ef92e95ffc0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/96c7b25803f4ea83255246edc426ef92e95ffc0f"}],"sha":"a9bd0caf495f8b33703b54c96f865b4f96a8eeec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/a9bd0caf495f8b33703b54c96f865b4f96a8eeec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/96c7b25803f4ea83255246edc426ef92e95ffc0f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:07:15Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:07:15Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"Merge branch ''feature/fase-9-dependency-upgrades'' into develop\n\nFase 9 — monorepo-wide dependency upgrade across all 7 workspaces:\n\n- React 18->19, Next.js 15->16 (--webpack on the 2 Module Federation apps,\n  Turbopack default on portal) — validated with a real manual MF smoke test\n  (dev servers against the live backend, real login flow, zero RUNTIME-006)\n- Prisma 5->7 (driver adapter architecture, prisma.config.ts)\n- Tailwind v3->v4 (CSS-first config)\n- 10 more majors: fastify plugins (cors/helmet/rate-limit), bcryptjs,\n  @hookform/resolvers+react-hook-form, lucide-react, tailwind-merge, jsdom,\n  vitest+@vitest/coverage-v8+@vitejs/plugin-react (pulls Vite 8)\n- ESLint intentionally kept at v8 (explicit scope decision, not deferred)\n- @testcontainers/postgresql intentionally kept at v10 — v12 hard-requires\n  Node >=22.19, our runtime is Node 20 everywhere; documented, not silent\n\nAll 561 tests pass across all 7 workspaces. Full docker compose build+up\nverified: all 7 containers healthy, real login flow through the gateway,\nMF host page and remoteEntry.js both serving correctly. Fixed 2 real\nDockerfile bugs surfaced along the way (hoisting-dependent node_modules\nCOPY, missing tsconfig.base.json for prisma.config.ts''s TS loader).","tree":{"sha":"44c78639017bd0f1698edcbb450e234a1c8d61d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/44c78639017bd0f1698edcbb450e234a1c8d61d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/commits/96c7b25803f4ea83255246edc426ef92e95ffc0f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/96c7b25803f4ea83255246edc426ef92e95ffc0f","node_id":"C_kwDOTaeEX9oAKDk2YzdiMjU4MDNmNGVhODMyNTUyNDZlZGM0MjZlZjkyZTk1ZmZjMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/47968a07a04181fd3f88fd973404955c6200aa9f","sha":"47968a07a04181fd3f88fd973404955c6200aa9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/47968a07a04181fd3f88fd973404955c6200aa9f"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/c51c3c3e44572bc62fe887cf0bb1e320c8b5e628","sha":"c51c3c3e44572bc62fe887cf0bb1e320c8b5e628","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/c51c3c3e44572bc62fe887cf0bb1e320c8b5e628"}],"sha":"96c7b25803f4ea83255246edc426ef92e95ffc0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/96c7b25803f4ea83255246edc426ef92e95ffc0f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/c51c3c3e44572bc62fe887cf0bb1e320c8b5e628/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:06:09Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:06:09Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"docs(fase-9): document dependency-upgrade findings in ARCHITECTURE.md + roadmap\n\nFollows the doc''s existing \"nota de revisão\" pattern (used for the Fase 0\ndomain pivot and the Fase 8 shell-topology change) rather than silently\nrewriting history:\n\n- Section 06 (Module Federation): code samples showed shared.react/react-dom\n  without eager/requiredVersion — now matches the actual (fixed) config, with\n  the RUNTIME-006 root cause explained (Next''s App Router always vendors its\n  own internal React build for RSC, independent of the app''s declared React\n  version — not something the React 19 bump itself resolves).\n- Section 08 (Design System): Tailwind v3->v4 CSS-first config shift.\n- Section 12 (Prisma): v5->v7 architecture shift (driver adapter,\n  prisma.config.ts, WASM query compiler replacing the Rust engine).\n- Section 19 (Docker): the 2 real Dockerfile bugs found and fixed today\n  (hoisting-dependent node_modules COPY, missing tsconfig.base.json for\n  prisma.config.ts''s TS loader).\n- Roadmap (section 31 / README): Fase 9 entry, including the testcontainers\n  v12 Node-version blocker as a documented decision, not a silent gap.","tree":{"sha":"44c78639017bd0f1698edcbb450e234a1c8d61d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/44c78639017bd0f1698edcbb450e234a1c8d61d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/commits/c51c3c3e44572bc62fe887cf0bb1e320c8b5e628","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/c51c3c3e44572bc62fe887cf0bb1e320c8b5e628","node_id":"C_kwDOTaeEX9oAKGM1MWMzYzNlNDQ1NzJiYzYyZmU4ODdjZjBiYjFlMzIwYzhiNWU2Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/698803d88be0904c119fdca6390be944aa4965e8","sha":"698803d88be0904c119fdca6390be944aa4965e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/698803d88be0904c119fdca6390be944aa4965e8"}],"sha":"c51c3c3e44572bc62fe887cf0bb1e320c8b5e628","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/c51c3c3e44572bc62fe887cf0bb1e320c8b5e628"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/698803d88be0904c119fdca6390be944aa4965e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:02:40Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T14:02:40Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"fix(docker): resolve 2 real build breakages surfaced by the Fase 9 dependency bumps\n\nDocker builds were blocked all session by an environmental TLS cert issue\n(now resolved) — this is the first time these Dockerfiles ran far enough\nto hit either bug, both pre-existing and unrelated to the TLS issue itself:\n\n1. All 5 service/app Dockerfiles hardcode a COPY of a workspace-local\n   node_modules dir from the deps stage. npm''s hoisting decides per-install\n   whether a workspace needs any locally-nested packages at all — with the\n   now-cleaner post-upgrade dependency tree, api-gateway''s isolated install\n   hoists everything to root and never creates that dir, so the COPY failed\n   outright (\"not found\"). Added a defensive `mkdir -p` right after each\n   `npm ci`, so the directory (even if empty) always exists.\n\n2. auth-service/properties-service: prisma.config.ts (new in the Prisma 7\n   migration) is TS, so Prisma''s CLI loader resolves the workspace''s\n   tsconfig.json, which extends ../../tsconfig.base.json — never copied\n   into either the build or runtime stage. Added the copy to both stages\n   (runtime needs it too: `prisma migrate deploy` runs at container start).\n   This was the exact gap flagged as \"unverified\" in the Prisma 7 commit.\n\nVerified with a full docker compose build + up: all 7 containers healthy,\nreal login through api-gateway succeeded (using a user created earlier\nthis session under bcryptjs v2 — confirms v3''s compare() backward\ncompatibility under real conditions, not just the isolated scratch test),\nand the properties-frontend MF host page + auth-frontend''s remoteEntry.js\nboth serve correctly.","tree":{"sha":"032b9e4e74d1c1d82aa6539e6f3a2a1ac6a9bde7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/032b9e4e74d1c1d82aa6539e6f3a2a1ac6a9bde7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/commits/698803d88be0904c119fdca6390be944aa4965e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/698803d88be0904c119fdca6390be944aa4965e8","node_id":"C_kwDOTaeEX9oAKDY5ODgwM2Q4OGJlMDkwNGMxMTlmZGNhNjM5MGJlOTQ0YWE0OTY1ZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/77de74d669ce05e51c44bd4f17781439393159fb","sha":"77de74d669ce05e51c44bd4f17781439393159fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/77de74d669ce05e51c44bd4f17781439393159fb"}],"sha":"698803d88be0904c119fdca6390be944aa4965e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/698803d88be0904c119fdca6390be944aa4965e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/77de74d669ce05e51c44bd4f17781439393159fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T13:45:22Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T13:45:22Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"chore(deps): bump vitest 3->4, @vitest/coverage-v8 3->4, @vitejs/plugin-react 4->6\n\nBiggest of the remaining major bumps: @vitejs/plugin-react v6 requires\nVite ^8.0.0 (v4 required Vite ^4-5), so this pulls Vite 8 (Rolldown-oriented\nrelease line) transitively into all 4 frontend-ish workspaces'' test tooling.\nvitest v4 and @vitest/coverage-v8 v4 must move in lockstep (coverage-v8''s\npeerDep pins the exact vitest patch version) across all 7 workspaces.\nNode 20.20.2 (our runtime) satisfies Vite 8''s engines range (^20.19.0), so\nunlike testcontainers this one isn''t hard-blocked, just bigger blast radius.\n\nTwo real breakages found and fixed, not routed around:\n\n1. jest-dom matcher types silently stopped working (toBeInTheDocument,\n   toHaveClass, etc. all \"property does not exist\" on Assertion<T>). Root\n   cause: vitest 4 moved the real `Assertion`/`AsymmetricMatchersContaining`\n   interfaces from a local declaration in ''vitest'' to ''@vitest/expect''\n   (''vitest'' now just re-exports them). TS module augmentation can''t merge\n   into a re-export, only the module that originally declares the interface\n   — so @testing-library/jest-dom@6.9.1''s own `declare module ''vitest''`\n   augmentation (latest available version) is now a silent no-op. Added\n   vitest-jest-dom.d.ts to all 4 frontend-ish workspaces, augmenting\n   ''@vitest/expect'' directly via jest-dom''s own /matchers export.\n\n2. After the bump, `npm install` gave every workspace its own nested vitest\n   copy instead of one hoisted root copy, but jest-dom stayed hoisted at\n   root — its runtime vitest.mjs entrypoint (`import ''vitest''`) couldn''t\n   resolve any ''vitest'' from root anymore. `npm dedupe` fixed the hoisting.\n\nAll 561 tests across all 7 workspaces pass (97+70+93+80 frontend, 33+101+87\nbackend unit, +9+8 backend integration via testcontainers v10). Production\nbuilds unaffected (Next.js apps build via webpack/Turbopack, not Vite —\nthis only touches the vitest-driven test tooling).","tree":{"sha":"6592e447d98d7d2ce1bee9c40f774c0ce5c4e030","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/6592e447d98d7d2ce1bee9c40f774c0ce5c4e030"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/commits/77de74d669ce05e51c44bd4f17781439393159fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/77de74d669ce05e51c44bd4f17781439393159fb","node_id":"C_kwDOTaeEX9oAKDc3ZGU3NGQ2NjljZTA1ZTUxYzQ0YmQ0ZjE3NzgxNDM5MzkzMTU5ZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/9e81fcd2e3d98091245c8542390a8fe48b27ddd9","sha":"9e81fcd2e3d98091245c8542390a8fe48b27ddd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/9e81fcd2e3d98091245c8542390a8fe48b27ddd9"}],"sha":"77de74d669ce05e51c44bd4f17781439393159fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/77de74d669ce05e51c44bd4f17781439393159fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/9e81fcd2e3d98091245c8542390a8fe48b27ddd9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T13:27:10Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T13:27:10Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"chore(deps): bump jsdom 25->29 across all 4 frontend-ish packages\n\nNode 20.20.2 (our runtime) satisfies jsdom v29''s engines range\n(^20.19.0 || ^22.13.0 || >=24.0.0). All 340 tests across packages/ui,\nauth-frontend, properties-frontend, portal pass unmodified.\n\nDid NOT bump @testcontainers/postgresql 10->12 as originally planned:\nv12''s bundled undici@8.7.0 hard-requires Node >=22.19.0\n(webidl.util.markAsUncloneable, a newer Node internal), and our runtime\nis Node 20.20.2 everywhere (local + the node:20-alpine Docker base image\nin every service Dockerfile) — integration tests fail immediately with\n`TypeError: webidl.util.markAsUncloneable is not a function`, confirmed\nby checking the installed package''s own engines field. This isn''t a\ncompatibility risk to weigh, it''s a hard wall: v12 cannot run until the\nNode runtime itself moves to 22+, which is an infra decision out of scope\nhere. Reverted to ^10.16.0 (still current, verified working via a real\ntestcontainers run against both services'' integration suites).","tree":{"sha":"c957bc18ff130b8ab4502e10115041d1ca59fa08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/c957bc18ff130b8ab4502e10115041d1ca59fa08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/commits/9e81fcd2e3d98091245c8542390a8fe48b27ddd9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/9e81fcd2e3d98091245c8542390a8fe48b27ddd9","node_id":"C_kwDOTaeEX9oAKDllODFmY2QyZTNkOTgwOTEyNDVjODU0MjM5MGE4ZmU0OGIyN2RkZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/39e4b091218de3b3a54d790636bfc8387cb9a00c","sha":"39e4b091218de3b3a54d790636bfc8387cb9a00c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/39e4b091218de3b3a54d790636bfc8387cb9a00c"}],"sha":"9e81fcd2e3d98091245c8542390a8fe48b27ddd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/9e81fcd2e3d98091245c8542390a8fe48b27ddd9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/39e4b091218de3b3a54d790636bfc8387cb9a00c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T13:18:46Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T13:18:46Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"chore(deps): bump lucide-react 0.454->1.24, tailwind-merge 2->3\n\nlucide-react''s 1.0 is API-stable (still just tree-shaken icon components);\nReact 19 already listed in its peerDependencies range. tailwind-merge v3\nis the version that understands Tailwind v4''s class syntax, so this pairs\nnaturally with the Tailwind v4 migration already on this branch.\n\nAlso fixes an eslint-disable-comment placement bug in renderWithUser.tsx:\nthe previous commit''s pre-commit prettier hook reformatted the function\nsignature onto multiple lines, silently moving the disable-next-line off\nthe line it was suppressing (caught by re-running lint here, unrelated to\nthis dependency bump but found in the same pass). Switched to an inline\neslint-disable-line so it can''t drift from its target again.\n\nAll 190 tests (97 ui + 93 portal) pass; portal production build verified.","tree":{"sha":"439f7596