"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/df293bcb47df2e14b14d5dcc2a38950e46ada9e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T13:06:57Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T13:06:57Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"feat(ci): add GitHub Actions pipeline and close out Fase 6 docs\n\n.github/workflows/ci.yml: lint, typecheck, test (cobertura via os\nthresholds ja configurados em cada vitest.config.ts, sem job separado de\ncoverage-gate), build (so os 2 frontends tem script build de verdade) em\ntodo PR/push pra develop/main; build das 5 imagens Docker (matrix, sem\npush, sem registry configurado ainda) so em push pra main.\n\nDecisao consciente: todos os workspaces rodam sempre, sem deteccao de\n\"so o que mudou\" (dorny/paths-filter ou equivalente) — nao da pra testar\nYAML do GitHub Actions localmente antes do push, entao preferi um\npipeline simples e confiavel a um \"esperto\" que so se prova certo depois\nde rodar de verdade. Com 6 workspaces e suites rapidas, o custo de rodar\ntudo sempre e baixo.\n\ndocs/ARCHITECTURE.md secoes 06/21 e roadmap: Fase 6 marcada concluida\n(Module Federation + docker-compose completo + smoke e2e + CI/CD).\nREADME.md: diagrama/nota de estado atualizados (Module Federation ja\nimplementada, nao so intencao), roadmap, secao nova de CI/CD.","tree":{"sha":"8512e5cc59a4c5a659706737230251917915bea6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/8512e5cc59a4c5a659706737230251917915bea6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/commits/df293bcb47df2e14b14d5dcc2a38950e46ada9e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/df293bcb47df2e14b14d5dcc2a38950e46ada9e1","node_id":"C_kwDOTaeEX9oAKGRmMjkzYmNiNDdkZjJlMTRiMTRkNWRjYzJhMzg5NTBlNDZhZGE5ZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commit/d1636635f11b9db9e5a6a632fd7ad020295fe509","sha":"d1636635f11b9db9e5a6a632fd7ad020295fe509","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/d1636635f11b9db9e5a6a632fd7ad020295fe509"}],"sha":"df293bcb47df2e14b14d5dcc2a38950e46ada9e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/df293bcb47df2e14b14d5dcc2a38950e46ada9e1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/d1636635f11b9db9e5a6a632fd7ad020295fe509/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T13:02:51Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T13:02:51Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"fix(docker): make docker-compose completo actually work end to end\n\nDocker Desktop ficou disponivel pela primeira vez na sessao. Rodei a stack\ncompleta de verdade (docker compose up --build) pela primeira vez e cada\num dos 7 servicos falhou por um motivo diferente. Achados e correcoes,\nem ordem:\n\n1. Dockerfiles dos 2 frontends nunca copiavam package.json/tsconfig.base.json/\n   .eslintrc.base.json da raiz pro estagio build — `npm run build --workspace`\n   precisa do primeiro pra resolver o workspace, os apps extendem os outros\n   dois. Nunca foi exercitado antes (build local sempre rodou fora do Docker).\n\n2. binaryTargets do Prisma: o engine gerado por padrao (compilado pra OpenSSL\n   1.1) nao carrega no node:20-alpine (OpenSSL 3.x) — \"Error loading shared\n   library libssl.so.1.1\". Adicionado linux-musl-openssl-3.0.x. Sozinho nao\n   bastou: a deteccao de OpenSSL do Prisma em runtime tambem precisa do\n   pacote `openssl` instalado no Alpine (`apk add openssl`), senao ela\n   falha silenciosamente e escolhe o binario errado mesmo tendo o certo\n   disponivel.\n\n3. HEALTHCHECK usando `localhost` — dentro do Alpine isso resolve pra ::1\n   (IPv6) antes de 127.0.0.1, mas Fastify/Next só escutam em IPv4 (0.0.0.0).\n   \"Connection refused\" com o processo rodando normal. Corrigido nos\n   Dockerfiles E no docker-compose.yml — o healthcheck do compose.yml\n   sobrescreve o HEALTHCHECK do Dockerfile inteiramente, corrigir só um\n   dos dois não tem efeito nenhum (isso custou 3 rebuilds pra descobrir).\n\n4. server.js do output standalone do Next usa process.env.HOSTNAME pra\n   bind — o Docker seta HOSTNAME=<container id> automaticamente em todo\n   container, entao sem ENV HOSTNAME=0.0.0.0 explicito o server escuta só\n   no IP interno do container, nunca em 127.0.0.1/localhost. Mesma classe\n   de bug: PORT tambem tem default 3000 sempre, sem ENV PORT explicito\n   properties-frontend (porta 3003) nunca escutava na porta certa.\n\n5. Nunca existiam migrations Prisma de verdade (só db push nos testes de\n   integração) — banco novo sobe sem tabelas. Geradas as migrations init\n   pra auth-service e properties-service, e o CMD de cada Dockerfile agora\n   roda `prisma migrate deploy` antes de subir o server. Precisou de\n   `chown -R node:node /app` antes do `USER node` — migrate deploy escreve\n   em node_modules/@prisma/engines, sem isso o usuário não-root nao tinha\n   permissão.\n\n6. middleware.ts do properties-frontend usava request.url pra montar o\n   redirectTo do redirect cross-origin pro auth-frontend — no server.js\n   standalone isso reflete o HOSTNAME/PORT de bind (0.0.0.0), nao o Host\n   header real da requisição. Um redirect de verdade vazaria\n   \"http://0.0.0.0:3003/...\" (não navegável por um browser real). Corrigido\n   pra montar a URL a partir do header Host, com fallback pro nextUrl.\n\nDepois de tudo isso: os 7 serviços sobem healthy, e o fluxo completo foi\nvalidado via curl direto (não só testes com mock) — registro, login, /me,\nCRUD + busca + métricas de imóveis, tudo através do api-gateway, com\nverificação de JWT entre serviços funcionando (auth-service assina,\nproperties-service verifica, sem chamada de rede entre eles). Confirmado\ntambém que o bundle client do properties-frontend referencia o container\nfederado correto do Module Federation.\n\nAdicionado Makefile na raiz com os comandos mais comuns (test, lint,\ndocker-up, etc.) — atalho pros scripts já agregados no package.json.","tree":{"sha":"7b37882df7307b7510a8b7419bfc8f924925030c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/7b37882df7307b7510a8b7419bfc8f924925030c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/commits/d1636635f11b9db9e5a6a632fd7ad020295fe509","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com