7bd1b378501851fed93288174","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/4c3ac5711368fd97bd1b378501851fed93288174"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/2ee8e68ea9b9399a0f844b34bbbd04114ee6d44c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T12:04:50Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T12:04:50Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"feat(module-federation): wire raw ModuleFederationPlugin (auth-frontend to properties-frontend)\n\nPesquisa antes de implementar: @module-federation/nextjs-mf esta sendo\ndescontinuado (nunca suportou App Router, sem desenvolvimento ativo). A\nalternativa que surgiu (@vercel/microfrontends) e acoplada a infra de\nroteamento da propria Vercel, nao serve pro Docker Compose self-hosted deste\nprojeto. Confirmado com o usuario (opcoes apresentadas): seguir com\nModuleFederationPlugin cru via @module-federation/enhanced/webpack,\nregistrado direto no webpack() de cada next.config.js, sem o wrapper\nNext-aware.\n\nauth-frontend (remote) expoe Header/AuthStatus/UserMenu via\nstatic/chunks/remoteEntry.js. properties-frontend (host) consome\nauthFrontend/Header no layout raiz via dynamic(..., { ssr: false }),\nenvolto num FederationErrorBoundary (fallback local minimo se o remote\nestiver fora do ar).\n\nAchado no processo: mesmo com ssr:false, o App Router ainda resolve o\nspecifier do modulo remoto na compilacao SERVER pra gerar o client\nreference manifest do RSC — sem o plugin registrado nessa passada (so\nregistramos no client, de proposito), o import federado cru derrubava a\npagina inteira com 500. Corrigido com um resolve.alias apontando so a\npassada server pra um stub trivial; a passada client mantem a federacao\nreal.\n\nValidado com os dois dev servers reais rodando simultaneamente (nao so\ntestes com mocks): build de producao limpo nos dois apps, SSR do host sem\nerro, e o bundle client do host confirmado referenciando o container\nfederado correto (webpack/container/remote/authFrontend/Header).\n\nRemoteHeader.tsx e o stub de server ficam fora da cobertura de testes —\nimportam um modulo virtual do webpack que Vite/Vitest nao resolve,\nvalidados via build real + smoke test. FederationErrorBoundary (a logica\nde fallback em si) e testado normalmente.","tree":{"sha":"06ef30922762c8b7f2f5d0f73c1b27a19e6cc9f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/trees/06ef30922762c8b7f2f5d0f73c1b27a19e6cc9f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/git/commits/2ee8e68ea9b9399a0f844b34bbbd04114ee6d44c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86727275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/events{/privacy}","followers_url