ngston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasLevingston","id":86727275,"login":"LucasLevingston","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3Mjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucasLevingston","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LucasLevingston/ImobCore/commits/0b50e5d9a2d7f199a064c82096903d328ffab7fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T18:32:44Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T18:32:44Z","email":"lucaolevingston@outlook.com","name":"Lucas Levingston"},"message":"feat(api-gateway): implement proxy service with CORS, rate-limit and request-id\n\nÚnico ponto de entrada HTTP público pra auth-service e properties-service.\n@fastify/http-proxy encaminha /api/auth/* e /api/properties/* com rewrite de\nprefixo correto pra cada upstream; GET /health/ready agrega o /health dos dois\nservices. Sem lógica de domínio — só cross-cutting (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md seção\n04a). 19 testes (Supertest + upstreams fake via Fastify em memória, sem Docker),\ncobertura 95%+. Pinned @fastify/http-proxy@^11.5.0 (versões anteriores tinham\nvulnerabilidade crítica de bypass de header via Connection).\n\nSmoke test real: dois processos tsx reais (auth-service + gateway) conversando\npor HTTP, confirmando proxy/headers/health-check funcionando de ponta a ponta.","tree":{"sha":"c639624e61d9adb7271993a2ba50c443dcb41990","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/