ae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2133184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zackarychapple","id":2133184,"login":"zackarychapple","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzMxODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZephyrCloudIO/tap-miniapp-examples/commits/6a8ca48cbcd989f024177ebea85c77dbfecc87a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T17:07:52Z","email":"zackarychapple30@gmail.com","name":"Zack Chapple"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T17:07:52Z","email":"zackarychapple30@gmail.com","name":"Zack Chapple"},"message":"feat(examples): ship versioned code review skills in Engineering Change\n\nAdd the RFC''s skills layer as four signed agent.skill contributions on\nthe example package, each a versioned, lifecycle-specific procedure with\ncontract inputs, evidence requirements, and output expectations:\n\n- security-impact-hypothesis (shaping phase, gated on changes.propose)\n- security-implementation-review (post-implementation, changes.review)\n- architecture-review (both phases, changes.review)\n- review-coordinator (synthesis, changes.review) — deduplicates,\n  verifies, and reconciles candidate findings without waiving or\n  dispositioning them\n\nThe coordinator specialist''s spawner prompt now routes through the\nskill bundle, validate-manifest.mjs pins the four contributions and\ntheir SKILL.md frontmatter, and the packaged asset lock carries the\nversioned skills trees.\n\nRefs #16","tree":{"sha":"6b6b6791f19344dacd45d61f971b0a000050bf1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZephyrCloudIO/tap-miniapp-examples/git/trees/6b6b6791f19344dacd45d61f971b0a000050bf1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZephyrCloudIO/tap-miniapp-examples/git/commits/6a8ca48cbcd989f024177ebea85c77dbfecc87a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2133184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zackarychapple","id":2133184,"login":"zackarychapple","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzMxODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZephyrCloudIO/tap-miniapp-examples/commit/6a8ca48cbcd989f024177ebea85c77dbfecc87a4","node_id":"C_kwDOTahVXtoAKDZhOGNhNDhjYmNkOTg5ZjAyNDE3N2ViZWE4NWM3N2RiZmVjYzg3YTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ZephyrCloudIO/tap-miniapp-examples/commit/2d3c94b1efd2dcdf7a7a7a0f003f53a149c51a69","sha":"2d3c94b1efd2dcdf7a7a7a0f003f53a149c51a69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZephyrCloudIO/tap-miniapp-examples/commits/2d3c94b1efd2dcdf7a7a7a0f003f53a149c51a69"}],"sha":"6a8ca48cbcd989f024177ebea85c77dbfecc87a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZephyrCloudIO/tap-miniapp-examples/commits/6a8ca48cbcd989f024177ebea85c77dbfecc87a4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2133184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zackarychapple","id":2133184,"login":"zackarychapple","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzMxODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZephyrCloudIO/tap-miniapp-examples/commits/2d3c94b1efd2dcdf7a7a7a0f003f53a149c51a69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T12:46:19Z","email":"zackarychapple30@gmail.com","name":"Zack Chapple"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T12:46:19Z","email":"zackarychapple30@gmail.com","name":"Zack Chapple"},"message":"feat(examples): add Engineering Change RFC brief and miniapp\n\nAuthor the public RFC for a CKG-powered Engineering Change miniapp\n(issue #16), crediting the two Cloudflare engineering posts it adapts —\nengineering standards enforcement and AI code review at scale — and\ndefining the vertical slice: one Change Proposal classified by scoped\nAssurance Policies, Impact Hypothesis before implementation, exact\nrevision-bound Impact Evidence after, coordinated review with a\nnon-waiving coordinator, human finding dispositions, and observable\n(not enforced) work readiness.\n\nShip apps/engineering-change as the public example: a governed change\nledger with the full lifecycle (draft through closed, late entry when\nimplementation exists), policy evaluation with locked-workspace floors\nand low-confidence escalation, Impact Hypothesis/Evidence capture\nthrough governed host-mediated reads, review contributions and findings\nwith the five human dispositions, an append-only audit trail, a\npackage-owned coordinator specialist, four read-only QuickJS MCP tools,\nand a 12-action permission catalog with positive and denial Test Lab\ncoverage for every action.\n\nRefs #16","tree":{"sha":"3f0e8458dc1bfea4e00ed2e289538049be955b62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZephyrCloudIO/tap-miniapp-examples/git/trees/3f0e8458dc1bfea4e00ed2e289538049be955b62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZephyrCloudIO/tap-miniapp-examples/git/commits/2d3c94b1efd2dcdf7a7a7a0f003f53a149c51a69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2133184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zackarychapple","id":2133184,"login":"zackarychapple","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzMxODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackarychapple/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api