ents{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/77a8feae44237b74391492defd79ac51fa311a6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T20:27:57Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T20:27:57Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"message":"fix(bff): use in-cluster CA cert in Helm kubeconfig for self-signed API servers\n\nHelm operations failed on clusters with self-signed certificates because\nthe generated kubeconfig didn''t reference the service account CA bundle.\nNow includes certificate-authority pointing to the mounted ca.crt when\navailable, falling back to no TLS config (or insecure mode if opted in).\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bd65ff7472746fb0f2fac1ac4e5a2f66ca6bb2af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/bd65ff7472746fb0f2fac1ac4e5a2f66ca6bb2af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/77a8fea