07-17T21:44:52Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T21:44:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(lifecycle): guard Close button click during in-progress operations (#102)\n\nisAriaDisabled only sets aria-disabled on the DOM element and does not\nsuppress click events. Guard the onClick handler so that clicking Close\nwhile an operation is running is a no-op, preventing premature teardown\nof UI state while the BFF Helm operation continues asynchronously.\n\nAdd a test to verify the click is suppressed during in-progress state.\n\nFixes #97\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b99eba51410b423f8670f47a8315ceecf803323f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/b99eba51410b423f8670f47a8315ceecf803323f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/82636e2431a9ec022ae34ef38b14ec2f072f5902","verification":{"payload":"tree b99eba51410b423f8670f47a8315ceecf803323f\nparent e4f7727eed70bad1fee8880eb48cbe0185806444\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784324692 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784324692 -0400\n\nfix(lifecycle): guard Close button click during in-progress operations (#102)\n\nisAriaDisabled only sets aria-disabled on the DOM element and does not\nsuppress click events. Guard the onClick handler so that clicking Close\nwhile an operation is running is a no-op, preventing premature teardown\nof UI state while the BFF Helm operation continues asynchronously.\n\nAdd a test to verify the click is suppressed during in-progress state.\n\nFixes #97\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SI