4c96b1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/45c970698c456df79ac97db6ee48e856529c3173","verification":{"payload":"tree e44cb9f3dee1ada37ca0b67c5dc68b6594c96b1c\nparent 281fb286a2c05c402b29f9f442b833660dd48899\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784310327 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784310327 -0400\n\nfix(chart): separate secrets into own ClusterRole rule without watch verb (#94)\n\nSplits secrets out of the bundled core resources rule and removes the\nwatch verb, which is not needed for Helm lifecycle operations. This\nreduces the ClusterRole''s scope for defense in depth, complementing\nthe automountServiceAccountToken: false already in the pod spec.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWmo3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmqMQABFGjKEim8QML9JDH2D8HBXG\nqj258EH91EajyS2d4EkzN+rT+dmls/D3/CwfWtkANDD1PEdv/kEf3G7yHzqmTqcj\nha2G2DeyLz2nIk3V2IqJWEAAL2rWxEISRgu6170uIXzUbU/fBCs1tGl6TrCkvpxu\ns70Ms6XvIWpNutaqYtFfIqGlXCe4Tgjaz3uYYaXf4GZUnF7mjhk0F/eHltmPUHdE\niFEriI9Ctunfr7ULYCsrOTQxCyiiC8JHWmt9w+o2J+HfUuSEo+kWpqtK4cIuXrZh\n6HhFgiGL/BEfz54yklv4gqpdxSArPQMNWKvD6/OUi2DHCDXL0LBx19IHTe4pd5iX\njGOU1ew4gZMSnbtmfL7fT+DJcy+DTLWsbgo5snKR4o9kDuXFzJvUtjX70pJ8eQb/\nbOH82QnDlKZRKrOvQMBhSITVoGPLwgIja5t16dabz8tAcYzUpClIhz5ZVoNq+PFx\nhCSzlN2dGX8ruFqGGANMSJ6Puu1FM97K0A6p51rI9Yre6wWk+u6UsJ5Zz41PwMgi\nrieMXfdXiZXN+q8p6zlpJ9aJ8yME5tAm6mj5dKIUcwdHXXMWml4fHdoytObJ5qSf\nG2Smyv4FExGSdSBNZlJWROBUyqkSHvvEJQJ1v2DAMbQ7Ie5B2Airh1m+b9+phnV1\nyVSmU/ngQbM6oX8BoDiI\n=kTnz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-17T17:45:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/