lved-name check (`eq $saName \"default\"`) with a\nsource-values check so that explicitly naming a ServiceAccount \"default\"\nwith `bff.serviceAccount.create=true` is no longer incorrectly blocked.\nThe dangerous case — `bff.serviceAccount.create=false` with no name set —\nstill fails as expected.\n\nFixes #90\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWmllCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgv0QAEY25jZO/x97blwkRo8Cnv52\noV9yXHq5lEQoXOVz2rZ3SAY9ICMQykWDLR2ioVVCaFUt7hlWfjK03EGmlhMzJpdI\n7fH9JK8CiTmS29FhK4eM1rEp8hBGYIvOV6s/gccYKmkB16LTY8WzLW/Rj9nXlxWy\nJSxsa/R/dECXL+7hasWbMnynIYKZxIDFkDsZVhFxgHzS3ZHT2xAG/z2tX1m185Fu\npTHgJD+FQPpcswWYO18DpUlPzEn5KE0GSeBsYRIdMsoZxhglS+cWxAh4jDSL/y2C\nLwdIbZKiSRWpjghUPDJ18xFdjNGENJzuUVuxLlSWy32h3QSdLTnckswLwC3EyKZL\nNkapssf0J4Risbxz6KtM1LQFhefPF2FN1uUOAVcoOpHywrAaGXRRDtdYXL5uHArW\nI3YRWOmE5wnCQ2Cadz3Wu2Mp9l93lKxZelBd+T/71h6u//w8mgu5ChHvl0PQQ40i\nPMerhbyj45GLh5LfRI4cOYaDcxazx6SEsM2ObN20oP/9ZvUKLY7k/xqXq2coYJSA\nbuy0dcVWKrTqhY44RTRjcygRswTD2EuakuvZPr/a85lgeB2UBScyQNuWtwQq0I+7\n162mYqT8P/+1leMtBFQ98e27mLh6NAjTmvm9I6lSOmAKSG90ezQ3o7aw0TzKDzb+\nhmwSG2qinvx6J1vH/yDh\n=aTO4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-17T17:41:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commit/281fb286a2c05c402b29f9f442b833660dd48899","node_id":"C_kwDOTaij69oAKDI4MWZiMjg2YTJjMDVjNDAyYjI5ZjlmNDQyYjgzMzY2MGRkNDg4OTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commit/faa05d193f17ae6e0ffcd3d1d0d8279a9cb4dde8","sha":"faa05d193f17ae6e0ffcd3d1d0d8279a9cb4dde8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/faa05d193f17ae6e0ffcd3d1d0d8279a9cb4dde8"}],"sha":"281fb286a2c05c402b29f9f442b833660dd48899","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/281fb286a2c05c402b29f9f442b833660dd48899"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/commu