ed token and reduces the attack surface.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b4cd60e30b778ac68d52e5260cfb94b52f80e4ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/b4cd60e30b778ac68d52e5260cfb94b52f80e4ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/3435c1c0465631912ba90f8b104e785f5b2dcd4c","verification":{"payload":"tree b4cd60e30b778ac68d52e5260cfb94b52f80e4ae\nparent c9e96f324e381cd041946fdf0287ff30969af200\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784310105 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784310105 -0400\n\nfix(chart): disable SA token auto-mount in BFF pod spec (#91)\n\nThe BFF never reads the SA token — all Kubernetes API calls and Helm\noperations use the end user''s forwarded Bearer token. Setting\nautomountServiceAccountToken: false on the pod spec removes the\nunnecessarily mounted token and reduces the attack surface.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWmlZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+08QACnIEFeHSbh+TVuIkvOGhC3F\nI9tmdoNEtVA05T3unl/NYj3zINL6ANV69sl36xysqoadtVk9n+oxVVuW+Iv6UFnM\nC4RhN0vGpI7M4AdG9MIHby2r00AS+245aQIf7U2Yj69NsH/ohHrx46dQuPEDq3QR\nBbPdsKX6imeXwDj52s21JU+pN6keD8z+YtL9ORUJH0KBiWNk4ZRpBbEgQWOz1p59\npWKKzRVj5QAXqe+VrQ+Za+yjoRHMm/+n3GI/R1MNbJOwXaqKa3kuY0BoyRuiatn5\nehIP3POmv4WUgBafnyWtROkFEbOGZ8nID85TyV8lOo69sueHUIlFIv6Yh5oGFsxN\n3VJrVBh7Q+g0OLStE8CZ0vj9nhM1BNa0rCqLiSBP58vWMScCvN7Dbl+vg+BllO0T\n/T4zS+TmGBuWyIb38JrT/6zCXENWAUzeJEZR3uYfL4oxPPLiKxgvpm9AnvZveIaD\nRMuR0NuZ3hs50pIAvRu9ATqouM7yffIQFSBo33Xz70zgWgVwhWR30f+YsyCyJT+A\nDWsyLTQ4/23fCbuIbSONQE7FLBRUmjqY7vwaLaq8i3eVPsA7ZoU/qd6zkTeglY8c\n7Xb2hmAud2s9+SABmVokZ07xKT8JSS5jIqBdI8Jhwb2j89J0EZgi182UINdSSM5N\nzbql