3cdfebadd11108f439dcaf5ca82b22e6e1b6a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/01b5de7ccfc60f6c3de244535409ec659d476442/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T15:28:43Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T15:28:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(catalog): show version comparison on catalog cards for installed plugins (#82)\n\nExtends the HelmRelease interface (BFF and frontend) to include\napp_version from helm list output. The hook now exposes a helmVersionMap\n(Map<name, installedVersion>) alongside helmInstalledNames. Catalog cards\ncompare the installed version against the catalog version and display a\n''Update available: X → Y'' label (PatternFly blue Label with\nArrowCircleUpIcon) when they differ; no indicator is shown when versions\nmatch or when version info is unavailable.\n\nCloses #21\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"30b9600fd1ad3be33fa190011e27573de0a6c18d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/30b9600fd1ad3be33fa190011e27573de0a6c18d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/01b5de7ccfc60f6c3de244535409ec659d476442","verification":{"payload":"tree 30b9600fd1ad3be33fa190011e27573de0a6c18d\nparent 139a8ba97ce6069733e5b5a3be5ea5165ccae18d\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784302123 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784302123 -0400\n\nfeat(catalog): show version comparison on catalog cards for installed plugins (#82)\n\nExtends the HelmRelease interface (BFF and frontend) to include\napp_version from helm list output. The hook now exposes a helmVersionMap\n(Map<name, installedVersion>) alongside helmInstalledNames. Catalog cards\ncompare the installed version against the catalog version and display a\n''Update available: X → Y'' label (PatternFly blue Label with\nArrowCircleUpIcon) when they differ; no indicator is shown when versions\nmatch or when version info is unavailable.\n\nCloses #21\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWkorCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARP0QAHV0kV7O0TSmhvw18PeLnbYg\naIcH5b0YQjeS3EkoW7inK/O1FmXMrlJeTKd6tGYQLzlw8DQ9wnz6N36wGAtw9i6M\njeibcBb0vX0YhwbBiowKT/IHPPnZ2VZb5tQHwiC+AmOKWw0JXeT6EQYsBSVpOM+X\nZ1N6PIf3bMT9mQfaMy6Bm/FaQNucJ8/obDH9+ljndt2W0D7jSlbUSRpuEAROb3v6\nxCuoAEVHiJt3pzWd6AfKsIuDmZhmDGXSZmzCTPoK20udZWLxnz+0h5UNB+eMSUdd\nyQvdVP2aV4PuTomqZz+lrpokhm56JZXjGWsONJmjl7j0A/4v4uFAcMMCK34bXQs2\n4UeCeMAkZycTBGrnGRk72WkAQMYi+LZAnoM3dDn3ZIGwX3qZuHFsc4HXEchuEbsr\nmQSsoQCe52Knyb4Pw21eRUOWVwcHwBgKclcFskMsBnPLEmGgLo2O2RhiYx1JmkMV\nIE7kzRfA3pyj73NKsoj69SmerPHpa+7ZOCnLemzZCmWPtOT2XxjJJkt4zWyAtb6v\nv50PAYaKk2xDyHbk