_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/060bf438ac06cfeadfa0abee5b25f01c722c2902/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T15:17:53Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T15:17:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ui): add Enable button for disabled plugins on catalog page (#80)\n\n* fix(ui): add Enable button for disabled plugins on catalog page\n\nCloses #69. After disabling a plugin its Helm release still exists but it\nis removed from MODULE_FEDERATION_CONFIG, making it invisible to the admin\nwith no way to re-enable it.\n\n- BFF: add `helmListAllNamespaces()` to helmService and expose it via a new\n  `GET /api/plugins` endpoint that returns all installed Helm releases\n- Frontend: add `useHelmReleasedPlugins` hook that fetches that endpoint to\n  build a set of Helm-installed plugin names\n- CatalogPage: block on Helm data load alongside MODULE_FEDERATION_CONFIG;\n  show an orange \"Disabled\" badge on cards for plugins that are Helm-installed\n  but not in MODULE_FEDERATION_CONFIG; add \"Disabled\" to the install-state\n  filter options; wire Refresh to also refetch Helm and installed-names data;\n  pass `helmInstalledNames` to PluginDetailModal\n- PluginDetailModal: accept optional `helmInstalledNames` prop; derive\n  `disabled = helmInstalled && !enabled`; show \"Disabled\" badge in the modal\n  header; replace install buttons with Enable + Remove buttons for disabled\n  plugins; add `onEnable` handler that calls `lifecycle.enable()`\n- Fix pre-existing BFF test compilation error: add js-yaml type stub and\n  fix helmService partial mock so validateHelmValues keeps its real impl\n- Tests: new useHelmReleasedPlugins hook tests; new CatalogPage Disabled-badge\n  tests; new PluginDetailModal disabled-state tests; new GET /api/plugins\n  route tests; helmListAllNamespaces unit tests\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review findings (round 1)\n\n- Remove internal try/catch from helmListAllNamespaces so errors propagate to the route handler''s catch block\n- Update helmService tests to expect thrown errors instead of empty arrays\n- Add blank line between router.get(''/'') closing brace and K8S_NAMESPACE_PATTERN constant\n- Remove multi-line JSDoc comment from useHelmReleasedPlugins\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"14dd122f54f0c24d4c8554821e86375264ac80e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/14dd122f54f0c24d4c8554821e86375264ac80e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/060bf438ac06cfeadfa0abee5b25f01c722c2902","verification":{"payload":"tree 14dd122f54f0c24d4c8554821e86375264ac80e1\nparent 54a8ca756ff72a7b1f74a1e65901d01be259e3bb\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784301473 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784301473 -0400\n\nfix(ui): add Enable button for disabled plugins on catalog page (#80)\n\n* fix(ui): add Enable button for disabled plugins on catalog page\n\nCloses #69. After disabling a plugin its Helm release still exists but it\nis removed from MODULE_FEDERATION_CONFIG, making it invisible to the admin\nwith no way to re-enable it.\n\n- BFF: add `helmListAllNamespaces()` to helmService and expose it via a new\n  `GET /api/plugins` endpoint that returns all installed Helm releases\n- Frontend: add `useHelmReleasedPlugins` hook that fetches that endpoint to\n  build a set of Helm-installed plugin names\n- CatalogPage: block on Helm data load alongside MODULE_FEDERATION_CONFIG;\n  show an orange \"Disabled\" badge on cards for plugins that are Helm-installed\n  but not in MODULE_FEDERATION_CONFIG; add \"Disabled\" to the install-state\n  filter options; wire Refresh to also refetch Helm and installed-names data;\n  pass `helmInstalledNames` to PluginDetailModal\n- PluginDetailModal: accept optional `helmInstalledNames` prop; derive\n  `disabled = helmInstalled && !enabled`; show \"Disabled\" badge in the modal\n  header; replace install buttons with Enable + Remove buttons for disabled\n  plugins; add `onEnable` handler that calls `lifecycle.enable()`\n- Fix pre-existing BFF test compilation error: add js-yaml type stub and\n  fix helmService partial mock so validateHelmValues keeps its real impl\n- Tests: new useHelmReleasedPlugins hook tests; new CatalogPage Disabled-badge\n  tests; new PluginDetailModal disabled-state tests; new GET /api/plugins\n  route tests; helmListAllNamespaces unit tests\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review findings (round 1)\n\n- Remove internal try/catch from helmListAllNamespaces so errors propagate to the route handler''s catch block\n- Update helmService tests to expect thrown errors instead of empty arrays\n- Add blank line between router.get(''/'') closing brace and K8S_NAMESPACE_PATTERN constant\n- Remove multi-line JSDoc comment from useHelmReleasedPlugins\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWkehCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYe8QAJXsxn/2v/yqrJLyroKSOS2E\n7DXq/rPZeAeRqSEYer1qCf+EiL4lmBT8lQlqqXIzCwIkWSOYfvOz1DFSy07TGY9m\n4Z6D5cSYBqlUmWrc4QVmRZLNr/D1eUN8SIf3vMMbUql97CMPRflSTweHIzUVdX7J\nHeCzsUczjToz1INKIVAPmJpdxhcF2yp98y4577Ri3HqhqJ+c8zshqawT5hpH5y8m\ndDptLGHduHy/TtZ+7TOFMWM21vMrt4faFnlsYrTrB9ey7DByiM5lR4gVNhcX2n8+\n7A6QASIIvFA9p5bnZlGoqLrjTjocDvriUfqqsmrTauDEjono/yfyQnBhXsFvZBhn\nxlWj9qcYPaEUuj4SzY7nY1dg7bxS9cvMLB/pJ7/ELRLwpolkFupT1zY9tURw+c+7\n6DExuDM4AHwPVwoydk/zAwGzrZ6BE7EdWpWgda1dD39o6DZJ0G43hnlpsu4OOOq7\nhiskg608ROqCGaP+69Uc93CrKZxd2cdniwU3Hx3fGtt9y1TMo8zpxZ/fL0noUWBT\nh/CZbju9Uw+48xPYsx4q0RXrqy1iHpykXf8uS6gpMjmfFaGvn69ptQ4wiz8buRrS\nf1ioGH34znxpMXAV2A2uY74xc2PKNEoeEMJo4N53COsrEEWsGLmglCMB3zdqC7Pl\nIoTuKde5rWOWlorn/IZA\n=Ac0L\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-17T15:17:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.gi