is now downloaded to a temp file,\nverified with sha256sum (failing the build on mismatch), then extracted and\ncleaned up — replacing the previous pipe-to-tar approach that skipped verification.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a17734eef3f5b5c049975ced676dcff47d870e94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/a17734eef3f5b5c049975ced676dcff47d870e94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/cb1b13b615ed6742704f6b0e05dc82c331b00d5f","verification":{"payload":"tree a17734eef3f5b5c049975ced676dcff47d870e94\nparent 5864338d34230e75bc4e5cadf7c19ed415bd81b7\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784299984 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784299984 -0400\n\nfix(containerfile): add SHA256 checksum verification for Helm binary (#75)\n\nPin and verify the SHA256 checksum of the Helm v3.17.3 linux-amd64 tarball\nduring the container build. The tarball is now downloaded to a temp file,\nverified with sha256sum (failing the build on mismatch), then extracted and\ncleaned up — replacing the previous pipe-to-tar approach that skipped verification.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWkHQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAe/UQAF6hPek8qWjPE8qurVuREGKk\n5noFB266J5c6tgflRSaIXX1td+ilqZ/IwhR88u8S91HHIqu0WeFTb5Tr5mU5xeWr\nDPF28+JfL3p+ZcdEsfKP46+4lyELm2K2VKA29gq8/NqTFm/pU7rV2q/Qy75FW6HU\nVh23m1xXCHJIf45PKrhuUexAHIkd4aFPTdxViX8yC14Zxhc62vIqZYSEJae2ZxB5\nXwO3JOeIH5P6YNHVLX91sYUoQTCHCC62FXgEYx0RoY4zO0bH/pSnVZvWDjnbYX+d\nllaIyuiPGoP0ytiig75gCxBHaEk3NaEuiBQ6RIk7oaoA9BPByZ/GO9HTI7XVIEQ8\nuKPGTuI/UWr/1Vlh4rjteQfJS2jTCwLu00xTSZXQ6E4SlM6ygW186SdJpMhrlVbn\nZ8ZBEyozaBz9xb+QI8CrOTK5sOzpNyrJqQbgKcBlRYdphPk