uthor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/5864338d34230e75bc4e5cadf7c19ed415bd81b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T14:53:01Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T14:53:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(k8s): use three-state sentinel for CA cert negative caching (#74)\n\nIntroduce a Buffer | null | undefined sentinel for cachedCaCert so that\na missing CA cert file (null) is distinguishable from the \"not yet\nchecked\" initial state (undefined). Previously the catch block reset\ncachedCaCert to undefined, causing fs.readFileSync to fire on every k8s\nrequest when running outside a pod.\n\nAlso exports getCaCert and adds unit tests covering both the positive\ncache (cert file present) and negative cache (cert file absent) paths.\n\nFixes #70\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87e052db818d1c52ef8935a0e882f2291fb1c2bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/87e052db818d1c52ef8935a0e882f2291fb1c2bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/5864338d34230e75bc4e5cadf7c19ed415bd81b7","verification":{"payload":"tree 87e052db818d1c52ef8935a0e882f2291fb1c2bc\nparent a77963556499daf5541cecb3e3580685765bd412\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784299981 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784299981 -0400\n\nfix(k8s): use three-state sentinel for CA cert negative caching (#74)\n\nIntroduce a Buffer | null | undefined sentinel for cachedCaCert so that\na missing CA cert file (null) is distinguishable from the \"not yet\nchecked\" initial state (undefined). Previously the catch block reset\ncachedCaCert to undefined, causing fs.readFileSync to fire on every k8s\nrequest when running outside a pod.\n\nAlso exports getCaCert and adds unit tests covering both the positive\ncache (cert file present) and negative cache (cert file absent) paths.\n\nFixes #70\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWkHNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqlQQAGdeBZbgwtuX3Ew8SCe7fYOl\nm8mcBN75FFHutRcGwaDg8kFbZ2iy6UZ96Ux811dEDmsFYcL8YvIgIjNGCvInXPaF\n5D+mcVqu8+8JjgdL3vdLP5jw5qu2/T4VcN0OZLflb0GPPasa7lhK+Dskvc2VsMKQ\nSg1SJpu+yYmz1Md9bnX3ZRxpluzaYEV3VrPRJ2xfVL/tjE4v4vMfLrhEMUzax+Zo\n6kpBcqGAzQZONn84PYrH6ZRAm84m4nYaYUqWooGXwyKmTaryqtbQ/tJ0TTLtObkz\nfZ/nAAl3gwe1mNWX0rnbS9InQ3BJscl53VFIvnCUekf8JrxgGBfCxVy/yMm6pXB5\nmHOWFKHnRIbTvYXASbWUE8cGYxLPpCn+PfDMp3XV8a1RCT9z1dRQo4ugcaRCo20D\ny1qiBtsSz9j7UVbsRqp6jgworkVOGxzFmbC3GBe/YTWA+xdvSXUkfnwk+9JotN1H\nIv6eOd8A+o92ESZYwpd4ZMtHdjn2IOqqwh8+t/C1nfomYvad4SXo7rweQY69Urnw\n9U7A6Tou/s3UmKGXBKhM8Y9fiipoBZCdoEIZd0ThHoVOvMfEFzjLFNgszvo0nhaL\nRMorBCdgrB/x8taCaRiHGxU8