hub.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/a77963556499daf5541cecb3e3580685765bd412/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T14:52:58Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T14:52:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(lifecycle): resolve recursive self-call in sanitizeErrorMessage (#73)\n\nReplace the unconditional self-call `const raw = sanitizeErrorMessage(err)`\n(which caused RangeError: Maximum call stack size exceeded on every lifecycle\nerror) with the correct base-case extraction:\n  const raw = err instanceof Error ? err.message : String(err);\n\nExport the function and add unit tests covering: no-infinite-recursion guard,\nError vs non-Error inputs, and all three redaction patterns (kube-token,\nservice-account, api-server IP:port).\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ff3351d1ba031955051dc042d12d711fba71229","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/6ff3351d1ba031955051dc042d12d711fba71229"},"url":"https