imou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/98a10c763f8a2764c374847f6d1206b44bd9ff7d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T14:04:36Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T14:04:36Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"message":"feat(frontend): add plugin lifecycle UI with install/upgrade/remove/enable/disable\n\n- usePluginLifecycle hook for mutation operations against BFF\n- ConfirmRemoveModal requiring name re-typing before removal\n- LifecycleProgressModal with step-by-step progress display\n- PluginDetailModal action buttons now wired to lifecycle hooks\n  (automatic/assisted install, upgrade, disable, remove)\n- InstalledPage table actions wired for upgrade, disable, remove\n- Both pages refetch data on lifecycle completion\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"23456f0ef80f5718be241820bfe0aa01cffd76e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/23456f0ef80f5718be241820bfe0aa01cffd76e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/98a10c763f8a2764c374847f6d1206b44bd9ff7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/us