61ad32fb5e10837915c965d02eaad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T12:27:31Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T12:27:31Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"message":"feat: Phase 5 — Plugin Detail Modal with full metadata and admin action stubs\n\n- Create usePluginDetail hook that fetches GET /api/catalog/:name and\n  resolves installed state from useInstalledPluginNames\n- Rewrite PluginDetailModal from placeholder to full detail modal:\n  header with version/status/maintenance badges, description, maintainer,\n  RHOAI compatibility, deployment model, container images, install method\n  with prerequisites, RBAC requirements, and support links\n- Add admin-only action buttons (Install/Upgrade/Disable/Remove) as\n  aria-disabled stubs for Phase 6 implementation\n- Pass isAdmin prop from CatalogPage and InstalledPage to the modal\n- Add useCurrentUser to CatalogPage for admin detection\n- Add comprehensive tests for usePluginDetail hook (8 tests) and\n  PluginDetailModal component (17 tests)\n- Update CatalogPage and InstalledPage tests with modal mock\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba51fc768875e59ebe2ea04825fadf3f9d37e70a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/ba51fc768875e59ebe2ea04825fadf3f9d37e70a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/50c62cdaf8761ad32fb5e10837915c965d02eaad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https: