ceived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/fef8a37cfad8eb37fdb56452c95902c22dab6e96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T12:13:58Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T12:13:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Phase 4 — Installed Plugins page with table, health checks, and admin detection (#37)\n\n* feat: Phase 4 — Installed Plugins page with table, health checks, and admin detection\n\n- Add InstalledPlugin types and extend useInstalledPluginNames to return raw MODULE_FEDERATION_CONFIG entries\n- Create useInstalledPlugins hook composing installed names + catalog metadata + K8s deployment health checks\n- Replace InstalledPage placeholder with PF6 table showing name, version, status, maintenance, and admin-only actions\n- Parse remoteEntry URLs to resolve deployment namespace/service for health status (running/degraded/stopped/unknown)\n- Admin detection via useCurrentUser.isAdmin controls action column visibility\n- Add 15 hook tests and 25 page tests covering loading/error/empty states, admin vs non-admin, search, and health status\n- Update CatalogPage test mocks for new entries field in useInstalledPluginNames return type\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: stabilize useEffect dependency in useInstalledPlugins health check\n\nUse a serialized entriesKey (scope names joined) instead of the entries\narray reference to prevent unnecessary re-fetches of deployment health.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address architecture review findings (round 1)\n\n- Tighten parseRemoteEntryUrl to match full svc.cluster.local suffix\n  instead of just .local (avoids false positives on mDNS hostnames)\n- Remove unused ModuleFederationEntry re-export from useInstalledPluginNames\n- Add test for non-K8s .local hostname rejection\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address code quality review findings (round 2)\n\n- Add field validation for MODULE_FEDERATION_CONFIG entries (filter\n  invalid objects instead of unsafe cast)\n- Add cancelled flag to health check effect to prevent stale state\n  updates after abort\n- Add retry support to useInstalledPluginNames via fetchCount trigger\n- Wire up refetch in useInstalledPlugins to call both namesRefetch\n  and catalogRefetch so the Retry button retries the actual failing\n  operation\n- Update test mocks to include new refetch field\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(bff): remove orphaned K8s types from types.ts (#43)\n\nK8sMetadata, K8sResource, and K8sList became dead code after the\nnamespaceSummary endpoint was removed. No other file imports from\nbff/src/types.ts, so the file is deleted entirely.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(bff): remove dead k8sRequest function from k8sClient (#45)\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: extract shared maintenance label logic to utility (#44)\n\n* refactor: extract shared maintenance label logic to utility\n\nMoves maintenanceLabelColor and maintenanceDisplayText into\nsrc/app/utils/maintenance.ts and imports them in both CatalogPage\nand InstalledPage, eliminating the duplicated inline logic.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address review findings — remove JSDoc comments and blank line\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(hooks): exclude catalogError from blocking error field (#46)\n\ncatalogError was included in the combined error field, causing a\nfull-page danger alert when the BFF is unreachable but no plugins\nare installed. catalogError is already exposed separately and handled\nwith an inline warning banner.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(hooks): reset healthLoading when entries are empty (#47)\n\nhealthLoading could get stuck at true after a cancel + empty entries\nsequence because the early return path did not reset it.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(hooks): log warning when deployment health check returns 404 (#48)\n\nThe health check assumes Service and Deployment share the same name.\nWhen they differ, the lookup silently 404s and shows \"Unknown\" status\nwith no diagnostic. This adds a console.warn on 404 to surface the\nmismatch.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(hooks): separate catalogByName memo from healthMap-dependent memo (#49)\n\nExtract catalogByName into its own useMemo so the Map is only rebuilt\nwhen catalogPlugins changes, not on every healthMap update.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dfce0c9ff89f3644131dea342a62bb44dba4b3c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/dfce0c9ff89f3644131dea342a62bb44dba4b3c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/fef8a37cfad8eb37fdb56452c95902c22dab6e96","verification":{"payload":"tree dfce0c9ff89f3644131dea342a62bb44dba4b3c1\nparent 386d18bcef7a6d748733c8afb161266230d65350\nparent f252265db544b08dc431f62e6185c4e4f2299266\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784290438 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784290438 -0400\n\nfeat: Phase 4 — Installed Plugins page with table, health checks, and admin detection (#37)\n\n* feat: Phase 4 — Installed Plugins page with table, health checks, and admin detection\n\n- Add InstalledPlugin types and extend useInstalledPluginNames to return raw MODULE_FEDERATION_CONFIG entries\n- Create useInstalledPlugins hook composing installed names + catalog metadata + K8s deployment health checks\n- Replace InstalledPage placeholder with PF6 table showing name, version, status, maintenance, and admin-only actions\n- Parse remoteEntry URLs to resolve deployment namespace/service for health status (running/degraded/stopped/unknown)\n- Admin detection via useCurrentUser.isAdmin controls action column visibility\n- Add 15 hook tests and 25 page tests covering loading/error/empty states, admin vs non-admin, search, and health status\n- Update CatalogPage test mocks for new entries field in useInstalledPluginNames return type\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: stabilize useEffect dependency in useInstalledPlugins h