label logic to utility (#44)\n\n* refactor: extract shared maintenance label logic to utility\n\nMoves maintenanceLabelColor and maintenanceDisplayText into\nsrc/app/utils/maintenance.ts and imports them in both CatalogPage\nand InstalledPage, eliminating the duplicated inline logic.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address review findings — remove JSDoc comments and blank line\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(hooks): exclude catalogError from blocking error field (#46)\n\ncatalogError was included in the combined error field, causing a\nfull-page danger alert when the BFF is unreachable but no plugins\nare installed. catalogError is already exposed separately and handled\nwith an inline warning banner.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(hooks): reset healthLoading when entries are empty (#47)\n\nhealthLoading could get stuck at true after a cancel + empty entries\nsequence because the early return path did not reset it.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(hooks): log warning when deployment health check returns 404 (#48)\n\nThe health check assumes Service and Deployment share the same name.\nWhen they differ, the lookup silently 404s and shows \"Unknown\" status\nwith no diagnostic. This adds a console.warn on 404 to surface the\nmismatch.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(hooks): separate catalogByName memo from healthMap-dependent memo (#49)\