ure `error` from `useInstalledPluginNames` (renamed to\n`installedError` to avoid conflict with `useCatalog`''s error) and\nrender an inline PatternFly warning Alert when the K8s API call fails.\nThe catalog remains fully usable — only the install badges may be\nmissing — so the alert is non-blocking (inline, not a page replacement).\n\nCloses #27\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWUVqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFVkQAKCDwekasw5MOAONE8Q+18bc\nUid9y50boXBPi8Er4KBecWu7TsnewJnDoWTMmTuviTqFN2N0X7eiqvyJJYBsEJMK\nFhi9LZr8XuEHBn+xNqk2/RMp3MP8lN4zVaOVqGJriF5d7sIpVzXvsxJPFmN3bX+2\nlqshbFsg0ZM0fweUjOvXtPOJ6dVKoCL1iBDQX2FZhQBVV/8N2b/h7mSgTCK2mEsp\nAgzxYzU6ISWg7B+PS+XGQfkWKf1UcfYRudAhHDYbQzNX0fUTbjsP3P3GPwRO0ZhX\nm07AVBIYp/rEGvPKYbGi8XcWxxtDTrfu5QMDtSqvyUUNX2a6VU0WgIxk21cPnB3G\nBcXSd574xFbqSWxLaAJlEqCGmA+gCTKnf4Tr7jJWzklEPQvKWhvA/XO2GTQiAOwp\ni+ZTHmHmpYFCfUBQhx0LEGPMY5ZB1YseWZtuQ8h0g7QoqHT0Dk2l6hV8hFmILDks\nvhlcmk5oygRfruZJmztObtRsIU8NtaEQHTS596DUDo23XJDfwjDAgzXRv4O85omG\n3OERxMY6w+dG+odalQ8cpW0OQwRRJB5/baTBaZDXQhD3OjSGL9TcJnjA68jAaN//\nt7DjKzPHkh9eFdFXPawYYcRcRG8yeYJ4coGERtmtkf8JeynMQxB5924o+Ev+RLLF\nVpZCMJNsAzjmCsEKpFCe\n=yHFn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T20:56:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/receiv