 new Set()`, causing \"Installed\" badges\nto flash absent-to-present and the install-state filter to misclassify every\nplugin as \"available\" during the race window.\n\nAdds a regression test covering the race condition scenario.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWUQxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAItgQAHOMcEmZHcXvFTOj2glJ4jC9\noFiNDKhuK6BBdcc58/qr73DFiKwHqIDyhkxVnIY7W/op413Y3tW/nwbGOEJ+2NMI\nsS1fxaocBYbO4Oyvdj4MiGPqVvlsnlQvWKAhK/nwEfH59Z9+ZKxUxd01i2Uqc/Ck\nVEdb7Vo4mziBK04ribvGdkZY5frhkTMQHVdUYOxINjwGuyr0dEblO2e+cBLZqz5P\nZnLToBa/qIeUy/5GgCYfulriYMfklcrtUOUtk9K1uBvni4BpX1B4EbeWUeNI36lc\niCZM1IgM9Ik7tb3ZyG+CukkbGW2susvQpWii5L3ZiaKPtGi3Yn9kq1wRssMRivPe\nkfSWqbm4yzoEJ7vtdd0Eb8RBt9UxhRiC/rQiMpvX5todqqKTiKwpqCV2qJ5J9x6J\nxSX5urKHMsMiQXvUviekk6+rXGdrSp8auiaYbDe24DJetFwlAuRLKLpDStlwScfq\nFP1teVMuJIl6/m8JQCTCYSAfUiPHwmDHQESjlox2EI36PmFjaX9GW1NlCIVKTW1+\ncfQdOMvYTPiDA1CLpAgEbJ8J+Ne+3jOKkPpio+nDjNVH5kFbk1//rGfriKbHtDId\nn4wujQwliPoCf6WrMcFKJm4dsagRqoxJhWXutX9AgxbJNKfpna6Fmiy4v0RC6q9q\n1zOvs6ZlyqQSNGY6VSQI\n=mURQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T20:50:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.gi