ommit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T20:47:01Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T20:47:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(catalog): distinguish initial load from refetch to prevent UI flash (#34)\n\nAdd `isRefetching` state to `useCatalog` so only the first fetch sets\n`loading=true`. Subsequent user-triggered refetches set `isRefetching=true`\ninstead, keeping the existing card grid and any open `PluginDetailModal`\nmounted. `CatalogPage` now disables the Refresh button and shows a small\ninline toolbar spinner while `isRefetching` is true instead of replacing\nthe entire page with a full-page spinner.\n\nCloses #24\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"806295b299f27d8a90c4555fa013e6eddab36d57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/806295b299f27d8a90c4555fa013e6eddab36d57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/df8abf4d25cecd2504f441106cb0942ac864dab8","verification":{"payload":"tree 806295b299f27d8a90c4555fa013e6eddab36d57\nparent d539f596ff71172b77f293e9fd32ba7a7f997aff\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784234821 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784234821 -0400\n\nfix(catalog): distinguish initial load from refetch to prevent UI flash (#34)\n\nAdd `isRefetching` state to `useCatalog` so only the first fetch sets\n`loading=true`. Subsequent user-triggered refetches set `isRefetching=true`\ninstead, keeping the existing card grid and any open `PluginDetailModal`\nmounted. `CatalogPage` now disables the Refresh button and shows a small\ninline toolbar spinner while `isRefetching` is true instead of replacing\nthe entire page with a full-page spinner.\n\nCloses #24\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWUNFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAN/EQAFzaHLYmYGWCNug6zVdQuG+h\nfnfxqL3alaYY1rl1Ry4clxVQ/sgUsJU+Tdw7sM6M6jYB5ksNpJTnB/1NgXKzmSyD\nglLGfzYmML6MLlfyJNZhqRIe7d2fHGK9/gPxDGndoETuBLuMXVa2ck7lw+MNI/i+\ntphkAccGm6fZAF9yQXhOVdLx6O7DNUJTxFEbiwpTxjBBD9x/XsulKglbAcvdF0Wp\nKtwpK+xmujLktLfsWp8kPB9DDi/ReATFjylhX4mlTRIiveuIum1ww8huTOPGbNaP\nCLTAxiEGELc+Cwn8xBSJmKTcAIYqezanLsSy5uJRIThC8vIX7WeNofW3S8wkOQNN\nAyxgRqY9zXFY2gy11Z4ZTXMDLh4jlF3rkHBlTOAo1NHHWfxhujuSnWImYueRedd4\niqkwXMqNXW2Cx5+tMUZM62CG8x/FOd/V0ULtSbuIYIiNaCfWg+BOmRpEo7wR9Cey\ncMepwD+rHbQ1l/zRHDDWhz0kziPyY0W28n95ogqNyzlIEhdhkbtYMbx+HUs8BLjU\nJ1cpR8eace9xT0IQTUwHwZRW6DjYXaCl1EOLF9j5jhWiiFjEvR8eUd760Utf+lrt\n0cLvCo990tUjA3AQIzEskqv+UUY38l3HzmsJFYEXJHdIohhv3aGkULfv/i7gECOg\nTGnutEc+EWfEhA5lgN9q\n=b2za\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T20:47:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commit/df8abf4d25cecd2504f441106cb0942ac864dab8","node_id":"C_kwDOTaij69oAKGRmOGFiZjRkMjVjZWNkMjUwNGY0NDExMDZjYjA5NDJhYzg2NGRhYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commit/d539f596ff71172b77f293e9fd32ba7a7f997aff","sha":"d539f596ff71172b77f293e9fd32ba7a7f997aff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/d539f596ff71172b77f293e9fd32ba7a7f997aff"}],"sha":"df8abf4d25cecd2504f441106cb0942ac864dab8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/df8abf4d25cecd2504f441106cb0942ac864dab8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/d539f596ff71172b77f293e9fd32ba7a7f997aff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T20:39:53Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T20:39:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(hooks): normalize scope to kebab-case in useInstalledPluginNames (#33)\n\nMODULE_FEDERATION_CONFIG entries carry a camelCase scope (e.g.\ncommunityPluginsAdmin) while the charter registry identifies plugins\nby their kebab-case name (e.g. community-plugins-admin).  The Set\nbuilt by useInstalledPluginNames was populated with raw scope values,\nso installedNames.has(plugin.name) in CatalogPage always missed —\nno plugin ever received the \"Installed\" badge.\n\nFix: add a scopeToKebab helper that inserts a hyphen before each\nuppercase letter and lowercases the result, then apply it when\nmapping MODULE_FEDERATION_CONFIG entries into the installed-names Set.\n\nUpdate tests: mock scope updated to realistic camelCase\n(communityPluginsAdmin), dedicated scopeToKebab unit tests added.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c99d5751d6472eb5a1f3426fc3fe553bac05880","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/8c99d5751d6472eb5a1f3426fc3fe553bac05880"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/d539f596ff71172b77f293e9fd32ba7a7f997aff","verification":{"payload":"tree 8c99d5751d6472eb5a1f3426fc3fe553bac05880\nparent 74488f01c9cb7711da69523ecf1f592638fae509\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784234393 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784234393 -0400\n\nfix(hooks): normalize scope to kebab-case in useInstalledPluginNames (#33)\n\nMODULE_FEDERATION_CONFIG entries carry a camelCase scope (e.g.\ncommunityPluginsAdmin) while the charter registry identifies plugins\nby their kebab-case name (e.g. community-plugins-admin).  The Set\nbuilt by useInstalledPluginNames was populated with raw scope values,\nso installedNames.has(plugin.name) in CatalogPage always missed —\nno plugin ever received the \"Installed\" badge.\n\nFix: add a scopeToKebab helper that inserts a hyphen before each\nuppercase letter and lowercases the result, then apply it when\nmapping MODULE_FEDERATION_CONFIG entries into the installed-names Set.\n\nUpdate tests: mock scope updated to realistic camelCase\n(communityPluginsAdmin), dedicated scopeToKebab unit tests added.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWUGZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1pQQAHpjgifha/Dmvq5qkN71puRP\noEN4Iv9F7Jszn07ayis2EofL7CBoe9q8uKDGxL+XYyQadjGZ4J/pkcXVvdpFYfXD\nLXYsQUAqOh6l3VS3FE+LI8vBfn23TuQWq9OvvYgTSIdXOi2LG2Z463bU9x0yTEhw\nqZfhl55FGbn/CvBd3pMOdhkksjB2ZFhVnfKzrzAS6lwFrClDa3Su2EIOoy2I1f+1\nly/T0S9iqYc+15JncQ449yjJ5PsZDU2BqEIdf6WDBey6CORSya7oJg/HbkUS9i62\nyAajKpMGBOs+KS29/IPCWnv5mQRtb2J9DqCNsoj1lnagZSbqLV0VvByLllR576I6\nJtExvVpC2+8uq04X40yo3CFdC7qQoYmZTapRULFiU3LSs/iCjNy0sGfB2sMaaj+S\nXAUwKQMsLSXrpBujq2kkTQ+IZWKcVUVm/JNNSpsP8obfZwc0ogWCZrVST/OZYfSJ\nRmL6i7PzTR3ATDQvhR1kdn4gUdQP1S3Aj4sESKfIz8hWHStx0rzuO2lqAB9vNj1t\nWiPzN98xEbX+4UH0HsOV6Y6ainb5TPYKSOe1+hzGnX6tgYexYFkl+lgu6gVEWZyG\n5cUyMLWyHxMl5o5epmMFL2va8izu2wvLnDP6LAAaW7F7iVJ86V/0278bNFT2qNUY\nUfBm/BrcXDcRxznnJIRl\n=6x4d\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T20:39:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commit/d539f596ff71172b77f293e9fd32ba7a7f997aff","node_id":"C_kwDOTaij69oAKGQ1MzlmNTk2ZmY3MTE3MmI3N2YyOTNlOWZkMzJiYTdhN2Y5OTdhZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commit/74488f01c9cb7711da69523ecf1f592638fae509","sha":"74488f01c9cb7711da69523ecf1f592638fae509","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/74488f01c9cb7711da69523ecf1f592638fae509"}],"sha":"d539f596ff71172b77f293e9fd32ba7a7f997aff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/d539f596ff71172b77f293e9fd32ba7a7f997aff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/74488f01c9cb7711da69523ecf1f592638fae509/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T20:33:25Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T20:33:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(catalog): use functional state updater in onFilterSelect (#32)\n\nReplace the render-time snapshot pattern with a functional updater so\nconcurrent batched updates cannot overwrite each other. Also removes the\nnow-unnecessary `currentFilters` parameter from the signature and all\ncall sites.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea9f54f23c6e101652e84e08447c6b1718122247","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/ea9f54f23c6e101652e84e08447c6b1718122247"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/74488f01c9cb7711da69523ecf1f592638fae509","verification":{"payload":"tree ea9f54f23c6e101652e84e08447c6b1718122247\nparent 7f26d6e39b7b0f5f4182b902ab53bc0ddaa727fc\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784234005 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784234005 -0400\n\nfix(catalog): use functional state updater in onFilterSelect (#32)\n\nReplace the render-time snapshot pattern with a functional updater so\nconcurrent batched updates cannot overwrite each other. Also removes the\nnow-unnecessary `currentFilters` parameter from the signature and all\ncall sites.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWUAVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXn0QADPYLdPpmj6fHVIKdK/IW5Qi\nacbhCxSfayPYUvvSG54jJFXRPTB2Y/DsbfuadsgD0xf9rmtSmWXpyUczRsmuRnVI\nTyA4IQhJfouxdyydV6QEPiL/PJdiwKpjH9wXBkzjOdSxjTmhEt43MLBKYAoQgFgS\nkppIF+p14Vntvm+j3BL4D