nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"703110049629cc4815b214ceb6bcbd7fc4114fea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/703110049629cc4815b214ceb6bcbd7fc4114fea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/7f26d6e39b7b0f5f4182b902ab53bc0ddaa727fc","verification":{"payload":"tree 703110049629cc4815b214ceb6bcbd7fc4114fea\nparent 73d1ed9d44be8b191d22a164156508b35d22b2f8\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784234002 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784234002 -0400\n\nfix(hooks): add Array.isArray guard in useInstalledPluginNames (#31)\n\nAfter JSON.parse, check the result is an array before calling .map().\nIf it is not an array, throw an Error with a clear message so the\nexisting catch block surfaces it via the error state instead of\nsilently degrading. Updated tests to assert the error is set for\nboth invalid-JSON and non-array-but-valid-JSON inputs.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWUASCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArw8QAJVOMOGEyvi/Q4dRYDKRO9gQ\nbWuJlDYpuMNxgN98yIV2Si29djD8Gu8m3LcLxfxENoMCQaKkkCnZgTpfzGIEZAZQ\nduZLta3YyaZlP7tGu03rESgIoxMB69++38O+PZMCXPRUrrabZmCclxulmUL4JiCb\nPcS+OBO84WAkZ0H4Nu4DXEAODFCqVvz2jxAXMYpRBFGUeSLY5gNnBQ4yMibVS/Bu\nBpQy39rjMa7KDaNPbkER6+Y55F17NLaQe1/dSvgM3PasGaqHrN7LZTTgfMaV2l1M\nfEwSTyaH/U6gfmb+/0DY+Qvogw6NG7RUsrSjby7q9m2nkN0SWWoIQVfxKuX7oRSQ\njoDK52CicbIxaXXat30V4fRQWGRvapU1X/1qFusfbYHq8X1Ri5owJX7NjefaqrZp\nGtJayl/DBs1TXNIomTVfsm1aYpcDWBp8RcfiHCuTYbn9ZSEcL6yAV1tBK7quq/Ni\na+d7f+RAXEAwaRkPTGa0HJnfmKr4JOBUSjPJNmXyBDM2zX2SWQZiGEC338TzgHOU\n+qe1pL+cdSJNNOQTi+NYjwqj6XQlrq0RAd0FRV/uZbbCwAZxRzUP6XhD8DG1aXs5\nCR8eF9JB3gUksll0egjXpdUa/f0MJx5hd46LnhoSX8Tqr8Wb