lowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/73d1ed9d44be8b191d22a164156508b35d22b2f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T20:33:19Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T20:33:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(webpack): add /api/k8s proxy for local dev (#30)\n\nWithout this rule the webpack dev server returns 404 for any\n/api/k8s/* request, silently breaking useInstalledPluginNames\n(and any other hook that talks to the K8s API through the\ndashboard proxy) during local development. Proxy the path to\nthe dashboard host at localhost:8443 — the same target used by\nthe /community-plugins-admin rule — so the installed-plugin\ndetection flow is fully exercisable in a dev environment.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d01275be05b26daf34eb599b1ccbbba7435bc81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/5d01275be05b26daf34eb599b1ccbbba7435bc81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/73d1ed9d44be8b191d22a164156508b35d22b2f8","verification":{"payload":"tree 5d01275be05b26daf34eb599b1ccbbba7435bc81\nparent d68b28cede44a30b199e757030b6fd16c720f0e5\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784233999 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784233999 -0400\n\nfix(webpack): add /api/k8s proxy for local dev (#30)\n\nWithout this rule the webpack dev server returns 404 for any\n/api/k8s/* request, silently breaking useInstalledPluginNames\n(and any other hook that talks to the K8s API through the\ndashboard proxy) during local development. Proxy the path to\nthe dashboard host at localhost:8443 — the same target used by\nthe /community-plugins-admin rule — so the installed-plugin\ndetection flow is fully exercisable in a dev environment.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWUAPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnKwQAG7k5leL05xC6tyetpy8RZ/Q\ndmHNS2OAyxG1ZyFCZSm+ri7zlv0DtiaszDwJ53hla+VmKzfVSm2uR7mTjeil/CG1\nXekzHefOBKpI8L3PwwSooK7gquwhEPj5/yJzXdb+6e8pOt45BxN+yuJDp145evJ/\naHcRXjw+a+excIgHeLuq9Iq6inzyjdwBuJ3Cpmhl5O8VoBZ1y8XK7F5fhRd+Ptu6\nxaCkJICbAmfzGbd209Bhngc3idkl0vt7wtG5d1N3DJ8Ktm2uUvQ2iN2vs1xVpuiE\n+abcZ4DqBLMuj+1CjW05dDZoPJIZaqyYn0DI0AdLzhh/cmmPY1/hMjwwOsFpHl0e\nnMP+KaoPSlnZOoOVv3GCaE9yBsxe4h692dEcmp5s0wpi4Fg2Eey0E4qQKgo6s5sg\n8dOew2L4a2lF/PF1YZ4I/o/3FBA3oRbnfvRZkxraX760AniWE+8A2nuApQMGBx+x\nZHMFgdxygPHwao8wgYgjK3IeZ3mh+vw6EstxOcxAy1WSnXoH9lCdrTswdHycaJVB\nMtFlF4uyOZbyKrRWU6EsAAP3Guq1184s6KPoliBH8Cy34qBWchISkb3oo813Qfe8\nYs20PVZhOy3XXylESZ7SpbhIzMAg3sbjm9W6GvvNl+OSa3z0N50f26b5J7RNQETL\nJULnBwItBDlhbKTBBF7A\n=4FyY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T20:33:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://ap