.com>","tree":{"sha":"532efb572624cc472a686bbef4afab2613c69a83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/532efb572624cc472a686bbef4afab2613c69a83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/c6560f54803e6ad0d933950aa1dba468a9fbbcbd","verification":{"payload":"tree 532efb572624cc472a686bbef4afab2613c69a83\nparent d51c8a403ccc61bf3faa8c2efc671faca5d28b2c\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784229821 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784229821 -0400\n\nfix(bff): add aggregate failure detection to catalog endpoint (#20)\n\nWhen more than 50% of plugin metadata fetches fail (e.g., due to GitHub\nrate-limiting), the GET /api/catalog response now includes a warnings\narray with a human-readable message. HTTP status remains 200 so cached\nor partial results are still served; the warnings field lets consumers\ndetect the degraded state and surface it to operators.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWS+9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANQsQAAUsFNqF74JS6fLtR2SuUc+S\nbf1iqQE4Y9oJ2ECoCDKLaOnHV4GGT1FiTejo2QAvuMn49+PNkzpzMSo8HPiIOpQ4\nGPJhfeUZcRFVrfP7vMHbyFRTs58M4Igy8CKdWRvzjpqGnmo5VzfT6/thdHOKU0Gf\nRmidUYm6rJhbiTzbCf/UM84JuIGSlBPdiuD9eKNiFWrNL25p7khGwsgYtpm8awjG\n8DeOj04GsOSwWEGHFm+6Bc/YykuqkdM4ab47V7CcTzsKSfJNJwDu3uuDVySjDXxT\nis7t3l5Fq9RNDMSuQ37L40tRlN5jo8Oa+3icxiGDEACvB0ghoXdhd4JkM+hmFYaw\nJowYXE8gU0W00GF2bnqvNHH28r9M8Gu4EIKKx4RTGVFmUZpPKuIpzWPcZ5QPZkX3\nSClEXA+WVi/gntqrtGWLL/R+UzhHAZnBVLCwe1y+U7VTmvsV0h6N8tnIBXaUzkPZ\nHWf8R17yQEFAwfZk0k1c8Q/EGFcNLYGT04SIZdu6CIrmtIkYzkYaMdBaudSRT/BR\nqAPbTmLjv7w4HR3npbaWGN+DNQ2NIVW/SE3KDA/Cpo2fN+Gf5ldXYu6s0OXd1x90\nyW3wqkMEYL5q6qXKrieZy4J/EKi8GQfMoGAAOY3fOXdN3dEMqpN0YIGCTSqgwdpQ\njwXQK/V1UO1YEBw9bwSr\n=qgMi\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":tru