url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/d51c8a403ccc61bf3faa8c2efc671faca5d28b2c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T19:20:43Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T19:20:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(bff): use getPluginMetadata directly for single-plugin lookup (#19)\n\nThe GET /:name handler was calling getAllPluginMetadata([registryEntry]) —\nrunning the full batch concurrency machinery (runWithConcurrency worker\nsetup, results array, Map construction) for a single plugin. Switch to\ncalling getPluginMetadata(registryEntry) directly, which already handles\ncaching identically and returns the result without the batch overhead.\n\nUpdate catalogRoutes tests to mock getPluginMetadata instead of\ngetAllPluginMetadata for the single-plugin test cases.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"286a02101e6f0fe26f3335ed325691a835753504","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/286a02101e6f0fe26f3335ed325691a835753504"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/d51c8a403ccc61bf3faa8c2efc671faca5d28b2c","verification":{"payload":"tree 286a02101e6f0fe26f3335ed325691a835753504\nparent 325992a11f748d4c5fd589c3f551569522f20644\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784229643 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784229643 -0400\n\nrefactor(bff): use getPluginMetadata directly for single-plugin lookup (#19)\n\nThe GET /:name handler was calling getAllPluginMetadata([registryEntry]) —\nrunning the full batch concurrency machinery (runWithConcurrency worker\nsetup, results array, Map construction) for a single plugin. Switch to\ncalling getPluginMetadata(registryEntry) directly, which already handles\ncaching identically and returns the result without the batch overhead.\n\nUpdate catalogRoutes tests to mock getPluginMetadata instead of\ngetAllPluginMetadata for the single-plugin test cases.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWS8LCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdmEQACPuk21+siBN81z/COtZGoIT\nLkcv+M149VKDzJZFGGDbrvR0kqMPZIvq1VlzYnPfVnVb/kVKNtEisKjMz4zCTDCO\nYcsvfjVuX5i6EqIPH3z+Md+rnBLazRTdqmTUhOkttzZlBfqFQ6uz/YGRZTudVMUS\nTzDzdAWPoPjspHRN+x9t3YiEcwUnzymz/wCMizlmc3MUF/8fUvkjaevjjePP2KD+\nZawHV5G43d2yuGUoSQUEFEhV0HGv5VPbUewDRabAvo2qSF+JOg0unLFoNbWsSAGI\nBn2jHx9bkBHYSmD1mfzqb/aN3JYNPGAG+Fxl+Q/n+IuVkEe6cFmRV2wp0zl3dKeF\nfAXNk+g2CRlvAod3TPH/DARndJb6AGMzsazEgolfec0ibnYyCGuYSSNUkYFw/tkA\nLQTOIljVn9VGVSU/ws0GRAEUy80QgXauLz0rJvrA9jZWSs+0gYHIFuqmlA6aUGT3\n3qhbg9ie+WQw03IbmQQUWBERyErZ9YbSnnsxM0Bd7dJ3sd5Vq24IFF+z3dEfx++D\nNWEvDcg588b/Mvm8Kt4VDWC0M6kDponNj0Fion9ityfDl9bbL00a0kV2PZDUDnMp\nCuL6+CWEcfi4qtbEHNDe6Ero9Jf1gRzNwe+chqFHrvB1LZQWA+j3kEFeHZX+Aqnf\nGOgplN1MNnJI9Z51uPX5\n=qWmU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T19:20:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https:/