b.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commit/88be38ed2d0387c087e3bb8d736bfc1bac3783da","sha":"88be38ed2d0387c087e3bb8d736bfc1bac3783da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/88be38ed2d0387c087e3bb8d736bfc1bac3783da"}],"sha":"dceeaecbadc0c50c45c7fdf8cff76d6c4c36a061","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/dceeaecbadc0c50c45c7fdf8cff76d6c4c36a061"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/commits/88be38ed2d0387c087e3bb8d736bfc1bac3783da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T19:13:54Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T19:13:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(bff): preserve stale-cache fallback on refresh (#15)\n\nWhen ?refresh=true was passed, clearCharterCache() nulled the cache\nbefore getRegistryPlugins() attempted a fresh fetch. If the fetch\nfailed, the stale-cache fallback found cache===null and rethrew,\nreturning 502 even though valid data existed moments before.\n\nFix by adding a forceRefresh parameter to getRegistryPlugins(). When\ntrue, the function skips the TTL check but captures the current cache\nin a local staleCache variable before fetching. On failure the stale\ndata is returned as before. The route no longer calls clearCharterCache;\nit passes forceRefresh directly, keeping invalidation deferred until\na successful fetch updates the cache.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a54f860de24d6065c67fd38734ccaed29649f9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/trees/8a54f860de24d6065c67fd38734ccaed29649f9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/community-plugins-admin/git/commits/88be38ed2d0387c087e3bb8d736bfc1bac3783da","verification":{"payload":"tree 8a54f860de24d6065c67fd38734ccaed29649f9c\nparent 0d5ae1d7e792cc5bd6fba4e1e47101936edcf218\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784229234 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784229234 -0400\n\nfix(bff): preserve stale-cache fallback on refresh (#15)\n\nWhen ?refresh=true was passed, clearCharterCache() nulled the cache\nbefore getRegistryPlugins() attempted a fresh fetch. If the fetch\nfailed, the stale-cache fallback found cache===null and rethrew,\nreturning 502 even though valid data existed moments before.\n\nFix by adding a forceRefresh parameter to getRegistryPlugins(). When\ntrue, the function skips the TTL check but captures the current cache\nin a local staleCache variable before fetching. On failure the stale\ndata is returned as before. The route no longer calls clearCharterCache;\nit passes forceRefresh directly, keeping invalidation deferred until\na successful fetch updates the cache.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.g