d supports it)\n\nState persisted in route query (?contentSearch=true) so it survives\nnavigation to search results list view.\n\nServer-side: content: queries are stripped by default (stripContentQuery).\nFuture: X-Content-Search header to route to qdrant backend.","tree":{"sha":"4e7764d89b84504a2674f2345308329fbb0dfc96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/4e7764d89b84504a2674f2345308329fbb0dfc96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/commits/c5282a12c276754c30c1315ce53dcb0b484c1640","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/c5282a12c276754c30c1315ce53dcb0b484c1640","node_id":"C_kwDOTak3z9oAKGM1MjgyYTEyYzI3Njc1NGMzMGMxMzE1Y2U1M2RjYjBiNDg0YzE2NDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/3a98e32441d2538efc79219540ca2c713154cc83","sha":"3a98e32441d2538efc79219540ca2c713154cc83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/3a98e32441d2538efc79219540ca2c713154cc83"}],"sha":"c5282a12c276754c30c1315ce53dcb0b484c1640","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/c5282a12c276754c30c1315ce53dcb0b484c1640"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/3a98e32441d2538efc79219540ca2c713154cc83/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T16:00:59Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T16:00:59Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"fix: default search filter to currentSpace (was allFiles in SearchBarFilter)","tree":{"sha":"a3b56468122ba6e1d93616e69baa750e4e9b63bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/a3b56468122ba6e1d93616e69baa750e4e9b63bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud