g all shares blindly.\nOn subspace root: filter direct shares (shown as subspace members).\nInside subspace: no special filtering needed — reva handles it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"33437fe402ccc9379def627b1fb919cabf008532","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/33437fe402ccc9379def627b1fb919cabf008532"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/commits/4fc4e81777585c89cd24e4e19e298c6a933f4745","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/4fc4e81777585c89cd24e4e19e298c6a933f4745","node_id":"C_kwDOTak3z9oAKDRmYzRlODE3Nzc1ODVjODljZDI0ZTRlMTllMjk4YzZhOTMzZjQ3NDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/7bdfcce01455080bdaf73585dbe60e6fa0f58c76","sha":"7bdfcce01455080bdaf73585dbe60e6fa0f58c76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/7bdfcce01455080bdaf73585dbe60e6fa0f58c76"}],"sha":"4fc4e81777585c89cd24e4e19e298c6a933f4745","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/4fc4e81777585c89cd24e4e19e298c6a933f4745"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/7bdfcce01455080bdaf73585dbe60e6fa0f58c76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T07:56:16Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T07:56:16Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"fix: use props instead of this in setup() — fixes spinner hang\n\nthis.successMessage and this.errorMessage were used inside setup()\nwhere this is undefined. The error crashed the share completion\nhandler, leaving the spinner spinning forever.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c75947d744b9104feed38