,"email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T16:46:54Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"feat: check share permission for write-back job pipelines\n\nPipelines that create shares (most write-back pipelines) now check\ncanShare() before showing the action. Pipelines with readOnly:true\nskip the check since they don''t need share permission.\n\nThis prevents showing job actions in spaces where the user has no\nshare permission (e.g. viewer role in a project space).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c34edfb2c09be81d0602f79603f008e9c9ab511","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/5c34edfb2c09be81d0602f79603f008e9c9ab511"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/commits/6f8e6895dd8471127b3f4c574dea3efaa0f5d61e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/6f8e6895dd8471127b3f4c574dea3efaa0f5d61e","node_id":"C_kwDOTak3z9oAKDZmOGU2ODk1ZGQ4NDcxMTI3YjNmNGM1NzRkZWEzZWZhYTBmNWQ2MWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/368c3af70075f1985d485b385db374b84ba476e0","sha":"368c3af70075f1985d485b385db374b84ba476e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/368c3af70075f1985d485b385db374b84ba476e0"}],"sha":"6f8e6895dd8471127b3f4c574dea3efaa0f5d61e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/6f8e6895dd8471127b3f4c574dea3efaa0f5d61e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/368c3af70075f1985d485b385db374b84ba476e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T14:46:56Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T14:46:56Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"