0788fd58d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/70cf825ebafe2333698dba54b8904f0788fd58d2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/f912f790538979448c9c4778da2204897464432f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T10:15:27Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T10:20:04Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"feat(web-pkg): add title slot to ResourceTable and ResourceTile\n\nAdds a scoped slot #title that wraps the ResourceListItem in both\ntable and tile views. The slot receives the full Resource object\n(including extraProps with all WebDAV metadata). The default content\nis the existing ResourceListItem.\n\nFollows each component''s existing slot-prop convention:\n- ResourceTable: #title=\"{ resource }\"\n- ResourceTile: #title=\"{ item }\"\n\nExtensions override the slot to fully control name rendering.\nNo new extension types, no domain knowledge in web-pkg.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74f72c9312c2aea02e7144aa1e950dad8f319374","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/74f72c9312c2aea02e7144aa1e950dad8f319374"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/commits/f912f790538979448c9c4778da2204897464432f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/f912f790538979448c9c4778da2204897464432f","node_id":"C_kwDOTak3z9oAKGY5MTJmNzkwNTM4OTc5NDQ4YzljNDc3OGRhMjIwNDg5NzQ2NDQzMmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/c2ebcd7ce119a2b57893ccf11854f4cecfcbb55f","sha":"c2ebcd7ce119a2b57893ccf11854f4cecfcbb55f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/c2ebcd7ce119a2b57893ccf1185