omments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T10:00:25Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T10:00:25Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"feat(reva): implement parent-metadata lookup for om:parent-* properties\n\nBatch-stats parent nodes when om:parent-* properties are requested,\nresolving parent metadata (e.g. parent-aktencode) from the parent folder''s\nxattrs and including it in PROPFIND/search responses.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b638ed7259ee7b2956f4127f5ea0de60a493d67b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/b638ed7259ee7b2956f4127f5ea0de60a493d67b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/commits/9ea911e2ae191a6e58dc83ca9c8cd60641acf135","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/9ea911e2ae191a6e58dc83ca9c8cd60641acf135","node_id":"C_kwDOTak3z9oAKDllYTkxMWUyYWUxOTFhNmU1OGRjODNjYTljOGNkNjA2NDFhY2YxMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/12692ab9bfd2e3ec53bc52e5c35b66724f50952f","sha":"12692ab9bfd2e3ec53bc52e5c35b66724f50952f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/12692ab9bfd2e3ec53bc52e5c35b66724f50952f"}],"sha":"9ea911e2ae191a6e58dc83ca9c8cd60641acf135","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/9ea911e2ae191a6e58dc83ca9c8cd60641acf135"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/12692ab9bfd2e3ec53bc52e5c35b66724f50952f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T08:05:55Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T08:05:55Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"feat: implement om: namespace in web-client and reva\n\nWeb-client (builders.ts):\n- Add xmlns:om declaration for opencloud metadata namespace\n- Route om:-prefixed extraProps through om: XML namespace\n- Only include xmlns:om when om: props are present\n- Support om: in both PROPFIND and PROPPATCH bodies\n\nReva (submodule):\n- Add NsOwncloudMetadata constant\n- requiresExplicitFetching: om: always true (no whitelist needed)\n- metadataKeyOf: om: → short key (clean xattr paths)\n- metadataKeys: separate parent- keys for future parent-node lookup\n- proppatch: om: properties use short keys\n\nTests:\n- 12 new tests for builders.ts covering om: namespace handling\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0f8b3f3a69766de748f547eb2382259f898b5fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/a0f8b3f3a69766de748f547eb2382259f898b5fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/commits/12692ab9bfd2e3ec53bc52e5c35b66724f50952f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/12692ab9bfd2e3ec53bc52e5c35b66724f50952f","node_id":"C_kwDOTak3z9oAKDEyNjkyYWI5YmZkMmUzZWM1M2JjNTJlNWMzNWI2NjcyNGY1MDk1MmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/fac0a2f91bdc51ceaf92483d233ef0391a8de815","sha":"fac0a2f91bdc51ceaf92483d233ef0391a8de815","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/fac0a2f91bdc51ceaf92483d233ef0391a8de815"}],"sha":"12692ab9bfd2e3ec53bc52e5c35b66724f50952f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/12692ab9bfd2e3ec53bc52e5c35b66724f50952f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/fac0a2f91bdc51ceaf92483d233ef0391a8de815/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T07:51:53Z","email":"flash777