eb/commits/decbf69a7167d6a2444b7ca69791d1c54eba3707"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/22a4947b710a8f758836063e9844e5e85024913a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T10:13:49Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T10:13:49Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"feat: appTheme URL-Parameter für Session-Theme-Override\n\nNeuer URL-Parameter ?appTheme=<label> erzwingt ein bestimmtes Theme\nfür die aktuelle Session, ohne die User-Preference zu überschreiben.\n\nAnwendungsfall: Tauri/Desktop-App navigiert den Cloud-WebView zu\n  https://cloud.example.com/files?appTheme=Windows%2011%20Light\nund die Cloud-UI erscheint im Plattform-Theme.\n\n- Priorität: appTheme > localStorage > System-Preference > Default\n- localStorage wird bei aktivem appTheme nicht verändert\n- Abwärtskompatibel: ohne Parameter verhält sich alles wie bisher\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"364d7000301f8771cd0530e77bab0b4f4fd33c12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/364d7000301f8771cd0530e77bab0b4f4fd33c12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/commits/22a4947b710a8f758836063e9844e5e85024913a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/22a4947b710a8f758836063e9844e5e85024913a","node_id":"C_kwDOTak3z9oAKDIyYTQ5NDdiNzEwYThmNzU4ODM2MDYzZTk4NDRlNWU4NTAyNDkxM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/808d327ef41496e9048365d3203bfe59b827417d","sha":"808d327ef41496e9048365d3203bfe59b827417d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/808d327ef41496e9048365d3203bfe59b827417d"}],"sha":"22a4947b710a8f758836063e9844e5e85024913a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/22a4947b710a8f758836063e9844e5e85024913a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/808d327ef41496e9048365d3203bfe59b827417d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T10:02:51Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T10:02:51Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"feat: Windows 11 Plattform-Theme Prototyp (Light + Dark)\n\nErstes Plattform-Theme als Proof of Concept für customStylesheet.\nEnthält Win11-spezifische Overrides für border-radius, backdrop-filter,\nhover-Effekte, Scrollbars, Shadows, Input-Focus, Animationen, Typography.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9683f5ee8d52c6b632ae8a2be156acb2e6fbe5ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/9683f5ee8d52c6b632ae8a2be156acb2e6fbe5ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/commits/808d327ef41496e9048365d3203bfe59b827417d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/808d327ef41496e9048365d3203bfe59b827417d","node_id":"C_kwDOTak3z9oAKDgwOGQzMjdlZjQxNDk2ZTkwNDgzNjVkMzIwM2JmZTU5YjgyNzQxN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/9fc7f05d0713489b90fe633dc25cc50b6eb6d559","sha":"9fc7f05d0713489b90fe633dc25cc50b6eb6d559","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/9fc7f05d0713489b90fe633dc25cc50b6eb6d559"}],"sha":"808d327ef41496e9048365d3203bfe59b827417d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/808d327ef41496e9048365d3203bfe59b827417d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/9fc7f05d0713489b90fe633dc25cc50b6eb6d559/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T09:57:59Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T09:57:59Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"feat: customStylesheet in Theme-Config für Plattform-Themes\n\nNeues optionales Feld \"customStylesheet\" in WebDefaults/WebTheme.\nErlaubt pro Theme ein zusätzliches CSS-Sheet zu laden, z.B. für\nPlattform-Themes (Win11, macOS, GTK) die über Farb-Tokens hinaus\nborder-radius, backdrop-filter, Animationen etc. anpassen.\n\nAbwärtskompatibel: Feld ist optional, alte theme.json funktioniert.\nBeim Theme-Wechsel wird das alte Sheet entfernt und das neue geladen.\n\nBeispiel in theme.json:\n  { \"label\": \"Windows 11\", \"isDark\": false,\n    \"customStylesheet\": \"/themes/win11/overrides.css\" }\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"19680b082e1ca552b96a77ecda6912c06121d0d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/19680b082e1ca552b96a77ecda6912c06121d0d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/commits/9fc7f05d0713489b90fe633dc25cc50b6eb6d559","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/9fc7f05d0713489b90fe633dc25cc50b6eb6d559","node_id":"C_kwDOTak3z9oAKDlmYzdmMDVkMDcxMzQ4OWI5MGZlNjMzZGMyNWNjNTBiNmViNmQ1NTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/a60ada6c681bdbae761f7c0ff2d8f667633805f8","sha":"a60ada6c681bdbae761f7c0ff2d8f667633805f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/a60ada6c681bdbae761f7c0ff2d8f667633805f8"}],"sha":"9fc7f05d0713489b90fe633dc25cc50b6eb6d559","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/9fc7f05d0713489b90fe633dc25cc50b6eb6d559"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/a60ada6c681bdbae761f7c0ff2d8f667633805f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T09:23:19Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T09:23:19Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"feat: add build_web.sh, push_zip.sh, deploy_zip.sh\n\nbuild_web.sh: builds web UI\npush_zip.sh: zips + pushes to Codeberg packages\ndeploy_zip.sh: deploys ZIP to server\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"381e5d8b5df586d3334119d616742afe62697054","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/381e5d8b5df586d3334119d616742afe62697054"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/commits/a60ada6c681bdbae761f7c0ff2d8f667633805f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/a60ada6c681bdbae761f7c0ff2d8f667633805f8","node_id":"C_kwDOTak3z9oAKGE2MGFkYTZjNjgxYmRiYWU3NjFmN2MwZmYyZDhmNjY3NjMzODA1Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/e9759a4153991f2a67aa2fe739952acbf0d9d98a","sha":"e9759a4153991f2a67aa2fe739952acbf0d9d98a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/e9759a4153991f2a67aa2fe739952acbf0d9d98a"}],"sha":"a60ada6c681bdbae761f7c0ff2d8f667633805f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/a60ada6c681bdbae761f7c0ff2d8f667633805f8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/e9759a4153991f2a67aa2fe739952acbf0d9d98a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T23:00:09Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T23:00:09Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"feat: Extension-Preferences serverseitig speichern (Settings API)\n\nuseExtensionPreferencesStore nutzt jetzt die Settings API\n(/api/v0/settings/) statt nur localStorage. localStorage bleibt als Cache.\n\n- Beim Start: Preferences vom Server laden (Bundle \"extension-preferences\")\n- Beim Ändern: auf Server speichern + localStorage aktualisieren\n- Fallback: wenn Bundle nicht existiert, nur localStorage (abwärtskompatibel)\n\nBenötigt das neue Bundle auf dem Server (opencloud Commit).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"79c24bf25211e3b93083dfa963b4f61efb7c37e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/79c24bf25211e3b93083dfa963b4f61efb7c37e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/commits/e9759a4153991f2a67aa2fe739952acbf0d9d98a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/e9759a4153991f2a67aa2fe739952acbf0d9d98a","node_id":"C_kwDOTak3z9oAKGU5NzU5YTQxNTM5OTFmMmE2N2FhMmZlNzM5OTUyYWNiZjBkOWQ5OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/8adea9991c5a8aa652749a13e602fa0aac47d1f7","sha":"8adea9991c5a8aa652749a13e602fa0aac47d1f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/8adea9991c5a8aa652749a13e602fa0aac47d1f7"}],"sha":"e9759a4153991f2a67aa2fe739952acbf0d9d98a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/e9759a4153991f2a67aa2fe739952acbf0d9d98a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/8adea9991c5a8aa652749a13e602fa0aac47d1f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T16:54:50Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T16:54:50Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"fix: manifest display standalone (browser disa