ash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T13:04:48Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"feat(files): add space header extension point\n\nAdd `app.files.space-header` extension point that allows extensions\nto provide a custom component in place of the default SpaceHeader\non project space frontpages.\n\nWhen an extension registers at this point, its component is rendered\ninstead of the built-in SpaceHeader. When no extension is registered,\nthe default SpaceHeader is shown as before.\n\nThis enables folder view extensions to render their own space header\nwith domain-specific information without modifying the core.","tree":{"sha":"d1b38e811a1b45567b43e1432731e96b3eb9a850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/d1b38e811a1b45567b43e1432731e96b3eb9a850"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/commits/1721c3963a326d3bf49178d1c275673a752dafd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/1721c3963a326d3bf49178d1c275673a752dafd4","node_id":"C_kwDOTak3z9oAKDE3MjFjMzk2M2EzMjZkM2JmNDkxNzhkMWMyNzU2NzNhNzUyZGFmZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/6d47e7fea9ea9547672ad325d2d6851d5e300e28","sha":"6d47e7fea9ea9547672ad325d2d6851d5e300e28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/6d47e7fea9ea9547672ad325d2d6851d5e300e28"}],"sha":"1721c3963a326d3bf49178d1c275673a752dafd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/1721c3963a326d3bf49178d1c275673a752dafd4"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits?per_page=100&page=2&sha=c9b697388233406cddfda98a3163868b578cd9f7&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A19%3A04.863Z"}');
