sourceTable in condensed mode\n\nTree view now uses the actual ResourceTable component with\nviewMode=''resource-table-condensed'', getting all columns, sorting,\nand styling for free. Only adds:\n- Custom #name slot with expand toggle + indentation\n- Lazy child loading via PROPFIND on expand\n- Flattened visibleResources computed with _depth\n\nMetro view: simplified, uses CSS vars for theming, debug logging.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"787958292673276f5a52413cdcc68073794e147e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/787958292673276f5a52413cdcc68073794e147e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/commits/fed940e2830d96e78f3338c46472964ae6357a87","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/fed940e2830d96e78f3338c46472964ae6357a87","node_id":"C_kwDOTak3z9oAKGZlZDk0MGUyODMwZDk2ZTc4ZjMzMzhjNDY0NzI5NjRhZTYzNTdhODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/6516ae86803c05a04c5b5d4ec345d80ce3b35dd6","sha":"6516ae86803c05a04c5b5d4ec345d80ce3b35dd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/6516ae86803c05a04c5b5d4ec345d80ce3b35dd6"}],"sha":"fed940e2830d96e78f3338c46472964ae6357a87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/fed940e2830d96e78f3338c46472964ae6357a87"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/6516ae86803c05a04c5b5d4ec345d80ce3b35dd6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T13:27:54Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T13:27:54Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"fix: Metro uses theme colors, Tree has header + aligned columns\n\nMetro:\n- Background from CSS