T20:45:27Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"feat: detect .type_* from PROPFIND listing, show typed folder bar\n\nReplaces Metadata API type loading with zero-cost detection from\nthe existing PROPFIND listing. If a .type_<name> file exists among\nthe folder''s children, the type is extracted and the schema loaded.\n\nShows a typed folder bar with type label when a typed folder is\ndetected. No extra API call needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"37d95d3e36d5a46b27c67381dc99edd81255bb45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/37d95d3e36d5a46b27c67381dc99edd81255bb45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/commits/b7a3bb953454d73163df42ea3cc71c635a5a25d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/b7a3bb953454d73163df42ea3cc71c635a5a25d9","node_id":"C_kwDOTak3z9oAKGI3YTNiYjk1MzQ1NGQ3MzE2M2RmNDJlYTNjYzcxYzYzNWE1YTI1ZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/8b126b703440daa94d567d9782ae6c6c4cae761b","sha":"8b126b703440daa94d567d9782ae6c6c4cae761b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/8b126b703440daa94d567d9782ae6c6c4cae761b"}],"sha":"b7a3bb953454d73163df42ea3cc71c635a5a25d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/b7a3bb953454d73163df42ea3cc71c635a5a25d9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/8b126b703440daa94d567d9782ae6c6c4cae761b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T17:41:12Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T17:41:12Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"fix: aktenplan is one type, aktenschrank is its shielded leaf","tree":{"sha"