b5ee3a67267d84405672aef2b27b152b152d0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T20:46:54Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T16:14:16Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"feat: shielded state + icon fixes\n\n- immutableState: ''frozen'' | ''protected'' | ''shielded''\n- Quick Actions: shield for protect/unprotect, leaf for freeze\n- Indicators: shield-fill (protected), shield-line (shielded), snowflake (frozen)\n- Shielded folders can still be protected/unprotected\n- console.error if folder has frozen state (bug detection)","tree":{"sha":"1b9829cf314d04cb760c2843c6268922275da0dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/1b9829cf314d04cb760c2843c6268922275da0dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/commits/4ab5ee3a67267d84405672aef2b27b152b152d0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/4ab5ee3a67267d84405672aef2b27b152b152d0b","node_id":"C_kwDOTak3z9oAKDRhYjVlZTNhNjcyNjdkODQ0MDU2NzJhZWYyYjI3YjE1MmIxNTJkMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/287ef424886ce7fa9c803276f440fe0805e56635","sha":"287ef424886ce7fa9c803276f440fe0805e56635","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/287ef424886ce7fa9c803276f440fe0805e56635"}],"sha":"4ab5ee3a67267d84405672aef2b27b152b152d0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/4ab5ee3a67267d84405672aef2b27b152b152d0b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/287ef424886ce7fa9c803276f440fe0805e56635/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T21:16:50Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T16:13:39Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"feat(web): complete immutable state integration via WebDAV PROPFIND\n\nRead oc:immutable property from PROPFIND responses (no extra request).\nReva returns \"frozen\" (file) or \"protected\" (folder/inherited) state.\n\nData flow:\n  Reva xattr → GetImmutableState() → oc:immutable property\n  → WebDAV PROPFIND → DavProperty.Immutable\n  → resource.immutableState (\"frozen\"|\"protected\"|undefined)\n  → Quick Action icons + Indicator badges\n\nQuick Actions (hover buttons in file list):\n  File   | normal    | leaf icon       | click → freeze (confirmation dialog)\n  File   | frozen    | snowflake icon  | disabled (irreversible)\n  File   | protected | shield-fill     | disabled (parent protected)\n  Folder | normal    | shield-line     | click → protect\n  Folder | protected | shield-fill     | click → unprotect\n\nIndicators (badges next to filename):\n  frozen    → snowflake icon\n  protected → shield-fill icon\n\nChanges:\n- DavProperty.Immutable added + included in default PROPFIND request\n- Resource type: immutableState?: ''frozen'' | ''protected''\n- Resource builder: maps oc:immutable to immutableState\n- useFileActionsImmutable: 5 actions for all state combinations\n- useResourceIndicators: indicator based on immutableState\n- useFileActions: registered as quickActionsExtensionPoint (not context!)","tree":{"sha":"ce7e4a6c301207ef02af09c6efb42bfdb41dd648","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/ce7e4a6c301207ef02af09c6efb42bfdb41dd648"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/commits/287ef424886ce7fa9c803276f440fe0805e56635","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/287ef424886ce7fa9c803276f440fe0805e56635","node_id":"C_kwDOTak3z9oAKDI4N2VmNDI0ODg2Y2U3ZmE5YzgwMzI3NmY0NDBmZTA4MDVlNTY2MzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/657895afd6d8fb72734d3b24ba209f4ec3843a30","sha":"657895afd6d8fb72734d3b24ba209f4ec3843a30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/657895afd6d8fb72734d3b24ba209f4ec3843a30"}],"sha":"287ef424886ce7fa9c803276f440fe0805e56635","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/287ef424886ce7fa9c803276f440fe0805e56635"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/657895afd6d8fb72734d3b24ba209f4ec3843a30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T19:55:58Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T16:13:10Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"feat(web): immutable UI - indicators + context menu actions\n\n1. Resource model: add `immutable` boolean field\n\n2. Indicators (useResourceIndicators.ts):\n   - Frozen file: snowflake icon\n   - Protected folder: shield-check icon\n\n3. Context menu actions (useFileActionsImmutable.ts):\n   - \"Freeze file\": POST /freeze with confirmation dialog (irreversible!)\n   - \"Protect folder\": POST /protect\n   - \"Remove protection\": DELETE /protect\n\n4. Actions registered in useFileActions.ts for context menu\n\nDepends on: OpenCloud Graph API freeze/protect/unprotect endpoints\n(blocked by cs3org/cs3apis#275 - Gateway SetImmutable RPC)","tree":{"sha":"4be429fdd1f15cfbfd1bb0a981cb7fae8358b434","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/4be429fdd1f15cfbfd1bb0a981cb7fae8358b434"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/commits/657895afd6d8fb72734d3b24ba209f4ec3843a30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/657895afd6d8fb72734d3b24ba209f4ec3843a30","node_id":"C_kwDOTak3z9oAKDY1Nzg5NWFmZDZkOGZiNzI3MzRkM2IyNGJhMjA5ZjRlYzM4NDNhMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/609f633d30554fadcd4c2df150726f37397ac5f1","sha":"609f633d30554fadcd4c2df150726f37397ac5f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/609f633d30554fadcd4c2df150726f37397ac5f1"}],"sha":"657895afd6d8fb72734d3b24ba209f4ec3843a30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/657895afd6d8fb72734d3b24ba209f4ec3843a30"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/609f633d30554fadcd4c2df150726f37397ac5f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T19:30:03Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T16:12:16Z","email":"flash7777","name":"flash"},"message":"feat(web): add metadata sidebar panel\n\nNew sidebar tab \"Metadata\" that displays custom metadata (user.oc.md.*)\nfor the selected file or folder. Fetches data from the Graph API\nendpoint GET /drives/{driveID}/items/{itemID}/metadata.\n\n- MetadataPanel.vue: renders key-value pairs with formatted labels\n- useFileSideBars.ts: registers panel, visible for single item selection\n- Strips \"oy.\" prefix and converts camelCase to Title Case for display\n\nDepends on: OpenCloud Graph API metadata endpoint","tree":{"sha":"db55314d7e50e8057fbc11389da571a839e72b52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/trees/db55314d7e50e8057fbc11389da571a839e72b52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/git/commits/609f633d30554fadcd4c2df150726f37397ac5f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/609f633d30554fadcd4c2df150726f37397ac5f1","node_id":"C_kwDOTak3z9oAKDYwOWY2MzNkMzA1NTRmYWRjZDRjMmRmMTUwNzI2ZjM3Mzk3YWM1ZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commit/6faf3e94e23ba90d9ef145606db6ebdb55dc75de","sha":"6faf3e94e23ba90d9ef145606db6ebdb55dc75de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/6faf3e94e23ba90d9ef145606db6ebdb55dc75de"}],"sha":"609f633d30554fadcd4c2df150726f37397ac5f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/609f633d30554fadcd4c2df150726f37397ac5f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84779829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-scharf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-scharf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-scharf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-scharf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/v-scharf","id":84779829,"login":"v-scharf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0Nzc5ODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-scharf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-scharf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-scharf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-scharf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-scharf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-scharf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KOSMOS-OpenCloud/opencloud_web/commits/d445c30161a9282efc53e0aa03a4370a76d31809/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T14:44:39Z","email":"v.scharf@opencloud.eu","name":"Viktor Scharf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T14:44:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"e2e-test: archive uses folder name (#2694)\n\n* e2e-test: archive uses folder name\n\nrelated https://github.com/opencloud-eu/reva/pull/661\n\n* Change resource from testavatar.jpg to testavatar.png\n\n* Add OC_EVENTS_ENDPOINT to configuration","tree":{"sha":"5791b801cb9214fee49c2ae7ae90